(741, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 40, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which organ is responsible for filtering waste from the blood? <br />\r\nA) Kidney <br />\r\nB) Liver <br />\r\nC) Heart<br />\r\n D) Lung</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(742, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 41, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which type of blood vessels carry oxygenated blood away from the heart?<br />\r\n A) Arteries <br />\r\nB) Veins <br />\r\nC) Capillaries <br />\r\nD) Bronchioles</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(743, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 42, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary function of the respiratory system? <br />\r\nA) Transporting oxygen <br />\r\nB) Pumping blood <br />\r\nC) Regulating body temperature <br />\r\nD) Digesting food</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(744, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 43, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the largest organ in the human body? <br />\r\nA) Liver<br />\r\n B) Skin <br />\r\nC) Heart <br />\r\nD) Brain</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(745, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 44, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which molecule carries genetic information in living organisms? <br />\r\nA) RNA <br />\r\nB) DNA <br />\r\nC) ATP <br />\r\nD) Glucose</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(746, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 45, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which type of muscle is responsible for voluntary movements in the body? <br />\r\nA) Skeletal muscle <br />\r\nB) Smooth muscle <br />\r\nC) Cardiac muscle<br />\r\n D) Connective tissue</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(747, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 46, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is not a function of the nervous system? <br />\r\nA) Controlling body movements <br />\r\nB) Regulating body temperature <br />\r\nC) Sending and receiving signals <br />\r\nD) Maintaining heart rate</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(748, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 47, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the powerhouse of the cell? <br />\r\nA) Nucleus <br />\r\nB) Mitochondria <br />\r\nC) Golgi apparatus <br />\r\nD) Endoplasmic reticulum</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(749, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 48, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which type of reproduction involves the fusion of male and female gametes? <br />\r\nA) Asexual reproduction <br />\r\nB) Budding <br />\r\nC) Binary fission <br />\r\nD) Sexual reproduction</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(750, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 49, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which nutrient is the main source of energy for the body? <br />\r\nA) Carbohydrates <br />\r\nB) Proteins <br />\r\nC) Vitamins<br />\r\n D) Minerals</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(751, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 50, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which organ produces insulin in the human body? <br />\r\nA) Pancreas <br />\r\nB) Liver <br />\r\nC) Stomach <br />\r\nD) Gallbladder</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(752, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 51, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is not an example of a renewable resource? <br />\r\nA) Solar energy <br />\r\nB) Wind energy <br />\r\nC) Fossil fuels <br />\r\nD) Hydropower</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(753, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 52, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the process by which plants release water vapor through their leaves? <br />\r\nA) Transpiration <br />\r\nB) Condensation <br />\r\nC) Evaporation <br />\r\nD) Precipitation</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(754, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 53, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which organelle is responsible for protein synthesis in a cell? <br />\r\nA) Nucleus <br />\r\nB) Mitochondria <br />\r\nC) Endoplasmic reticulum <br />\r\nD) Golgi apparatus</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(755, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 54, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is NOT a type of blood cell? <br />\r\nA) Red blood cell <br />\r\nB) White blood cell <br />\r\nC) Platelet <br />\r\nD) Neuron</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(756, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 55, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the function of the enzyme amylase? <br />\r\nA) Breakdown of proteins <br />\r\nB) Breakdown of carbohydrates <br />\r\nC) Breakdown of lipids <br />\r\nD) Breakdown of nucleic acids</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(757, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 56, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a function of the liver? <br />\r\nA) Production of insulin <br />\r\nB) Production of bile <br />\r\nC) Production of red blood cells <br />\r\nD) Production of saliva</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(758, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 57, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is NOT a function of the skeletal system? <br />\r\nA) Support and protection <br />\r\nB) Movement <br />\r\nC) Production of blood cells <br />\r\nD) Regulation of body temperature <br />\r</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(759, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 58, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is responsible for carrying oxygen in the blood? <br />\r\nA) Hemoglobin <br />\r\nB) Insulin <br />\r\nC) Adrenaline <br />\r\nD) Estrogen <br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(760, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 59, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is responsible for the production of antibodies? <br />\r\nA) T cells <br />\r\nB) B cells <br />\r\nC) Red blood cells <br />\r\nD) Platelets <br />\r</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(761, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 60, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a characteristic of prokaryotic cells? <br />\r\nA) Presence of a nucleus <br />\r\nB) Membrane-bound organelles <br />\r\nC) Single-celled organisms <br />\r\nD) Complex internal structure <br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
