(939, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 38, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following statements about sound waves is true? <br />\r\nA) Sound waves require a medium to propagate. <br />\r\nB) Sound waves travel faster in a vacuum than in air. <br />\r\nC) Sound waves are a form of electromagnetic radiation. <br />\r\nD) Sound waves always travel in a straight line.</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
