(1136, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 35, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following statements about magnets is true? <br />\r\nA) Opposite poles attract, and like poles repel. <br />\r\nB) Opposite poles repel, and like poles attract. <br />\r\nC) Only magnets made of iron are attracted to each other. <br />\r\nD) Magnets can only attract non-magnetic materials.</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1137, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 36, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The amount of matter in an object is referred to as its: <br />\r\nA) Mass <br />\r\nB) Weight <br />\r\nC) Volume <br />\r\nD) Density</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1138, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 37, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the unit of measurement for electric potential difference? <br />\r\nA) Volt <br />\r\nB) Ohm<br />\r\n C) Ampere <br />\r\nD) Watt</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1139, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 38, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following statements about sound waves is true? <br />\r\nA) Sound waves require a medium to propagate. <br />\r\nB) Sound waves travel faster in a vacuum than in air. <br />\r\nC) Sound waves are a form of electromagnetic radiation. <br />\r\nD) Sound waves always travel in a straight line.</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1140, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 39, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">According to the law of reflection, the angle of incidence is equal to the angle of: <br />\r\nA) Reflection <br />\r\nB) Refraction <br />\r\nC) Diffraction <br />\r\nD) Absorption</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1141, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 40, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which organ is responsible for filtering waste from the blood? <br />\r\nA) Kidney <br />\r\nB) Liver <br />\r\nC) Heart<br />\r\n D) Lung</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1142, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 41, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which type of blood vessels carry oxygenated blood away from the heart?<br />\r\n A) Arteries <br />\r\nB) Veins <br />\r\nC) Capillaries <br />\r\nD) Bronchioles</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1143, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 42, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary function of the respiratory system? <br />\r\nA) Transporting oxygen <br />\r\nB) Pumping blood <br />\r\nC) Regulating body temperature <br />\r\nD) Digesting food</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1144, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 43, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the largest organ in the human body? <br />\r\nA) Liver<br />\r\n B) Skin <br />\r\nC) Heart <br />\r\nD) Brain</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1145, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 44, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which molecule carries genetic information in living organisms? <br />\r\nA) RNA <br />\r\nB) DNA <br />\r\nC) ATP <br />\r\nD) Glucose</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1146, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 45, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which type of muscle is responsible for voluntary movements in the body? <br />\r\nA) Skeletal muscle <br />\r\nB) Smooth muscle <br />\r\nC) Cardiac muscle<br />\r\n D) Connective tissue</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1147, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 46, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is not a function of the nervous system? <br />\r\nA) Controlling body movements <br />\r\nB) Regulating body temperature <br />\r\nC) Sending and receiving signals <br />\r\nD) Maintaining heart rate</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1148, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 47, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the powerhouse of the cell? <br />\r\nA) Nucleus <br />\r\nB) Mitochondria <br />\r\nC) Golgi apparatus <br />\r\nD) Endoplasmic reticulum</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1149, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 48, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which type of reproduction involves the fusion of male and female gametes? <br />\r\nA) Asexual reproduction <br />\r\nB) Budding <br />\r\nC) Binary fission <br />\r\nD) Sexual reproduction</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1150, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 49, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which nutrient is the main source of energy for the body? <br />\r\nA) Carbohydrates <br />\r\nB) Proteins <br />\r\nC) Vitamins<br />\r\n D) Minerals</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1151, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 50, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which organ produces insulin in the human body? <br />\r\nA) Pancreas <br />\r\nB) Liver <br />\r\nC) Stomach <br />\r\nD) Gallbladder</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1152, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 51, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is not an example of a renewable resource? <br />\r\nA) Solar energy <br />\r\nB) Wind energy <br />\r\nC) Fossil fuels <br />\r\nD) Hydropower</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1153, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 52, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the process by which plants release water vapor through their leaves? <br />\r\nA) Transpiration <br />\r\nB) Condensation <br />\r\nC) Evaporation <br />\r\nD) Precipitation</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1154, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 53, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which organelle is responsible for protein synthesis in a cell? <br />\r\nA) Nucleus <br />\r\nB) Mitochondria <br />\r\nC) Endoplasmic reticulum <br />\r\nD) Golgi apparatus</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1155, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 54, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is NOT a type of blood cell? <br />\r\nA) Red blood cell <br />\r\nB) White blood cell <br />\r\nC) Platelet <br />\r\nD) Neuron</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1156, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 55, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the function of the enzyme amylase? <br />\r\nA) Breakdown of proteins <br />\r\nB) Breakdown of carbohydrates <br />\r\nC) Breakdown of lipids <br />\r\nD) Breakdown of nucleic acids</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1157, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 56, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a function of the liver? <br />\r\nA) Production of insulin <br />\r\nB) Production of bile <br />\r\nC) Production of red blood cells <br />\r\nD) Production of saliva</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1158, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 57, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is NOT a function of the skeletal system? <br />\r\nA) Support and protection <br />\r\nB) Movement <br />\r\nC) Production of blood cells <br />\r\nD) Regulation of body temperature <br />\r</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `questions` (`id`, `session1`, `department`, `level`, `semester`, `course`, `exam_type`, `exam_mode`, `exam_category`, `no_of_qst`, `upload_no_of_qst`, `question_type`, `question_no`, `question`, `answer`, `graphic`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(1159, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 58, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is responsible for carrying oxygen in the blood? <br />\r\nA) Hemoglobin <br />\r\nB) Insulin <br />\r\nC) Adrenaline <br />\r\nD) Estrogen <br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1160, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 59, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is responsible for the production of antibodies? <br />\r\nA) T cells <br />\r\nB) B cells <br />\r\nC) Red blood cells <br />\r\nD) Platelets <br />\r</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1161, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 60, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a characteristic of prokaryotic cells? <br />\r\nA) Presence of a nucleus <br />\r\nB) Membrane-bound organelles <br />\r\nC) Single-celled organisms <br />\r\nD) Complex internal structure <br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1162, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 61, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is NOT a type of tissue in the human body? <br />\r\nA) Epithelial tissue <br />\r\nB) Nervous tissue <br />\r\nC) Connective tissue <br />\r\nD) Respiratory tissue</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1163, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 62, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the role of the hormone insulin in the body? <br />\r\nA) Regulating blood sugar levels <br />\r\nB) Controlling body temperature <br />\r\nC) Promoting bone growth <br />\r\nD) Stimulating muscle contraction</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1164, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 63, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the process by which a cell divides into two identical daughter cells? <br />\r\nA) Mitosis <br />\r\nB) Meiosis <br />\r\nC) Photosynthesis <br />\r\nD) Fermentation <br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1165, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 64, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is responsible for the sense of smell? <br />\r\nA) Cochlea <br />\r\nB) Retina <br />\r\nC) Olfactory bulb <br />\r\nD) Taste buds <br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1166, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 65, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D, choose the word that best completes each of the following sentences<br />\r\nThe policy will _____ havoc on the economy of the nation. <br />\r\nA.	Wreak<br />\r\nB.	Promote<br />\r\nC.	Produce<br />\r\nD.	Wreck<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1167, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 66, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D, choose the word that best completes each of the following sentences<br />\r\nThe librarian has not entered the new books in the _____. <br />\r\nA.	List<br />\r\nB.	Directory<br />\r\nC.	Catalogue<br />\r\nD.	Roste<br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1168, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 67, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D, choose the word that best completes each of the following sentences<br />\r\nThe judge _____ the case. <br />\r\nA.	Cancelled<br />\r\nB.	Dismissed<br />\r\nC.	Rejected<br />\r\nD.	Withdrew<br />\r</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1169, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 68, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D, choose the word that best completes each of the following sentences<br />\r\nMosquito parasites have become _____ to quinine. <br />\r\nA.	Resistant<br />\r\nB.	Immune<br />\r\nC.	Opposed<br />\r\nD.	Defant<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1170, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 69, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D, choose the word that best completes each of the following sentences<br />\r\nThe unionists _____ the meeting with the management. <br />\r\nA.	Rejected<br />\r\nB.	Hindered<br />\r\nC.	Boycotted<br />\r\nD.	Banned<br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1171, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 70, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D, choose the word that best completes each of the following sentences<br />\r\nThe company failed to pay up the loan because it had become ____ <br />\r\nA.	Corrupt<br />\r\nB.	Bankrupt<br />\r\nC.	Inefficient<br />\r\nD.	Unreliable<br />\r</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1172, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 71, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D, choose the word that best completes each of the following sentences<br />\r\nThe doctor declared that the sick child needed a blood ____ <br />\r\nA.	transformation<br />\r\nB.	transfer<br />\r\nC.	transmission<br />\r\nD.	transfusion<br />\r</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1173, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 72, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Mary and I have never seen eye to eye on politics. This means that we have never <br />\r\nA.	agreed on politics<br />\r\nB.	engaged in politics<br />\r\nC.	discussed politics<br />\r\nD.	benefited from politics<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1174, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 73, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The new policy has come under fire. This means that the policy is <br />\r\nA.	generating controversy<br />\r\nB.	being criticized<br />\r\nC.	being scrutinized<br />\r\nD.	causing a riot<br />\r</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1175, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 74, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">We were surprised to learn that Tom had been let off the hook. This means that Tom had <br />\r\nA.	not been punished<br />\r\nB.	gone fishing alone<br />\r\nC.	been sent away<br />\r\nD.	not been dismissed<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1176, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 75, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">He is at the crossroads of his life. This means that it is time for him to <br />\r\nA.	make a very important decision<br />\r\nB.	retrace his steps<br />\r\nC.	make peace with everyone<br />\r\nD.	take his studies seriously<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1177, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 76, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Mathematics is a closed book to me. This means that I <br />\r\nA.	do not have to study Mathematics<br />\r\nB.	do not understand Mathematics<br />\r\nC.	have never passed Mathematics<br />\r\nD.	cannot avoid studying Mathematics<br />\r</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1178, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 77, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI think children are more \'robust\' than adults. <br />\r\nA.	healthy and strong<br />\r\nB.	pleasant and cheerful<br />\r\nC.	vital and dependable<br />\r\nD.	plump and curvy<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1179, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 78, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe new law was meant to \'mitigate\' the people\'s suffering. <br />\r\nA.	restrain<br />\r\nB.	moderate<br />\r\nC.	stop<br />\r\nD.	alleviate<br />\r</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1180, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 79, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe judge is \'incorruptible\'. <br />\r\nA.	consistent<br />\r\nB.	honest<br />\r\nC.	responsible<br />\r\nD.	outspoken<br />\r</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1181, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 80, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhatever my boss decides is \'irrevocable\'. <br />\r\nA.	final<br />\r\nB.	true<br />\r\nC.	necessary<br />\r\nD.	enforced<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1182, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 81, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe printer took a \'cursory\' look at the document. <br />\r\nA.	quick<br />\r\nB.	long<br />\r\nC.	puzzled<br />\r\nD.	careful<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1183, '2024/2025', 'Diploma for Health Technicians(DE)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 82, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis morning, Audu arrived at the school looking \'disheveled\'. <br />\r\nA.	worried<br />\r\nB.	terrified<br />\r\nC.	untidy<br />\r\nD.	confused<br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
