(1330, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 29, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following best describes the process by which a gas changes directly into a solid without becoming a liquid? <br />\r\nA) Condensation <br />\r\nB) Evaporation <br />\r\nC) Sublimation <br />\r\nD) Fusion</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1331, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 30, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The bending of light as it passes from one medium to another is known as: <br />\r\nA) Reflection <br />\r\nB) Refraction <br />\r\nC) Diffraction <br />\r\nD) Dispersion</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
