(1333, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 32, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The energy stored in an object due to its position or condition is called: <br />\r\nA) Kinetic energy <br />\r\nB) Potential energy <br />\r\nC) Thermal energy <br />\r\nD) Chemical energy</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
