(1379, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 78, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe new law was meant to \'mitigate\' the people\'s suffering. <br />\r\nA.	restrain<br />\r\nB.	moderate<br />\r\nC.	stop<br />\r\nD.	alleviate<br />\r</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1380, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 79, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe judge is \'incorruptible\'. <br />\r\nA.	consistent<br />\r\nB.	honest<br />\r\nC.	responsible<br />\r\nD.	outspoken<br />\r</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1381, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 80, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhatever my boss decides is \'irrevocable\'. <br />\r\nA.	final<br />\r\nB.	true<br />\r\nC.	necessary<br />\r\nD.	enforced<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1382, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 81, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe printer took a \'cursory\' look at the document. <br />\r\nA.	quick<br />\r\nB.	long<br />\r\nC.	puzzled<br />\r\nD.	careful<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1383, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 82, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis morning, Audu arrived at the school looking \'disheveled\'. <br />\r\nA.	worried<br />\r\nB.	terrified<br />\r\nC.	untidy<br />\r\nD.	confused<br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1384, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 83, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCorporal punishment is meant to be a \'deterrent\' to indiscipline. <br />\r\nA.	remedy<br />\r\nB.	measure<br />\r\nC.	discouragement<br />\r\nD.	prevention<br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1385, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 84, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence.<br />\r\nThe new bank is \'thriving\'. <br />\r\nA.	evolving<br />\r\nB.	attractive<br />\r\nC.	flourishing<br />\r\nD.	supportive<br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1386, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 85, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Nigeria is made up of ??.. states:<br />\r\na.	12<br />\r\nb.	24<br />\r\nc.	36<br />\r\nd.	48<br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1387, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 86, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Nigeria is made up of ??. Local government areas.<br />\r\na.	774<br />\r\nb.	644<br />\r\nc.	544<br />\r\nd.	444<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1388, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 87, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">There are ?.. wards in Nigeria.<br />\r\na.	6610<br />\r\nb.	7710<br />\r\nc.	8810<br />\r\nd.	9910<br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1389, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 88, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Find the average of the following set of data 15, 25, 35, 45, 55, 65<br />\r\n(a) 25    <br />\r\n(b) 30<br />\r\n(c) 35 <br />\r\n(d) 40<br />\r</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1390, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 89, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">If a=10 and d=10, then first four terms will be:<br />\r\n(a)10,30,50,60<br />\r\n(b)10,20,30,40<br />\r\n(c)10,15,20,25<br />\r\n(d)10,18,20,30<br />\r</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1391, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 90, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the average of first 150 natural numbers?<br />\r\n(A) 70<br />\r\n(B) 70.5<br />\r\n(C) 75<br />\r\n(D) 75.5<br />\r</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1392, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 91, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Simplify: 3x (4a - 5b) - 5x(3a - 2b)<br />\r\n(a) 3ax - 5b<br />\r\n(b) (3a - 5b)x<br />\r\n(c) (5b - 3a)x<br />\r\n(d) -(3a + 5b)x<br />\r</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1393, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 92, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The area of triangle is 52cm2. If the base of the triangle is 8cm, find its height.<br />\r\n(a) 6.5cm<br />\r\n(b) 7.5cm<br />\r\n(c) 13.0cm  <br />\r\n(d) 26cm<br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1394, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 93, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">If ?240,000.00 is shared between 3 people in the ratio 5:4:3. What is the least share?<br />\r\n    (a) ?100,000.00<br />\r\n    (b) ? 96,000.00<br />\r\n    (c) ?80,000.00<br />\r\n    (d) ?60,000.00<br />\r</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1395, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 94, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the value of x in the equation 3x - 15 - 6 = 0 ?<br />\r\n(A) 7<br />\r\n(B) 8<br />\r\n(C) 9<br />\r\n(D) -9<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1396, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 95, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">11th term of the A.P. -3, -1/2, ,2 ?. Is<br />\r\n(a)28<br />\r\n(b)22<br />\r\n(c)-38<br />\r\n(d)-48<br />\r</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1397, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 96, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">In an Arithmetic Progression, if a=28, d=-4, n=7, then an is:<br />\r\n(a)4<br />\r\n(b)5<br />\r\n(c)3<br />\r\n(d)7<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1398, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 97, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the average of the numbers: 0, 0, 4, 10, 5, and 5 ?<br />\r\n(A) 2<br />\r\n(B) 3<br />\r\n(C) 4<br />\r\n(D) 5<br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1399, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 98, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the rate of discount if a car which price was $4,000 was sold for $3,200 ?<br />\r\n(A) 14%<br />\r\n(B) 16%<br />\r\n(C) 18%<br />\r\n(D) 20%<br />\r</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL);
