(1425, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 24, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the process called when a large molecule is broken down into smaller units by adding water? <br />\r\nA) Oxidation <br />\r\nB) Reduction <br />\r\nC) Polymerization <br />\r\nD) Hydrolysis</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1426, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 25, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a fundamental force of nature? <br />\r\nA) Electromagnetic force <br />\r\nB) Gravitational force <br />\r\nC) Nuclear force <br />\r\nD) Frictional force</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1427, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 26, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the SI unit of electric current? <br />\r\nA) Ampere <br />\r\nB) Volt <br />\r\nC) Watt <br />\r\nD) Ohm</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1428, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 27, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following describes the resistance to change in an object\'s motion? <br />\r\nA) Velocity <br />\r\nB) Momentum <br />\r\nC) Inertia <br />\r\nD) Acceleration</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1429, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 28, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">According to Newton\'s first law of motion, an object at rest tends to stay at rest unless acted upon by a(n):<br />\r\n A) Unbalanced force <br />\r\nB) Frictional force<br />\r\n C) Electric force <br />\r\nD) Magnetic force</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1430, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 29, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following best describes the process by which a gas changes directly into a solid without becoming a liquid? <br />\r\nA) Condensation <br />\r\nB) Evaporation <br />\r\nC) Sublimation <br />\r\nD) Fusion</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1431, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 30, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The bending of light as it passes from one medium to another is known as: <br />\r\nA) Reflection <br />\r\nB) Refraction <br />\r\nC) Diffraction <br />\r\nD) Dispersion</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1432, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 31, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is NOT a type of electromagnetic radiation? <br />\r\nA) X-rays <br />\r\nB) Ultraviolet <br />\r\nC) Sound waves <br />\r\nD) Gamma rays</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1433, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 32, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The energy stored in an object due to its position or condition is called: <br />\r\nA) Kinetic energy <br />\r\nB) Potential energy <br />\r\nC) Thermal energy <br />\r\nD) Chemical energy</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
