(1435, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 34, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The process of converting a solid directly into a gas without passing through the liquid state is called: <br />\r\nA) Melting <br />\r\nB) Sublimation <br />\r\nC) Freezing <br />\r\nD) Condensation</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
