(1471, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 70, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D, choose the word that best completes each of the following sentences<br />\r\nThe company failed to pay up the loan because it had become ____ <br />\r\nA.	Corrupt<br />\r\nB.	Bankrupt<br />\r\nC.	Inefficient<br />\r\nD.	Unreliable<br />\r</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
