(1473, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 72, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Mary and I have never seen eye to eye on politics. This means that we have never <br />\r\nA.	agreed on politics<br />\r\nB.	engaged in politics<br />\r\nC.	discussed politics<br />\r\nD.	benefited from politics<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1474, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 73, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The new policy has come under fire. This means that the policy is <br />\r\nA.	generating controversy<br />\r\nB.	being criticized<br />\r\nC.	being scrutinized<br />\r\nD.	causing a riot<br />\r</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1475, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 74, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">We were surprised to learn that Tom had been let off the hook. This means that Tom had <br />\r\nA.	not been punished<br />\r\nB.	gone fishing alone<br />\r\nC.	been sent away<br />\r\nD.	not been dismissed<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1476, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 75, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">He is at the crossroads of his life. This means that it is time for him to <br />\r\nA.	make a very important decision<br />\r\nB.	retrace his steps<br />\r\nC.	make peace with everyone<br />\r\nD.	take his studies seriously<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1477, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 76, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Mathematics is a closed book to me. This means that I <br />\r\nA.	do not have to study Mathematics<br />\r\nB.	do not understand Mathematics<br />\r\nC.	have never passed Mathematics<br />\r\nD.	cannot avoid studying Mathematics<br />\r</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1478, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 77, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI think children are more \'robust\' than adults. <br />\r\nA.	healthy and strong<br />\r\nB.	pleasant and cheerful<br />\r\nC.	vital and dependable<br />\r\nD.	plump and curvy<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1479, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 78, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe new law was meant to \'mitigate\' the people\'s suffering. <br />\r\nA.	restrain<br />\r\nB.	moderate<br />\r\nC.	stop<br />\r\nD.	alleviate<br />\r</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1480, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 79, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe judge is \'incorruptible\'. <br />\r\nA.	consistent<br />\r\nB.	honest<br />\r\nC.	responsible<br />\r\nD.	outspoken<br />\r</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1481, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 80, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhatever my boss decides is \'irrevocable\'. <br />\r\nA.	final<br />\r\nB.	true<br />\r\nC.	necessary<br />\r\nD.	enforced<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1482, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 81, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe printer took a \'cursory\' look at the document. <br />\r\nA.	quick<br />\r\nB.	long<br />\r\nC.	puzzled<br />\r\nD.	careful<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1483, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 82, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis morning, Audu arrived at the school looking \'disheveled\'. <br />\r\nA.	worried<br />\r\nB.	terrified<br />\r\nC.	untidy<br />\r\nD.	confused<br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1484, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 83, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCorporal punishment is meant to be a \'deterrent\' to indiscipline. <br />\r\nA.	remedy<br />\r\nB.	measure<br />\r\nC.	discouragement<br />\r\nD.	prevention<br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1485, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 84, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D below, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the word in quote as it is used in the sentence.<br />\r\nThe new bank is \'thriving\'. <br />\r\nA.	evolving<br />\r\nB.	attractive<br />\r\nC.	flourishing<br />\r\nD.	supportive<br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1486, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 85, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Nigeria is made up of ??.. states:<br />\r\na.	12<br />\r\nb.	24<br />\r\nc.	36<br />\r\nd.	48<br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1487, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 86, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Nigeria is made up of ??. Local government areas.<br />\r\na.	774<br />\r\nb.	644<br />\r\nc.	544<br />\r\nd.	444<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1488, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 87, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">There are ?.. wards in Nigeria.<br />\r\na.	6610<br />\r\nb.	7710<br />\r\nc.	8810<br />\r\nd.	9910<br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1489, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 88, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Find the average of the following set of data 15, 25, 35, 45, 55, 65<br />\r\n(a) 25    <br />\r\n(b) 30<br />\r\n(c) 35 <br />\r\n(d) 40<br />\r</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1490, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 89, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">If a=10 and d=10, then first four terms will be:<br />\r\n(a)10,30,50,60<br />\r\n(b)10,20,30,40<br />\r\n(c)10,15,20,25<br />\r\n(d)10,18,20,30<br />\r</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1491, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 90, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the average of first 150 natural numbers?<br />\r\n(A) 70<br />\r\n(B) 70.5<br />\r\n(C) 75<br />\r\n(D) 75.5<br />\r</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1492, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 91, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Simplify: 3x (4a - 5b) - 5x(3a - 2b)<br />\r\n(a) 3ax - 5b<br />\r\n(b) (3a - 5b)x<br />\r\n(c) (5b - 3a)x<br />\r\n(d) -(3a + 5b)x<br />\r</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1493, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 92, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The area of triangle is 52cm2. If the base of the triangle is 8cm, find its height.<br />\r\n(a) 6.5cm<br />\r\n(b) 7.5cm<br />\r\n(c) 13.0cm  <br />\r\n(d) 26cm<br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1494, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 93, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">If ?240,000.00 is shared between 3 people in the ratio 5:4:3. What is the least share?<br />\r\n    (a) ?100,000.00<br />\r\n    (b) ? 96,000.00<br />\r\n    (c) ?80,000.00<br />\r\n    (d) ?60,000.00<br />\r</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1495, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 94, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the value of x in the equation 3x - 15 - 6 = 0 ?<br />\r\n(A) 7<br />\r\n(B) 8<br />\r\n(C) 9<br />\r\n(D) -9<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1496, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 95, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">11th term of the A.P. -3, -1/2, ,2 ?. Is<br />\r\n(a)28<br />\r\n(b)22<br />\r\n(c)-38<br />\r\n(d)-48<br />\r</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1497, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 96, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">In an Arithmetic Progression, if a=28, d=-4, n=7, then an is:<br />\r\n(a)4<br />\r\n(b)5<br />\r\n(c)3<br />\r\n(d)7<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1498, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 97, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the average of the numbers: 0, 0, 4, 10, 5, and 5 ?<br />\r\n(A) 2<br />\r\n(B) 3<br />\r\n(C) 4<br />\r\n(D) 5<br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1499, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 98, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the rate of discount if a car which price was $4,000 was sold for $3,200 ?<br />\r\n(A) 14%<br />\r\n(B) 16%<br />\r\n(C) 18%<br />\r\n(D) 20%<br />\r</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1500, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 99, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Find the range of the following set of data 25, 22, 23, 27, 19, 15, 22, 23, 22, 22, 14,28.<br />\r\n(a) 25<br />\r\n(b) 23<br />\r\n(c) 14    <br />\r\n(d) 12<br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1501, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Complementary Health Sciences (Natural/Alternative Medicine)', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 100, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">3y = 4x - 1 and Ky = x + 3 are equations of two straight lines. If the two lines are perpendicular to each other, find K.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    A. -4/3<br />\r\n    B. -3/4<br />\r\n    C. 3/4<br />\r\n    D. 4/3<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1502, '2024/2025', 'ND(WAHEB) in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 1, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is an example of a chemical change?<br />\r\n A) Boiling water<br />\r\n B) Dissolving salt in water <br />\r\nC) Burning wood <br />\r\nD) Freezing water <br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1503, '2024/2025', 'ND(WAHEB) in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 2, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the pH value of a neutral solution? <br />\r\nA) 1 <br />\r\nB) 7 <br />\r\nC) 10<br />\r\n D) 14</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1504, '2024/2025', 'ND(WAHEB) in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 3, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is the most abundant gas in the Earth\'s atmosphere?<br />\r\n A) Oxygen <br />\r\nB) Nitrogen<br />\r\n C) Carbon dioxide <br />\r\nD) Argon</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1505, '2024/2025', 'ND(WAHEB) in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 4, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a halogen? <br />\r\nA) Sodium <br />\r\nB) Chlorine <br />\r\nC) Calcium <br />\r\nD) Iron</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1506, '2024/2025', 'ND(WAHEB) in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 5, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the chemical formula for methane? <br />\r\nA) CH4 <br />\r\nB) H2SO4 <br />\r\nC) NaCl<br />\r\n D) CO2</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1507, '2024/2025', 'ND(WAHEB) in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 6, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which subatomic particle has a positive charge? <br />\r\n             A) Proton <br />\r\n             B) Neutron <br />\r\n             C) Electron <br />\r\n            D) Photon</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1508, '2024/2025', 'ND(WAHEB) in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 7, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a noble gas? <br />\r\nA) Neon <br />\r\nB) Sodium <br />\r\nC) Potassium <br />\r\nD) Aluminum</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1509, '2024/2025', 'ND(WAHEB) in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 8, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the chemical symbol for iron? <br />\r\nA) I <br />\r\nB) Fe <br />\r\nC) Au <br />\r\nD) Pb</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1510, '2024/2025', 'ND(WAHEB) in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 9, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the atomic number of oxygen? <br />\r\nA) 6 <br />\r\nB) 8 <br />\r\nC) 10 <br />\r\nD) 12</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1511, '2024/2025', 'ND(WAHEB) in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 10, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is an example of a physical change? <br />\r\nA) Burning wood <br />\r\nB) Rusting iron <br />\r\nC) Melting ice <br />\r\nD) Cooking eggs</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1512, '2024/2025', 'ND(WAHEB) in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 11, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the pH value of an acidic solution? <br />\r\nA) 1 <br />\r\nB) 7<br />\r\n C) 10 <br />\r\nD) 14</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1513, '2024/2025', 'ND(WAHEB) in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 12, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a greenhouse gas? <br />\r\nA) Oxygen <br />\r\nB) Nitrogen <br />\r\nC) Carbon dioxide <br />\r\nD) Argon</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL);
