(1613, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 12, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a greenhouse gas? <br />\r\nA) Oxygen <br />\r\nB) Nitrogen <br />\r\nC) Carbon dioxide <br />\r\nD) Argon</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1614, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 13, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the chemical formula for carbon dioxide? <br />\r\nA) CO2<br />\r\n B) H2O <br />\r\nC) NaCl<br />\r\n D) C6H12O6</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1615, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 14, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is an alkali metal? <br />\r\nA) Sodium<br />\r\n B) Chlorine <br />\r\nC) Calcium <br />\r\nD) Iron</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1616, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 15, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which functional group is present in an alcohol? <br />\r\nA) Carboxyl <br />\r\nB) Amine <br />\r\nC) Hydroxyl <br />\r\nD) Aldehyde</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1617, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 16, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the general formula for an alkane? <br />\r\nA) CnH2n+1 <br />\r\nB) CnH2n <br />\r\nC) CnH2n+2 <br />\r\nD) CnH2n-2</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1618, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 17, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the process called when a molecule gains an electron? <br />\r\nA) Oxidation <br />\r\nB) Reduction <br />\r\nC) Polymerization <br />\r\nD) Hydrolysis</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1619, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 18, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is an example of an aromatic compound? <br />\r\nA) Methane <br />\r\nB) Ethanol <br />\r\nC) Benzene <br />\r\nD) Butanoic acid</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1620, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 19, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the functional group present in a carboxylic acid?<br />\r\n A) Aldehyde <br />\r\nB) Ketone <br />\r\nC) Carboxyl <br />\r\nD) Ester</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1621, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 20, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a primary alcohol? <br />\r\nA) Ethanol <br />\r\nB) Methanol <br />\r\nC) Propanol <br />\r\nD) Butanol <br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1622, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 21, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which type of isomerism is observed in compounds with the same molecular formula but different arrangement of atoms in space? <br />\r\nA) Structural isomerism<br />\r\n B) Geometric isomerism<br />\r\n C) Optical isomerism<br />\r\n D) Functional group isomerism</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1623, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 22, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the IUPAC name for CH3-CH2-CH2-CH3? <br />\r\nA) Butane <br />\r\nB) Ethane <br />\r\nC) Propane <br />\r\nD) Pentane</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1624, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 23, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which functional group is present in an aldehyde? <br />\r\nA) Carboxyl <br />\r\nB) Hydroxyl <br />\r\nC) Aldehyde <br />\r\nD) Ester</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1625, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 24, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the process called when a large molecule is broken down into smaller units by adding water? <br />\r\nA) Oxidation <br />\r\nB) Reduction <br />\r\nC) Polymerization <br />\r\nD) Hydrolysis</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1626, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 25, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a fundamental force of nature? <br />\r\nA) Electromagnetic force <br />\r\nB) Gravitational force <br />\r\nC) Nuclear force <br />\r\nD) Frictional force</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1627, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 26, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the SI unit of electric current? <br />\r\nA) Ampere <br />\r\nB) Volt <br />\r\nC) Watt <br />\r\nD) Ohm</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1628, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 27, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following describes the resistance to change in an object\'s motion? <br />\r\nA) Velocity <br />\r\nB) Momentum <br />\r\nC) Inertia <br />\r\nD) Acceleration</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1629, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 28, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">According to Newton\'s first law of motion, an object at rest tends to stay at rest unless acted upon by a(n):<br />\r\n A) Unbalanced force <br />\r\nB) Frictional force<br />\r\n C) Electric force <br />\r\nD) Magnetic force</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1630, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 29, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following best describes the process by which a gas changes directly into a solid without becoming a liquid? <br />\r\nA) Condensation <br />\r\nB) Evaporation <br />\r\nC) Sublimation <br />\r\nD) Fusion</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1631, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 30, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The bending of light as it passes from one medium to another is known as: <br />\r\nA) Reflection <br />\r\nB) Refraction <br />\r\nC) Diffraction <br />\r\nD) Dispersion</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `questions` (`id`, `session1`, `department`, `level`, `semester`, `course`, `exam_type`, `exam_mode`, `exam_category`, `no_of_qst`, `upload_no_of_qst`, `question_type`, `question_no`, `question`, `answer`, `graphic`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(1632, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 31, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is NOT a type of electromagnetic radiation? <br />\r\nA) X-rays <br />\r\nB) Ultraviolet <br />\r\nC) Sound waves <br />\r\nD) Gamma rays</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1633, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 32, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The energy stored in an object due to its position or condition is called: <br />\r\nA) Kinetic energy <br />\r\nB) Potential energy <br />\r\nC) Thermal energy <br />\r\nD) Chemical energy</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1634, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 33, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is NOT a renewable energy source? <br />\r\nA) Solar power <br />\r\nB) Wind power <br />\r\nC) Nuclear power <br />\r\nD) Hydroelectric power</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1635, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 34, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The process of converting a solid directly into a gas without passing through the liquid state is called: <br />\r\nA) Melting <br />\r\nB) Sublimation <br />\r\nC) Freezing <br />\r\nD) Condensation</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1636, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 35, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following statements about magnets is true? <br />\r\nA) Opposite poles attract, and like poles repel. <br />\r\nB) Opposite poles repel, and like poles attract. <br />\r\nC) Only magnets made of iron are attracted to each other. <br />\r\nD) Magnets can only attract non-magnetic materials.</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1637, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 36, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The amount of matter in an object is referred to as its: <br />\r\nA) Mass <br />\r\nB) Weight <br />\r\nC) Volume <br />\r\nD) Density</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1638, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 37, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the unit of measurement for electric potential difference? <br />\r\nA) Volt <br />\r\nB) Ohm<br />\r\n C) Ampere <br />\r\nD) Watt</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1639, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 38, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following statements about sound waves is true? <br />\r\nA) Sound waves require a medium to propagate. <br />\r\nB) Sound waves travel faster in a vacuum than in air. <br />\r\nC) Sound waves are a form of electromagnetic radiation. <br />\r\nD) Sound waves always travel in a straight line.</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1640, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 39, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">According to the law of reflection, the angle of incidence is equal to the angle of: <br />\r\nA) Reflection <br />\r\nB) Refraction <br />\r\nC) Diffraction <br />\r\nD) Absorption</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1641, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 40, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which organ is responsible for filtering waste from the blood? <br />\r\nA) Kidney <br />\r\nB) Liver <br />\r\nC) Heart<br />\r\n D) Lung</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1642, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 41, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which type of blood vessels carry oxygenated blood away from the heart?<br />\r\n A) Arteries <br />\r\nB) Veins <br />\r\nC) Capillaries <br />\r\nD) Bronchioles</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1643, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 42, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary function of the respiratory system? <br />\r\nA) Transporting oxygen <br />\r\nB) Pumping blood <br />\r\nC) Regulating body temperature <br />\r\nD) Digesting food</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1644, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 43, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the largest organ in the human body? <br />\r\nA) Liver<br />\r\n B) Skin <br />\r\nC) Heart <br />\r\nD) Brain</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1645, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 44, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which molecule carries genetic information in living organisms? <br />\r\nA) RNA <br />\r\nB) DNA <br />\r\nC) ATP <br />\r\nD) Glucose</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1646, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 45, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which type of muscle is responsible for voluntary movements in the body? <br />\r\nA) Skeletal muscle <br />\r\nB) Smooth muscle <br />\r\nC) Cardiac muscle<br />\r\n D) Connective tissue</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1647, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 46, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is not a function of the nervous system? <br />\r\nA) Controlling body movements <br />\r\nB) Regulating body temperature <br />\r\nC) Sending and receiving signals <br />\r\nD) Maintaining heart rate</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1648, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 47, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the powerhouse of the cell? <br />\r\nA) Nucleus <br />\r\nB) Mitochondria <br />\r\nC) Golgi apparatus <br />\r\nD) Endoplasmic reticulum</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1649, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 48, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which type of reproduction involves the fusion of male and female gametes? <br />\r\nA) Asexual reproduction <br />\r\nB) Budding <br />\r\nC) Binary fission <br />\r\nD) Sexual reproduction</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1650, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 49, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which nutrient is the main source of energy for the body? <br />\r\nA) Carbohydrates <br />\r\nB) Proteins <br />\r\nC) Vitamins<br />\r\n D) Minerals</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1651, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 50, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which organ produces insulin in the human body? <br />\r\nA) Pancreas <br />\r\nB) Liver <br />\r\nC) Stomach <br />\r\nD) Gallbladder</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1652, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 51, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is not an example of a renewable resource? <br />\r\nA) Solar energy <br />\r\nB) Wind energy <br />\r\nC) Fossil fuels <br />\r\nD) Hydropower</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1653, '2024/2025', 'Professional Certificate in Medical Image Processing/X-ray Technician', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 52, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the process by which plants release water vapor through their leaves? <br />\r\nA) Transpiration <br />\r\nB) Condensation <br />\r\nC) Evaporation <br />\r\nD) Precipitation</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
