(1863, '2024/2025', 'Professional Diploma in Health Information Management', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 62, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the role of the hormone insulin in the body? <br />\r\nA) Regulating blood sugar levels <br />\r\nB) Controlling body temperature <br />\r\nC) Promoting bone growth <br />\r\nD) Stimulating muscle contraction</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
