(1867, '2024/2025', 'Professional Diploma in Health Information Management', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 66, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D, choose the word that best completes each of the following sentences<br />\r\nThe librarian has not entered the new books in the _____. <br />\r\nA.	List<br />\r\nB.	Directory<br />\r\nC.	Catalogue<br />\r\nD.	Roste<br />\r</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1868, '2024/2025', 'Professional Diploma in Health Information Management', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 67, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D, choose the word that best completes each of the following sentences<br />\r\nThe judge _____ the case. <br />\r\nA.	Cancelled<br />\r\nB.	Dismissed<br />\r\nC.	Rejected<br />\r\nD.	Withdrew<br />\r</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(1869, '2024/2025', 'Professional Diploma in Health Information Management', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 68, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to D, choose the word that best completes each of the following sentences<br />\r\nMosquito parasites have become _____ to quinine. <br />\r\nA.	Resistant<br />\r\nB.	Immune<br />\r\nC.	Opposed<br />\r\nD.	Defant<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
