(1876, '2024/2025', 'Professional Diploma in Health Information Management', '100', 'First', 'MOCK', 'MOCK', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 75, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">He is at the crossroads of his life. This means that it is time for him to <br />\r\nA.	make a very important decision<br />\r\nB.	retrace his steps<br />\r\nC.	make peace with everyone<br />\r\nD.	take his studies seriously<br />\r</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
