(2198, '2024/2025', 'Certificate for Health Assistants', '100', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 97, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to E below each of the following sentences, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the underlined expression as it is used in the sentence.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The girl has just come out of the fattening room and her waist is <strong><ins>adorned</ins></strong> with beads.<br />\r\nA. surrounded &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. decorated &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. besieged<br />\r\n<br />\r\nD. defaced</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
