(3315, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 14, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">All of the following are the purpose for follow up of patient except<br />\r\n(a) To ensure regular treatment<br />\r\n(b)To ensure that patients or clients do not default in clinic<br />\r\n(c) For accountability of patient fees<br />\r\n(d) To review treatment carefully.</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
