(3910, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '100', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 9, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words or group of words lettered A to D, choose the one that best completes the sentence.<br />\r\nJumai&#39;s stay in the hotel afforded her___________chance to do her writing<br />\r\nA. ample</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. insufficient</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. powerful</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">D. opportune</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(3911, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '100', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 10, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words or group of words lettered A to D, choose the one that best completes the sentence.<br />\r\nIf I _________ what actually happened, I would have punished him.<br />\r\nA. had heard</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. have had</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. had had</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">D. have heard</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
