(3916, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '100', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 15, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words or group of words lettered A to D, choose the one that best completes the sentence.<br />\r\nYou were punished because you ___________last week without permission.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">A. must not have travelled</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. ought not to have travelled</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. ought not to travel</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">D. will not have travelled</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
