(4076, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '100', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 5, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What does HMIS enable healthcare organizations to achieve?<br />\n(A) Deliver high-quality patient-centered care<br />\n (B) Reduce costs only <br />\n? Improve resource allocation only <br />\n(D) Enhance patient safety only</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:28:30', '2024-07-09 16:28:30'),
(4077, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '100', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 6, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a benefit of HMIS in healthcare?<br />\n(A) Improved decision-making<br />\n (B) Reduced costs only <br />\n(C) Enhanced patient safety only <br />\n(D) Increased workload for healthcare providers</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:28:30', '2024-07-09 16:28:30'),
(4078, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '100', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 7, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How does HMIS contribute to disease surveillance?<br />\n(A) By tracking and monitoring diseases <br />\n(B) By reducing costs only <br />\n(C) By improving resource allocation only <br />\n(D) By enhancing patient safety only</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:28:30', '2024-07-09 16:28:30'),
(4079, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '100', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 8, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What does HMIS support in healthcare?<br />\n(A) Continuous quality improvement initiatives <br />\n(B) Reduced costs only <br />\n(C) Improved resource allocation only <br />\n(D) Enhanced patient safety only</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:28:30', '2024-07-09 16:28:30'),
(4080, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '100', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 9, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How does HMIS impact healthcare costs?<br />\n(A) Reduces costs <br />\n(B) Increases costs <br />\n(C) Has no impact on costs <br />\n(D) Improves resource allocation only</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:28:30', '2024-07-09 16:28:30'),
(4081, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '100', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 10, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What does HMIS provide for research and innovation?<br />\n(A) Data for research <br />\n(B) Improved resource allocation <br />\n(C) Enhanced patient safety <br />\n(D) Reduced costs</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:28:30', '2024-07-09 16:28:30'),
(4082, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '100', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 11, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">HMIS data collection tools include facility registers, monthly reports, annual reports, _________, and HMIS data entry forms.<br />\n(A) Surveillance forms<br />\n(B) Survey questionnaires<br />\n(C) Health facility assessment tools<br />\n(D) All of the above</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:28:30', '2024-07-09 16:28:30'),
(4083, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '100', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 12, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Community HMIS data collection tools include family record cards, community register, __________, household survey questionnaires, and CHW reporting forms.<br />\n(A) Surveillance forms<br />\n(B) Mobile health applications<br />\n(C) C-HMIS data entry forms<br />\n(D) All of the abov</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:28:30', '2024-07-09 16:28:30'),
(4084, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '100', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 13, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Health information/data flow refers to the movement of health-related data from one point to another, from ____________to analysis.<br />\n(A) Collection<br />\n(B) Entry<br />\n(C) Storage<br />\n(D) Processing</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:28:30', '2024-07-09 16:28:30'),
(4085, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '100', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 14, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The stages of health information/data flow include data collection, data entry, data storage, _____________, data reporting, data sharing, data feedback, and data update.<br />\n(A) Data processing<br />\n(B) Data analysis<br />\n? Data visualization<br />\n(D) Data transmission</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:28:30', '2024-07-09 16:28:30'),
(4086, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '100', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 15, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Effective health information/data flow ensures _____________, improved patient care and outcomes, enhanced decision-making, efficient resource allocation, and better healthcare planning and policy development.<br />\n(A) Accurate and timely data<br />\n(B) Complete and</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:28:30', '2024-07-09 16:28:30'),
(4087, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '100', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 16, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Health information/data flow occurs at various levels, including intra-facility, inter-facility, community-level, and ____________.<br />\n(A) National-level<br />\n(B) International level<br />\n(C) Regional level<br />\n(D) Local level</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:28:30', '2024-07-09 16:28:30'),
(4088, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '100', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 17, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The purpose of data processing in health information/data flow is to extract meaningful _____________, trends, and patterns.<br />\nA) Insights<br />\nB) Information<br />\nC) Knowledge<br />\nD) Wisdom</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:28:30', '2024-07-09 16:28:30'),
(4089, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '100', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 18, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Data feedback in health information/data flow influences treatment decisions, quality improvement initiatives, and ______________.<br />\n(A) Policy development<br />\n(B) Healthcare planning<br />\n(C) Resource allocation<br />\n(D) Patient care</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:28:30', '2024-07-09 16:28:30'),
