(4172, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 1, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary purpose of a Health Management Information System (HMIS)?<br />\n(A) To manage healthcare services effectively <br />\n(B) To collect patient data only <br />\n(C) To analyze data only <br />\n(D) To disseminate information only</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
