(4174, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 3, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the result of effective HMIS implementation?<br />\n(A) Improved patient care and outcomes <br />\n(B) Reduced healthcare costs only <br />\n(C) Increased workload for healthcare providers<br />\n (D) Decreased quality of care</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
