(4206, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 35, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What does HMIS stand for?<br />\n    (A) Health Management Information System<br />\n    (B) Health Marketing Information System<br />\n    (C) Health Management Improvement System<br />\n    (D) Health Marketing Improvement System</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4207, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 36, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which form is used for outpatient department attendance in HMIS?<br />\n    (A) Patient registration form<br />\n    (B) OPD attendance form<br />\n    (C) Inpatient admission form<br />\n    (D) Laboratory request form</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4208, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 37, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which indicator measures life expectancy?<br />\n    (A) Process indicator<br />\n    (B) Health outcome indicator<br />\n    (C) Risk factor indicator<br />\n    (D) Output indicator</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4209, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 38, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the purpose of standardized HMIS tools?<br />\n    (A) Entertainment<br />\n    (B) Ensure accurate and consistent reporting of health data<br />\n    (C) Financial gain<br />\n    (D) Marketing</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4210, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 39, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What type of indicator is the prevalence of HIV?<br />\n    (A) Mortality indicator<br />\n    (B) Morbidity indicator<br />\n    (C) Risk factor indicator<br />\n    (D) Process indicator</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4211, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 40, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which health indicator assesses access to healthcare services?<br />\n    (A) Mortality indicator<br />\n    (B) Morbidity indicator<br />\n    (C) Healthcare access indicator<br />\n    (D) Output indicator</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4212, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 41, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What does the immunization coverage indicator measure?<br />\n    (A) Number of deaths per 1000 live births<br />\n    (B) Number of infants vaccinated<br />\n    (C) Percentage of target population immunized<br />\n    (D) Number of diseases treated</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4213, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 42, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is an impact indicator?<br />\n    (A) Number of patients treated<br />\n    (B) Reduction in disease burden<br />\n    (C) Smoking prevalence<br />\n    (D) Access to services</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4214, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 43, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which type of indicator measures the number of patients treated?<br />\n    (A) Health outcome indicator<br />\n    (B) Risk factor indicator<br />\n    (C) Process indicator<br />\n    (D) Output indicator</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4215, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 44, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is an example of a clinical indicator?<br />\n(A) Life expectancy<br />\n (B) Blood glucose levels<br />\n (C) Patient satisfaction<br />\n (D) Health insurance coverage</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4216, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 45, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a demographic and social determinant?<br />\n    (A) Smoking prevalence<br />\n    (B) Socioeconomic status<br />\n    (C) Life expectancy<br />\n    (D) Vaccination rates</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4217, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 46, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What type of data is collected in disease surveillance reporting forms?<br />\n    (A) Financial transactions<br />\n    (B) Entertainment preferences<br />\n    (C) Disease-specific data (e.g., malaria, TB, HIV)<br />\n    (D) Marketing data</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4218, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 47, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a health behavior indicator?<br />\n    (A) Blood pressure control<br />\n    (B) Physical activity levels<br />\n     (C) Patient satisfaction<br />\n    (D) Life expectancy</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4219, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 48, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What does an outpatient department (OPD) attendance form capture?<br />\n    (A) Inpatient data<br />\n    (B) Financial transactions<br />\n   (C) Attendance of patients in the OPD<br />\n    (D) Lab test results</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4220, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 49, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a key benefit of using standardized HMIS tools?<br />\n    (A) Entertainment<br />\n    (B) Accurate and consistent reporting<br />\n    (C) Financial gain<br />\n    (D) Marketing</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4221, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 50, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What type of indicator is patient satisfaction?<br />\n    (A) Risk factor indicator<br />\n    (B) Healthcare access indicator<br />\n    (C) Health outcome indicator<br />\n    (D) Process indicator</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4222, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 51, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which form is used for inpatient admission and discharge in HMIS?<br />\n    (A) OPD attendance form<br />\n    (B) Patient registration form<br />\n    (C) Inpatient admission and discharge form<br />\n    (D) Laboratory request form</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4223, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 52, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which indicator measures quality of life?<br />\n    (A) Mortality indicator<br />\n    (B) Health outcome indicator<br />\n    (C) Risk factor indicator<br />\n    (D) Process indicator</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4224, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 53, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is an example of a morbidity indicator?<br />\n   (A) Infant mortality rate<br />\n    (B) Disease prevalence<br />\n    (C) Smoking prevalence<br />\n    (D) Vaccination rates</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4225, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 54, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which type of indicator is life expectancy at birth?<br />\n    (A) Mortality indicator<br />\n    (B) Health outcome indicator<br />\n    (C) Risk factor indicator<br />\n    (D) Process indicator</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4226, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 55, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What type of indicator is smoking prevalence?<br />\n    (A) Mortality indicator<br />\n    (B) Risk factor indicator<br />\n    (C) Healthcare access indicator<br />\n    (D) Process indicator</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4227, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 56, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What does the DHIS help healthcare professionals and managers do?<br />\n    (A) Entertain patients<br />\n    (B) Track health issues, identify areas for improvement, and make data-driven decisions<br />\n    (C) Conduct financial transactions<br />\n    (D) Perform marketing analy</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4228, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 57, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">DHIS stands for ________.<br />\n(A) District Health Improvement System<br />\n(B) Disease Health Information System<br />\n(C) District Health Information System	<br />\n(D) Disease Health Improvement System</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4229, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 58, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The primary function of DHIS is to ________ health data.<br />\n(A) Market<br />\n(B) Entertain<br />\n(C) Collect, store, manage, analyze, and visualize<br />\n(D) Ignore</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4230, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 59, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">DHIS helps healthcare professionals and managers to ________ health issues.<br />\n(A) Neglect<br />\n(B) Track<br />\n(C) Create<br />\n(D) Dismiss</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4231, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 60, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One of the uses of DHIS is to make ________ decisions.<br />\n(A) Random<br />\n(B) Arbitrary<br />\n(C) Data-driven<br />\n(D) Emotional</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4232, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 61, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">DHIS is similar to a ________ that helps visualize health data.<br />\n(A) Book<br />\n(B) Digital dashboard<br />\n(C) Newspaper<br />\n(D) Poster</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4233, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 62, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">DHIS assists in identifying ________ for improvement in healthcare services.<br />\n(A) Celebrations<br />\n(B) Areas<br />\n(C) Events<br />\n(D) Parties</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44');
