(4234, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 63, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The standardized forms used in DHIS for reporting health data are known as ________ tools.<br />\n(A) Marketing<br />\n(B) Financial<br />\n(C) HMIS<br />\n(D) Entertainment</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4235, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 64, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">HMIS tools ensure ________ and consistent reporting of health data.<br />\n(A) Inaccurate<br />\n(B) Delayed<br />\n(C) Accurate<br />\n(D) Random</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4236, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 65, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One of the examples of HMIS tools is the ________ form.<br />\n(A) Financial report<br />\n(B) Outpatient department (OPD) attendance<br />\n(C) Event invitation<br />\n(D) Entertainment schedule</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4237, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 66, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">DHIS data collection includes ________ numbers, diseases, and treatments.<br />\n(A) Employee<br />\n(B) Patient<br />\n(C) Visitor<br />\n(D) Staff</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4238, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 67, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">DHIS data management involves ________ the data in a secure and organized way.<br />\n(A) Deleting<br />\n(B) Ignoring<br />\n(C) Storing<br />\n(D) Misplacing</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4239, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 68, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">DHIS helps in ________ health trends and needs.<br />\n(A) Concealing<br />\n(B) Ignoring<br />\n(C) Analyzing<br />\n(D) Neglecting</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4240, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 69, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">DHIS is like a tool that helps get the right ________ to the right people at the right time.<br />\n(A) Entertainment<br />\n(B) Information<br />\n(C) Advertisements<br />\n(D) Detail</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4241, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 70, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">DHIS aim is to improve ________ care and outcomes.<br />\n(A) Population<br />\n(B) Random<br />\n(C) Patient<br />\n(D) Recreational</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4242, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 71, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One of the HMIS tools is the patient ________ form.<br />\n(A) Registration<br />\n(B) Complaint<br />\n(C) Admission<br />\n(D) Greeting</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4243, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 72, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Disease surveillance reporting forms are examples of ________ tools.<br />\n(A) DHIS<br />\n(B) HMIS<br />\n(C) Financial<br />\n(D) Marketing</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4244, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 73, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The monthly reporting forms in HMIS include ________ 106 and 107.<br />\n(A) Form<br />\n(B) HMIS<br />\n(C) Data<br />\n(D) DHIS</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4245, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 74, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">DHIS data analysis helps in making ________ decisions.<br />\n(A) Uninformed<br />\n(B) Data-driven<br />\n(C) Random<br />\n(D) Casual</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4246, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 75, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">DHIS enables healthcare managers to ________ health issues in their area.<br />\n(A) Guide<br />\n(B) Conceal<br />\n(C) Track<br />\n(D) Forget</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4247, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 76, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Health Management Information System aims to ___________.<br />\n(A) Enhance patient care and outcomes<br />\n(B) Contribute to the government revenue<br />\n(C) A only<br />\n(D) A and B only</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4248, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 77, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Applying expertise and best practices to improve healthcare decision making in HMIS is _______________.<br />\n(A) Performance Monitoring<br />\n(B) Knowledge Management<br />\n(C) Information dissemination<br />\n(D) Data Collection</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4249, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 78, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Gathering of patient information, healthcare services, and operational data under HMIS is ____________.<br />\n(A) Performance Monitoring<br />\n(B) Knowledge Management<br />\n(C) Information dissemination<br />\n(D) Data Collection</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4250, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 79, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Processing and interpreting data to extract insights and trends in Health Management Information system is __________.<br />\n(A) Data analysis<br />\n(B) Data gathering<br />\n(C) Knowledge Management<br />\n(D) Performance Monitoring</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4251, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 80, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary purpose of a Health Management Information System (HMIS)?<br />\n(A) To manage healthcare finances<br />\n(B) To collect and analyze healthcare data<br />\n(C) To develop healthcare policies<br />\n(D) To provide patient care services</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4252, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 81, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a benefit of HMIS in patient care?<br />\n(A) Improved patient safety<br />\n(B) Enhanced patient care<br />\n(C) Reduced healthcare costs<br />\n(D) Streamlined administrative tasks</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4253, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 82, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How does HMIS support decision-making in healthcare?<br />\n(A) By providing inaccurate data<br />\n(B) By providing timely and accurate data<br />\n(C) By reducing healthcare costs<br />\n(D) By improving patient safety</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4254, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 83, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a feature of HMIS that improves healthcare outcomes?<br />\n(A) Data analysis and reporting<br />\n(B) Patient engagement tools<br />\n(C) Telemedicine capabilities<br />\n(D) Electronic prescribing</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4255, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 84, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How does HMIS optimize resource allocation in healthcare?<br />\n(A) By reducing staff workload<br />\n(B) By increasing healthcare costs<br />\n(C) By streamlining administrative tasks<br />\n(D) By identifying resource gaps</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4256, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 85, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a benefit of HMIS in healthcare operations?<br />\n(A) Reduced administrative tasks<br />\n(B) Improved patient engagement<br />\n(C) Enhanced data security<br />\n(D) Streamlined healthcare operations</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4257, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 86, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How does HMIS support continuity of care?<br />\n(A) By enabling seamless communication<br />\n(B) By reducing healthcare costs<br />\n(C) By improving patient safety<br />\n(D) By streamlining administrative tasks</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4258, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 87, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a use of HMIS data in healthcare?<br />\n(A) Developing healthcare policies<br />\n(B) Conducting healthcare research<br />\n(C) Improving patient engagement<br />\n(D) Enhancing data security</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
(4259, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '300', 'First', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 88, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How does HMIS promote accountability in healthcare?<br />\n(A) By reducing transparency<br />\n(B) By increasing healthcare costs<br />\n(C) By promoting accountability among providers<br />\n(D) By streamlining administrative tasks</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 16:30:44', '2024-07-09 16:30:44'),
