(4452, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'REFERAL', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 1, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary purpose of a referral system in healthcare?<br />\n   a) To limit access to specialized care<br />\n   b) To ensure patients receive comprehensive care<br />\n   c) To increase healthcare costs for patients<br />\n   d) To decrease communication between healthcare providers<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 19:51:52', '2024-07-09 19:51:52'),
(4453, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'REFERAL', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 2, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What are the key components of an effective referral system?<br />\n   a) Limited communication channels<br />\n   b) Lack of criteria for referrals<br />\n   c) Coordination between providers<br />\n   d) Ignoring patient feedback<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 19:51:52', '2024-07-09 19:51:52'),
(4454, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'REFERAL', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 3, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What role do outreach services play in community health practice?<br />\n   a) Limiting access to healthcare for underserved populations<br />\n   b) Actively reaching out to underserved populations<br />\n   c) Providing specialized care only to affluent communities<br />\n   d) Focusing solely on hospital-based care<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 19:51:52', '2024-07-09 19:51:52'),
(4455, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'REFERAL', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 4, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How can community health practitioners improve their referral processes?<br />\n   a) By avoiding communication with specialists<br />\n   b) By educating patients about the importance of referrals<br />\n   c) By limiting access to specialized care<br />\n   d) By ignoring established referral criteria<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 19:51:52', '2024-07-09 19:51:52'),
(4456, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'REFERAL', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 5, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What are examples of outreach services in community health?<br />\n   a) Requiring patients to visit the hospital for all services<br />\n   b) Conducting health fairs and screenings in the community<br />\n   c) Providing limited healthcare services to a select few<br />\n   d) Ignoring the needs of underserved populations<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 19:51:52', '2024-07-09 19:51:52'),
(4457, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'REFERAL', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 6, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What are some challenges in implementing referral systems in community health settings?<br />\n   a) Strong relationships with local specialists<br />\n   b) Clear communication channels<br />\n   c) Patients? reluctance to follow through with referrals<br />\n   d) Regular review and update of referral protocols<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 19:51:52', '2024-07-09 19:51:52'),
(4458, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'REFERAL', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 7, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What benefits can integration of referral systems with outreach services bring?<br />\n   a) Increased healthcare costs for patients<br />\n   b) Improved continuity of care<br />\n   c) Limited access to specialized care<br />\n   d) Decreased coordination between providers<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 19:51:52', '2024-07-09 19:51:52'),
(4459, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'REFERAL', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 8, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the role of technology in supporting referral systems and outreach services?<br />\n   a) Limiting access to healthcare data<br />\n   b) Streamlining referral processes<br />\n   c) Ignoring the need for patient follow-up<br />\n   d) Decreasing communication between providers<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 19:51:52', '2024-07-09 19:51:52'),
(4460, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'REFERAL', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 9, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How can community health practitioners engage with marginalized communities through outreach services?<br />\n   a) By building trust through culturally sensitive approaches<br />\n   b) By excluding community members from program planning<br />\n   c) By ignoring social and economic barriers to healthcare access<br />\n   d) By advocating for policy changes that worsen health disparities<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 19:51:52', '2024-07-09 19:51:52'),
(4461, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'REFERAL', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 10, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What are the benefits of integrating referral systems with outreach services?<br />\n    a) Increased healthcare costs for patients<br />\n    b) Improved coordination between providers<br />\n    c) Decreased access to specialized care<br />\n    d) Limited communication between healthcare professionals<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 19:51:52', '2024-07-09 19:51:52'),
(4462, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'REFERAL', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 11, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a referral system in healthcare?<br />\n    a) A system for limiting access to healthcare services<br />\n    b) A process for ensuring patients receive comprehensive care<br />\n    c) A mechanism for avoiding communication between healthcare providers<br />\n    d) A method for increasing healthcare costs for patients<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 19:51:52', '2024-07-09 19:51:52'),
(4463, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'REFERAL', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 12, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is NOT a key component of an effective referral system?<br />\n    a) Clear communication channels<br />\n    b) Established criteria for referrals<br />\n    c) Lack of coordination between providers<br />\n    d) Follow-up mechanisms for patients<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 19:51:52', '2024-07-09 19:51:52'),
(4464, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'REFERAL', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 13, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary role of outreach services in community health practice?<br />\n    a) To limit access to healthcare for underserved populations<br />\n    b) To provide specialized care only to affluent communities<br />\n    c) To actively reach out to underserved populations<br />\n    d) To focus solely on hospital-based care<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 19:51:52', '2024-07-09 19:51:52'),
(4465, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'REFERAL', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 14, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How can community health practitioners facilitate referrals?<br />\n    a) By avoiding communication with specialists<br />\n    b) By limiting access to specialized care<br />\n    c) By educating patients about the importance of referrals<br />\n    d) By ignoring established referral criteria<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 19:51:52', '2024-07-09 19:51:52'),
(4466, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'REFERAL', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 15, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is an example of an outreach service in community health?<br />\n    a) Requiring patients to visit the hospital for all services<br />\n    b) Providing limited healthcare services to a select few<br />\n    c) Conducting health fairs and screenings in the community<br />\n    d) Ignoring the needs of underserved populations<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 19:51:52', '2024-07-09 19:51:52'),
(4467, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'REFERAL', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 16, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is one of the challenges in implementing referral systems in community health settings?<br />\n    a) Strong relationships with local specialists<br />\n    b) Patients? reluctance to follow through with referrals<br />\n    c) Regular review and update of referral protocols<br />\n    d) Clear communication channels<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-09 19:51:52', '2024-07-09 19:51:52'),
