(4832, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 1, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a school?   <br />\na. A place for leisure activities.                                                            <br />\nb. A place for educating learners <br />\nc. A place for manufacturing products <br />\nd. A place for sports activities <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4833, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 2, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following best describe a school community?<br />\na. only the pupils/students in the school                                               <br />\nb. only the teaching and non-teaching staff in the school <br />\nc. all the people living/working within the school premises <br />\nd. the sports community within the school premises  <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4834, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 3, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the definition of health according to the World Health Organization (WHO)?<br />\na. The absence of disease or infirmity <br />\nb. The physical well-being of a person                                                      <br />\nc. The mental well-being of a person <br />\nd. The complete physical, mental, and social well-being of a person <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4835, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 4, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is school health programme?<br />\na. A combination of various projects and activities in the school environment, designed to protect and promote the well-being of students and other members of the school community <br />\nb. A programme designed to keep school premises clean                           <br />\nc. A programme designed to keep pupils in school <br />\nd. A programme designed to keep teachers healthy  <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4836, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 5, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is school health services?<br />\na. A programme designed to keep teachers healthy <br />\nb. A programme designed to create awareness.                                           <br />\nc. The various actions taken by health teams to promote the highest possible level of health for school children throughout their years of studies <br />\nd. None of the above <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4837, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 6, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">All but one are common health conditions affecting school children<br />\na. Worm infestation<br />\nb. Anemia<br />\nc. Arthritis                                                                                                           <br />\nd. Dental caries  <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4838, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 7, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a school health team member?<br />\na. The school principal <br />\nb. The doctor in charge of the school                                                               <br />\nc. A trained teacher in health care <br />\nd. An untrained teacher in health center <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4839, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 8, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is school health committee?<br />\na. A committee made up of teachers alone                                                       <br />\nb. A committee made up of members that represent various fields of interest, charged with the overall responsibility of smooth functioning of the school health programme <br />\nc. A committee made up of only pupils/students <br />\nd. A committee made up of parents only <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4840, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 9, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is evaluation?                                                                                                       <br />\na. An organizing activity that begins at the identification of needed programme process throughout the planning phase and extends well beyond the length of the programme itself <br />\nb. An organizing activity that begins at the identification of needed programme process and is only for a short period <br />\nc. An organizing activity that begins at the start of the programme and ends before going beyond the length of the programme itself <br />\nd. None of the above <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4841, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 10, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of these is one of the objectives of the school health programme?            <br />\na. To produce a mentally vigorous child who is free from disease <br />\nb. To promote high levels of pollution in the school environment <br />\nc. To create awareness on the non-availability and improper utilization of health-related resources <br />\nd. To promote high levels of sanitary conditions in the school <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4842, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 11, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">All but one of the following best describe a healthful school environment. <br />\na. A dry and porous site.                                                                                      <br />\nb. Adequate portable water supply<br />\nc. Adequate lightening and well ventilated classrooms<br />\nd. An outgrown weeds within the compound <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4843, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 12, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Who is a school health provider?                                                                                 <br />\na. A person that comes to the school to provide health services <br />\nb. A nurse that comes to the school to provide health services <br />\nc. An Health workerin charge of the health care of the school children <br />\nd. A general Community Health Practitioner charged with the health care of teachers <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4844, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 13, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of these is one of the objectives of the school health programme?            <br />\na. To produce a mentally vigorous child who is free from disease <br />\nb. To promote high levels of pollution in the school environment <br />\nc. To create awareness on the non-availability and improper utilization of health-related resources <br />\nd. To promote high levels of sanitary conditions in the school <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4845, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 14, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">14. Which is one of the areas to cover during physical examination of a school child?<br />\na. The examination for mental illness                                                                <br />\nb. The examination of the lungs for disease <br />\nc. The examination of the hair to see if it has been done <br />\nd. The examination of the eyes to find out if the child has any disease <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4846, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 15, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What are the topics for health education in school?                                                 <br />\na. Personal, environmental hygiene, and sex education <br />\nb. Personal, environmental hygiene, and maternal health <br />\nc. Personal and environmental hygiene only <br />\nd. Personal hygiene only <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4847, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 16, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What does School, Home and Community Relationship cover?                             <br />\na. Various campaigns, advocacy, outreach and mobilizations aimed at bringing about a cordial relationship between the home, school and community <br />\nb. Only campaigns aimed at bringing cordial relationship between the home and school <br />\nc. Only campaigns aimed at bringing a cordial relationship between the community and school <br />\nd. None of the above <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4848, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 17, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Wholesome environment is provided for which group?                        <br />\na. Pupils only <br />\nb. Teachers only <br />\nc. School children and their teachers <br />\nd. Government officials only <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4849, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 18, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Some of the common signs and symptoms of Malaria includes all but ONE?    <br />\na. Body ache<br />\nb. fever and chills<br />\nc. Persistence diarrhea<br />\nd. Loss of appetite <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4850, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 19, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is not a component of school health programme?    <br />\na. Health services <br />\nb. Introduction of foreign languages among pupils <br />\nc. Health education <br />\nd. Safe school environment  <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4851, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 20, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is health education?                                                                                    <br />\na. Promotion of unhealthy habits among pupils <br />\nb. All knowledge, attitude practices and skills to ensure healthful living of the school child <br />\nc. An education that only involves the study of health in school <br />\nd. None of the above <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4852, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 21, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is one of the objectives of Health Education in school?  <br />\na. To promote unhealthy living habits  <br />\nb. Teaching pupils that sanitation is not important <br />\nc. Encourages pupils to indulge in addictive substances  <br />\nd. To teach pupils good hygiene and sanitation practices <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
(4853, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 22, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Some of the hazards children are exposed to include all EXCEPT?                  <br />\na. Drug abuse <br />\nb. Accident <br />\nc. Marital stress <br />\nd. Communicable diseases <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
