(4897, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'SCHOOL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 66, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The types of child-to-child care mentioned in this course include all but ONE?   <br />\na. Simple first aid care<br />\nb. Immunization therapy<br />\nc. Oral hygiene<br />\nd. Adequate nutritional diet <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 15:49:01', '2024-07-11 15:49:01'),
