(4981, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ADULT HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 50, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the main symptom of osteoporosis?<br />\na)Joint pain<br />\nb)Brittle and fragile bones<br />\nc)Muscle cramps<br />\nd)Skin rash <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 17:28:29', '2024-07-11 17:28:29'),
(4982, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ADULT HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 51, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which mental health disorder involves persistent feelings of sadness and loss of interest?<br />\na)Anxiety disorder<br />\nb)Bipolar disorder<br />\nc)Major depressive disorder<br />\nd)Schizophrenia <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-11 17:28:29', '2024-07-11 17:28:29'),
