(5156, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 25, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Mectizan is a brand name of?<br />\na) Albuterol<br />\nb) Fluoxetine<br />\nc) Ivermectine<br />\nd) Prednisone<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5157, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 26, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One of the following is a major side effect of antihistamine drugs like Chlorpheniramine is<br />\na) Hypersensitivity<br />\nb) Increased appetite<br />\nc) Drowsiness<br />\nd) Fatness<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5158, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 27, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is NOT used to treat symptoms of the common cold?<br />\na) Acetaminophen<br />\nb) Diphenhydramine<br />\nc) Aspirin<br />\nd) Pseudoephedrine<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5159, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 28, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a common over-the-counter medication for heartburn and indigestion?<br />\na) Omeprazole<br />\nb) Ranitidine<br />\nc) Antacids (e.g. gestid)<br />\nd) Pantoprazole<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5160, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 29, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The primary purpose of the WHO essential medicine list<br />\na) To promote use of expensive drugs<br />\nb)  To prioritise the use of traditional medicine<br />\nc) To ensure access to essential medicine for all<br />\nd) To restrict the use of certain medicines<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5161, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 30, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following medications is commonly used to treat acid reflux and peptic ulcers?<br />\na)Sucralfate<br />\n b) Metoclopramide<br />\nc) Omeprazole<br />\nd) Famotidine<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5162, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 31, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What the full meaning of NAFDAC<br />\na) Nigerian Agency for Food and Drug Administration and Control <br />\nb) National Food and Drug Administration and Control<br />\nc) National Agency for Food and Drug Administration and Control<br />\nd) Nigeria Agency for Food and Drug Administration<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5163, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 32, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The agency responsible for drug regulation in Nigeria is?<br />\na) Pharmacy Council Forum<br />\nb) Pharmacy Society Fund<br />\nc) Pharmacy Council of Nigeria<br />\nd) Pharmacy Council Centre<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5164, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 33, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the term for the process of administering multiple vaccines at the same time?<br />\na) Co-administration<br />\nb) Concurrent administration<br />\nc) Simultaneous administration<br />\nd) Combination vaccination<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5165, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 34, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a common side effect of vaccination?<br />\na) Severe pain<br />\nb) Allergic reaction<br />\nc) Fever<br />\nd) Paralysis<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5166, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 35, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the term for the protection provided by a vaccine to an individual who has not received the vaccine themselves?<br />\na) Passive immunity <br />\nb) Active immunity<br />\nc) Herd immunity<br />\nd) Community immunity<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5167, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 36, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a reason for vaccine hesitancy?<br />\na) Fear of side effects<br />\nb) Concerns about effectiveness<br />\nc) All of the above <br />\nd) Religious or philosophical beliefs<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5168, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 37, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a myth about vaccine safety?<br />\na) Vaccines contain harmful toxins<br />\nb) Vaccines are made from aborted foetuses<br />\nc) Vaccines can cause autism <br />\nd) Vaccines are thoroughly tested for safety<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5169, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 38, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the name of the organization responsible for monitoring vaccine safety inNigeria?<br />\na) Centre for Disease Control and Prevention<br />\nb) Food and Drug Administration <br />\nc) National Agency for Food and Drugs Administration and control<br />\nd) Vaccine Datalink<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5170, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 39, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a serious adverse event that can occur after vaccination?<br />\na) Redness and swelling at the injection site<br />\nb) Fever and headache<br />\nc) Anaphylaxis<br />\nd) Soreness and fatigue<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5171, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 40, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a contraindication for vaccination?<br />\na) Pregnancy <br />\nb) Mild illness<br />\nc) Severe allergic reaction to a previous vaccine<br />\nd) Breastfeeding<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5172, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 41, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is an example of an essential medicine?<br />\na) Pain relief medication for terminal illnesses<br />\nb) Chemotherapy for cancer<br />\nc) Antibiotics for pneumonia <br />\nd) All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5173, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 42, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What are the criteria for selecting essential medicines according to WHO?<br />\na) Patent status, manufacturer, and packaging<br />\nb) Popularity, availability, and marketing<br />\nc) Efficacy, safety, and cost-effectiveness<br />\nd) Prescription requirements, storage conditions, and shelf life<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5174, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 43, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a benefit of essential medicines?<br />\na) Reduced healthcare costs<br />\nb) Increased pharmaceutical profits<br />\nc) Improved health outcomes<br />\nd) All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5175, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 44, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the goal of the WHO\'s Essential Medicines Program?<br />\na) To promote innovation in drug development<br />\nb) To regulate pharmaceutical marketing practices<br />\nc) To ensure access to essential medicines for all populations <br />\nd) To standardize drug packaging and labeling<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5176, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 45, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a key principle of the WHO\'s Essential Medicines List?<br />\na) Prioritizing patented medicines<br />\nb) Focusing on rare diseases<br />\nc) Selecting medicines based on public health need<br />\nd) Promoting generic medicines<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5177, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 46, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the purpose of the WHO\'s Model List of Essential Medicines?<br />\na) To restrict access to certain medicines<br />\nb) To promote pharmaceutical innovation<br />\nc) To guide national essential medicine lists <br />\nd) To standardize drug packaging<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5178, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 47, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is an example of an essential medicine for chronic disease?<br />\na) Metformin for diabetes<br />\nb) Antiretroviral therapy for HIV<br />\nc) All of the above<br />\n d) Statins for hypertension<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5179, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 48, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the benefit of using essential medicines in healthcare?<br />\na) Improved patient compliance and adherence<br />\nb) Increased pharmaceutical profits and market share<br />\nc) Reduced healthcare costs and improved health outcomes<br />\nd) Enhanced doctor-patient relationships<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5180, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 49, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a challenge in ensuring access to essential medicines?<br />\na) High cost of research and development<br />\nb) Limited availability in remote areas<br />\nc) All of the above<br />\nd) Lack of healthcare infrastructure <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5181, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 50, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the term for an ADR that occurs at a dose normally used for a specific treatment?<br />\na) Type C reaction<br />\nb) Type B reaction<br />\nc) Type A reaction<br />\nd) Type D reaction<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5182, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 51, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What the meaning of the term ADRs<br />\na) Advance drug reaction<br />\nb) Adverse duration of reaction<br />\nc) Adverse drug reactions<br />\nd) Advance drug reactions<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5183, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 52, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the term for the process of monitoring and managing ADRs?<br />\na) Pharmacodynamics<br />\nb) Pharmacokinetics<br />\nc) Pharmacovigilance<br />\nd) Pharmacogenomics<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5184, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 53, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary role of Village Health Workers (VHWs) in community health?<br />\na) To provide medical treatment and diagnosis<br />\nb) To conduct research and collect data<br />\nc) To educate and mobilize communities for health promotion<br />\nd) To distribute medicines and supplies<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5185, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 54, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the goal of community health initiatives?<br />\na) To cure diseases<br />\nb) To provide medical care only<br />\nc) To prevent diseases and promote health<br />\nd) To conduct research only<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5186, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 55, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a benefit of community-based health programs?<br />\na) Increased healthcare costs<br />\nb Reduced community engagement<br />\nc) ) Improved health outcomes <br />\nd) Decreased healthcare access<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5187, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 56, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The full meaning of NDIC is?<br />\na) National Centre for Disease control<br />\nb) Nigeria Control for Disease Centre<br />\nc) Nigeria Centre for Disease Control<br />\nd) National Control for Disease Centre<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5188, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 57, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is NOT a common treatment for diabetes?<br />\na) Metformin<br />\nb) Insulin<br />\nc) Ibuprofen<br />\nd) Glipizide<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5189, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 58, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is commonly used to treat bacterial infections?<br />\na) Lorazepam<br />\nb) Diphenhydramine<br />\nc) Amoxicillin<br />\nd) Citalopram<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5190, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 59, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following medications is commonly used as a pain reliever and anti-inflammatory?<br />\na) Propranolol<br />\nb) Duloxetine<br />\nc) Naproxen<br />\nd) Lorazepam<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5191, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 60, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which medication is commonly used to treat allergies and allergic reactions?<br />\na) Metformin<br />\nb) Prednisone<br />\nc) Diphenhydramine<br />\nd) Valsartan<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5192, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 61, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which medication is commonly used to treat seizures and epilepsy?<br />\na) Aripiprazole<br />\nb) Sertraline<br />\nc) Levetiracetam<br />\nd) Venlafaxineore<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5193, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 62, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The housing of the drug in a safe place to safeguard the quality and potency before dispensing and distribution to user is?<br />\na. drug procurement<br />\n     b. Rational drug<br />\nc. drug storage <br />\nd. drug management<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5194, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 63, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One the major difference between private pharmacy and DRF is?<br />\na. number of workers<br />\nb. volume of money<br />\nc. profit and access<br />\nd. free drugs<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5195, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 64, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Antiallergies like promethazine, antidotes like atropine, gastrointestinal meds like magnesium trisilicate are part of the standard government approved essential drug list<br />\n    a. Incorrect<br />\n    b. False<br />\n    c. True<br />\nd. none of the above<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5196, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 65, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the term for the process of empowering communities to take ownership of their health?<br />\na) Community development<br />\nb) Community mobilization<br />\nc) Community empowerment<br />\nd) Community engagement<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5197, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 66, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the main focus of Village Health Workers (VHWs) in community health?<br />\na) Curative care<br />\nb) Palliative care<br />\nc) Preventive care<br />\nd) Promotive care<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5198, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 67, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a key characteristic of Village Health Workers (VHWs)?<br />\na) They are medical professionals<br />\nb) They are paid employees<br />\nc) They are from the community they serve <br />\nd) They have advanced medical training<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5199, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 68, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the purpose of community health needs assessments?<br />\na) To identify healthcare providers in the area<br />\nb) To determine healthcare costs<br />\nc) To identify community health priorities<br />\nd) To evaluate healthcare outcomes<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5200, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 69, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a benefit of community-based health programs?<br />\na) Increased healthcare costs<br />\nb) Reduced community engagement<br />\nc) Improved health equity<br />\nd) Decreased healthcare access<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5201, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 70, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the term for the process of working with communities to identify and address health concerns?<br />\na) Community participation<br />\nb) Community engagement<br />\nc) Community diagnosis <br />\nd) Community mobilization<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5202, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 71, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary goal of Village Health Workers (VHWs) in community health?<br />\na) To provide medical treatment and diagnosis<br />\nb) To conduct research and collect data<br />\nc) To promote healthy behaviors and prevent disease <br />\nd) To distribute medicines and supplies<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5203, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 72, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a key function of Village Health Workers (VHWs)?<br />\na) Conducting surgeries and medical procedures<br />\nb) Administering medications and treatments<br />\nc) Providing health education and counseling<br />\nd) Conducting medical research and trials<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5204, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 73, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the term for the process of involving communities in the planning and delivery of healthcare services?<br />\na) Community empowerment<br />\nb) Community engagement<br />\nc) Community participation <br />\nd) Community mobilization<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5205, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 74, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a benefit of community-based health programs?<br />\na) Reduced healthcare access<br />\nb) Increased healthcare costs<br />\nc) Improved health outcomes<br />\nd) Decreased community engagement<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5206, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 75, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the term for the process of identifying and addressing social determinants of health in communities?<br />\na) Community diagnosis<br />\nb) Community assessment<br />\nc) Community needs assessment<br />\nd) Community health analysis<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32');
