(5207, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 76, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the main focus of Village Health Workers (VHWs) in community health?<br />\na) Providing curative care<br />\nb) Supporting palliative care<br />\nc) Promoting preventive care <br />\nd) Encouraging self-care<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5208, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 77, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a key characteristic of effective Village Health Workers (VHWs)?<br />\na) They are medically trained professionals<br />\nb) They are paid employees<br />\nc) They are from the community they serve <br />\nd) They have advanced medical equipment<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5209, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 78, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the purpose of community health outreach programs?<br />\na) To provide medical treatment<br />\nb) To conduct research <br />\nc) To promote healthy behaviors<br />\nd) To distribute medicines<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5210, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 79, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a benefit of community-based health programs?<br />\na) Reduced community engagement<br />\nb) Increased healthcare costs<br />\nc) Improved health equity<br />\nd) Decreased healthcare access<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5211, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 80, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a key function of Village Health Workers (VHWs)?<br />\na) Providing medical care and treatment<br />\nb) Conducting medical procedures and surgeries<br />\nc) Educating communities on healthy practices d) Prescribing medications and treatments<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5212, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 81, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the term for the process of identifying and addressing health disparities in communities?<br />\na) Community health assessment<br />\nb) Community health analysis<br />\nc) Community health equity<br />\nd) Community health planning<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
