(5215, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 84, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary goal of community mobilization?<br />\na) To provide healthcare services<br />\nb) To conduct research and collect data<br />\nc) To empower communities to take action on health issues<br />\nd) To distribute healthcare resources<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5216, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 85, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a key step in community mobilization?<br />\na) Identifying community leaders<br />\nb) Conducting community assessments<br />\nc) All of the above<br />\nd) Developing a community action plan<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5217, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 86, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the term for the process of supporting and strengthening community organizations and initiatives?<br />\na) Community mobilization<br />\nb) Community empowerment<br />\nc) Community capacity building<br />\nd) Community engagement<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5218, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 87, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the main focus of community mobilization efforts?<br />\na) Providing healthcare services<br />\nb) Conducting health education<br />\nc) Empowering communities to take action<br />\nd) Distributing health resources<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5219, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 88, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How many tablet of Medication is to be given to a patients with the following prescription: 400mg tds 2/7?<br />\na) 3 tablets<br />\nb) 12 tablets<br />\nc) 6 tablets<br />\nd) 8 tablets<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
