(5223, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 92, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary goal of disease prevention efforts?<br />\na) To treat existing diseases<br />\nb) To promote healthy behaviors<br />\nc) To prevent the occurrence of diseases <br />\nd) To conduct research on diseases<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5224, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 93, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a key strategy for disease prevention?<br />\na) Screening and early detection<br />\nb) Health education and promotion<br />\nc) All of the above <br />\nd) Environmental health measures<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
