(5227, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 96, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary purpose of immunization?<br />\na) To treat existing diseases<br />\nb) To manage chronic diseases<br />\nc) To prevent the occurrence of diseases<br />\nd) To conduct research on diseases<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5228, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 97, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a type of immunity gained through immunization?<br />\na) Herd immunity<br />\nb) Passive immunity<br />\nc) Active immunity<br />\nd) Innate immunity<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5229, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 98, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the term for the process of protecting individuals and communities from vaccine-preventable diseases?<br />\na) Inoculation<br />\nb) Vaccination<br />\nc) Immunization <br />\nd) Immunotherapy<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5230, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 99, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the maximum paracetamol dosage per day for an adult?<br />\na) 1000mg<br />\nb) 2000mg<br />\nc) 3000mg<br />\nd) 4000mg<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5231, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ESSENTIAL MEDICINE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 100, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following vaccines is typically administered first to infants?<br />\na) MMR (measles, mumps, and rubella)<br />\nb) DTaP (diphtheria, tetanus, and pertussis)<br />\nc) HepB (hepatitis B)<br />\nd) Hib (Haemophilusinfluenzae type b)<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 16:14:32', '2024-07-12 16:14:32'),
(5232, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 1, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The primary purpose of Monitoring and evaluation is ---------------------<br />\n(a) To assess program implementation<br />\n(b) To measure program outcomes<br />\n(c) To assess performance and impact<br />\n(d) To optimize resource allocation<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5233, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 2, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">________ is a information management system that manages and analyzes data related to healthcare operations, services and outcome.<br />\n(a) Health indicator <br />\n(b) Health management information system<br />\n(c) Health information technology <br />\n(d) Health statistics<br />\n</p>', '', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5234, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 3, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which component of monitoring and evaluation involves tracking progress and identifying areas for improvement?<br />\n(a) Setting clear goals and objectives<br />\n(b) Establishing indicators and targets<br />\n(c) Regular monitoring reporting<br />\n(d) Data collection and analysis<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5235, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 4, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The following are the key components of  Health Management Information system except <br />\n(a) Data analysis and reporting<br />\n(b) Decision making support systems<br />\n(c) Data collection and storage<br />\n(d)  All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5236, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 5, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the M&E tool involves collecting data through systematic observation?<br />\n(a) Survey and questionnaire<br />\n(b) Observational studies<br />\n(c) Performance monitoring and review<br />\n(d) Data analytics and visualization<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5237, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 6, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Appointment scheduling and Electronic Health Records are part of the --------------.<br />\n(a) Functions of HMIS<br />\n(b) Benefits of HMIS<br />\n(c) Advantages of HMIS<br />\n(d) Overall goals of HMIS<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5238, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 7, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Health management information system can be implemented at the various levels EXCEPT<br />\n(a) Health facilities<br />\n(b) National health ministry or departments<br />\n(c) District or regional health authorities<br />\n(d) Academic institutions<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5239, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 8, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the main benefit of using logic models and theory of change in M&E?<br />\n(a) Improved program effectiveness<br />\n(b) Enhance accountability and transparency<br />\n(c) Identification of best practices<br />\n(d) Clarification of program goals and objectives<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5240, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 9, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">For the implementation of the Health Management Information System  to be effective, it requires -------------<br />\n(a) Adequate resources and infrastructures<br />\n(b) Non-challant attitude of the personnel<br />\n(c) Overlooking of errors<br />\n(d) Manpower reduction.<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5241, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 10, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which stage of the Monitoring and Evaluation cycle involves sharing findings and recommendations?<br />\n(a) Planning<br />\n(b) Implementation<br />\n(c) Analysis<br />\n(d) Reporting<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
