(5284, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 53, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of these forms and records are collected by the VVHWs and TBAs<br />\n(A) Household registration forms<br />\n(B) Family folder/health records<br />\n(C) Community health worker visitation forms<br />\n(D) All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5285, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 54, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">HMIS aims to<br />\n(A) Improve health outcomes<br />\n(B) Support health research and development<br />\n(C)  A&B only<br />\n(D) A only<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5286, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 55, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The key components of HMIS include____________<br />\n(A) Sanitation of the affected areas in the community<br />\n(B) Data Management Systems<br />\n(C) Frequent visitation to our healthcare facility<br />\n(D) Bringing new people to the health system<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5287, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 56, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Effective Health Management Information leads to which of the following?<br />\n(A) Better healthcare planning and management<br />\n(B) Improved health service delivery<br />\n(C) Enhance health outcome<br />\n(D) A,B&C<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5288, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 57, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Health Management Information System is essential for healthcare systems to function efficiently and effectively, ultimately leading to improved __________ and __________<br />\n(A) Source of wealth, overcoming challenges<br />\n(B) Preparedness for disaster, Control<br />\n(C) Health outcomes, quality of life<br />\n(D) Monitoring, Evaluation<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5289, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 58, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Health Information Management System does not involve one of the following<br />\n(A) Data Collection<br />\n(B) Data analysis<br />\n(C) Data dissemination<br />\n(D) Data degradation<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5290, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 59, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">As a Junior community health worker, you are expected to make records of the various health activities in your jurisdiction with_________<br />\n(A) Levity<br />\n(B) Zealousness<br />\n(C) Lackadaisical attitude<br />\n(D) Sentiment<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5291, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 60, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Health facility staff collects data using forms and records, such as _____________<br />\n(A) Patient registration forms<br />\n(B) Laboratory request and result forms<br />\n(C) A only<br />\n(D) A and B<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5292, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 61, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">_________ are the essential healthcare providers in rural and hard-to-reach areas. <br />\n(A) Volunteer village health workers and traditional birth attendants<br />\n(B) Doctors and nurses<br />\n(C) Community health officers<br />\n(D) Health administrators<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5293, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 62, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The purpose of patient registration forms is to __________<br />\n(A) To record immunizations<br />\n(B) To track disease surveillance<br />\n(C) To register new patients<br />\n(D) To record referrals<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5294, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 63, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What type of records are kept for pregnant women?<br />\n(A) Antenatal care records<br />\n(B) Postnatal care records<br />\n(C) Immunization records<br />\n(D) Family planning records<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5295, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 64, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the importance of accurate record-keeping?<br />\n(A) To monitor health trends and outcomes<br />\n(B) To evaluate the effectiveness of healthcare services<br />\n(C) To identify areas for improvement<br />\n(D) All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5296, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 65, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What type of records are kept for births attended by traditional birth attendants?<br />\n(A) Delivery records<br />\n(B) Postnatal care records<br />\n(C) Antenatal care records<br />\n(D) Immunization records<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5297, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 66, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the purpose of disease surveillance records?<br />\n(A) To track immunizations<br />\n(B) To monitor disease outbreaks<br />\n(C) To record patient referrals<br />\n(D) To track patient registrations<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5298, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 67, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What type of records are kept for patients referred to higher-level facilities?<br />\n(A) Referral records<br />\n(B) Treatment records<br />\n(C) Immunization records<br />\n(D) Family planning records<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5299, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 68, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Why is accurate record-keeping crucial in healthcare?<br />\n(A) To enhance patient care and safety<br />\n(B) To facilitate continuity of care<br />\n(C) To inform health policy and decision-making<br />\n(D) All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5300, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 69, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">___________   records are kept to track the activities and services provided by volunteer village health workers and traditional birth attendants?<br />\n(A) Monthly activity logs<br />\n(B) Patient registration forms<br />\n(C) Health history records<br />\n(D) Immunization records<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5301, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 70, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What determines the format of record-keeping in rural and hard-to-reach areas?<br />\n(A) Availability of resources and infrastructure<br />\n(B) Number of patients seen<br />\n(C) Type of services provided<br />\n(D) Level of training of healthcare providers<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5302, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 71, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Junior community health extension workers (JCHEWs) need to keep ____________ records to effectively carry out their duties.<br />\n(A) Accurate<br />\n(B) Inaccurate<br />\n(C) Complete<br />\n(D) Incomplete<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51');
INSERT INTO `questions` (`id`, `session1`, `department`, `level`, `semester`, `course`, `exam_type`, `exam_mode`, `exam_category`, `no_of_qst`, `upload_no_of_qst`, `question_type`, `question_no`, `question`, `answer`, `graphic`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(5303, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 72, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">JCHEWs should keep _____________ records for pregnant women, including antenatal care and delivery records.<br />\n(A) Patient<br />\n(B) Health<br />\n(C) Medical<br />\n(D) Clinical<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5304, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 73, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Accurate record-keeping is crucial for JCHEWs to ____________ health trends and outcomes, evaluate healthcare services, and identify areas for improvement.<br />\n(A) Monitor<br />\n(B) Evaluate<br />\n(C) Identify<br />\n(D) Analyze<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5305, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 74, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">JCHEWs should keep records of _______________________ activities, including patient consultations, health education, and community outreach.<br />\n(A) Daily<br />\n(B) Weekly<br />\n(C) Monthly<br />\n(D) Yearly<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5306, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 75, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Accurate record-keeping enhances ____________ care and safety, facilitates continuity of care, and informs health policy and decision-making.<br />\n(A) Patient<br />\n(B) Healthcare<br />\n(C) Medical<br />\n(D) Clinical<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5307, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 76, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What purpose do patient registration forms serve in relation to health history records?<br />\n(A) Provide background information<br />\n(B) Inform immunization decisions<br />\n(C) Track vaccine-preventable diseases<br />\n(D) Guide treatment decisions<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5308, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 77, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which records inform immunization decisions?<br />\n(A) Health history records<br />\n(B) Immunization records<br />\n(C) Disease surveillance records<br />\n(D) Patient registration forms<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5309, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 78, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the purpose of immunization records in relation to disease surveillance records?<br />\n(A) Track vaccine-preventable diseases<br />\n(B) Inform immunization decisions<br />\n(C) Guide treatment decisions<br />\n(D) Ensure follow-up care<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5310, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 79, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which records ensure continuity of care during pregnancy and childbirth?<br />\n(A) Antenatal care records<br />\n(B) Delivery records<br />\n(C) Postnatal care records<br />\n(D) Family planning records<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5311, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 80, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the purpose of delivery records in relation to postnatal care records?<br />\n(A) Ensure follow-up care after childbirth<br />\n(B) Continuity of care during pregnancy and childbirth<br />\n(C) Guide treatment decisions<br />\n(D) Track vaccine-preventable diseases<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5312, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 81, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which records inform reproductive health decisions?<br />\n(A) Family planning records<br />\n(B) Health education records<br />\n(C) Patient consultation records<br />\n(D) Community outreach records<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5313, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 82, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the purpose of disease surveillance records in relation to treatment records?<br />\n(A) Guide treatment decisions<br />\n(B) Inform immunization decisions<br />\n(C) Track vaccine-preventable diseases<br />\n(D) Ensure follow-up care<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5314, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 83, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which records track outreach activities and services provided?<br />\n(A) Community outreach records<br />\n(B) Monthly activity logs<br />\n(C) Patient consultation records<br />\n(D) Health education records<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5315, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 84, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Who brings the records from the community?<br />\n(A) Healthcare providers<br />\n(B) Community health workers (CHWs)<br />\n(C) Clients<br />\n(D) Clinic administrators<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5316, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 85, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the first step in updating client clinic records?<br />\n(A) Review records for accuracy and completeness<br />\n(B) Receive records from community health workers (CHWs)<br />\n(C) Verify client identification and demographics<br />\n(D) Update client records in the clinic database<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5317, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 86, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is verified in step 3 of the process?<br />\n(A) Client identification and demographics<br />\n(B) Vital signs and test results<br />\n(C) Medication lists and immunization history<br />\n(D) Disease surveillance data<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5318, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 87, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is updated in step 4 of the process?<br />\n(A) Community records<br />\n(B) Client records in the clinic database<br />\n(C) Healthcare provider information<br />\n(D) Clinic administrative records<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5319, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 88, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What type of data is entered in step 5 of the process?<br />\n(A) Client identification and demographics<br />\n(B) Vital signs, test results, medication lists, immunization history, and disease surveillance data<br />\n(C) Healthcare provider information<br />\n(D) Clinic administrative records<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5320, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 89, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is done in step 6 of the process?<br />\n(A) Update client records in the clinic database<br />\n(B) Link community records to existing clinic records<br />\n(C) Verify client identification and demographics<br />\n(D) Receive records from community health workers (CHWs)<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5321, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 90, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is ensured in step 7 of the process?<br />\n(A) Data consistency and integrity<br />\n(B) Accuracy of community records<br />\n(C) Completeness of client demographics<br />\n(D) Security of clinic records<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5322, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 91, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is done with updated records in step 10 of the process?<br />\n(A) Filed securely<br />\n(B) Shared with community health workers (CHWs)<br />\n(C) Used for research purposes<br />\n(D) Discarded<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5323, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 92, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">A Community Health Information System (CHIS) is a digital platform that _____________ health data from community-level health programs and services.<br />\n(A) Collects, stores, and analyzes<br />\n(B) Collects and stores<br />\n(C) Analyzes and reports<br />\n(D) Tracks and monitors<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
(5324, '2024/2025', 'Certificate in Community Health(JCHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'HEALTH INFORMATION MANAGEMENT', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 93, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Community Health Information System  enables _______________ and tracking of patients.<br />\n(A) Data collection and reporting<br />\n(B) Patient registration<br />\n(C) Health facility management<br />\n(D) Disease surveillance<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 17:57:51', '2024-07-12 17:57:51'),
