(5344, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 13, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Mrs Adeyinka was rushed to your health facility from her place of work on 4/06/24 with the complaint of heavy bleeding for the past 2days, Abdominal pain, weakness of the body, on examination LMP was : 25/04/24 and the cervical OS is close. What is her condition<br />\n(a) Uterine Fibroid<br />\n(b) Threatened Abortion (c)Haemophilia.<br />\n(d) Menstruation</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
