(5347, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 16, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Infertility is<br />\n(a) inability of couple to achieve pregnancy.<br />\n(b) is the inability of couple to achieve pregnancy after regular unprotected sexual intercourse.<br />\n(c) is the inability of couple to achieve pregnancy after regular protected sexual intercourse.<br />\n(d) is the inability of couple to achieve pregnancy after regular unprotected sexual intercourse for at least one year.</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5348, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 17, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">All of these are ways of managing infertility except???<br />\n(a). Surgery to correct abnormality <br />\n(b). Adoption <br />\n(c). procrastination <br />\n(d). Special drugs to stimulate ovulation.                                     <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
