(5351, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 20, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the Assumption of Standing orders state that the hospital referral facilities will be available in the national health care system.<br />\n(a) Second<br />\n(b) Third<br />\n(c) Fist<br />\n(d) First</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
