(5358, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 27, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following topics cover the definition of infertility?<br />\n(a) Unprotected sex<br />\n(b) All of the above<br />\n(c) None of the above<br />\n(d) A year of consistent sexual intercourse</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5359, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 28, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One of the following affects sperm quality and quantity<br />\n(a) Lack of ejaculation <br />\n(b) Premature ejaculation <br />\n(c) Complication of mumps <br />\n(d) Inflammation of testes<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5360, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 29, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">IVF means<br />\n(a) Internal Vaginal Fertility<br />\n(b) In Vitro Fallopian<br />\n(c) Intra Vaginal Fuss<br />\n(d) In Vitro Fertilization</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5361, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 30, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Infertility is best prevented by:<br />\n(a) Avoiding unsafe abortion<br />\n(b) Avoid adoption<br />\n(c) Practice celibacy<br />\n(d) Rely on surrogacy</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5362, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 31, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The best time to perform an abortion is:<br />\n(a) Before the fetus is viable<br />\n(b) All of the above<br />\n(c) Within 28 weeks of conception<br />\n(d) None of the above</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5363, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 32, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is not a form of surgical abortion?<br />\n(a) Dilation and Evacuation<br />\n(b) Dilation and Curettage<br />\n(c) Misoprostol administration<br />\n(d) Suction aspiration</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
