(5365, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 34, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following habits will not contribute to an abortion?<br />\n(a) Unhealthy sexual behavior<br />\n(b) Regular exercise<br />\n(c) Excessive alcohol consumption<br />\n(d) Drug use</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5366, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 35, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following factors will contribute to an abortion?<br />\n(a) Gestational age<br />\n(b) Skill of the provider<br />\n(c) All of the above<br />\n(d) Overall health of the individual</p>', '', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5367, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 36, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Pregnant women above the age of 35 have a higher risk of abortion due to:<br />\n(a) Hormonal changes<br />\n(b) Past history of promiscuity<br />\n(c) All of the above<br />\n(d) None of the above</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5368, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 37, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Referral system should be practiced in the following facilities:<br />\n(a) Hospitals<br />\n(b) All of the above<br />\n(c) None of the above<br />\n(d) Primary healthcare centers</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5369, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 38, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">CBOs provide the following support services except:<br />\n(a) Education<br />\n(b) Referrals for abortion care<br />\n(c) Counselling<br />\n(d) Provide relief materials for post-abortion care</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5370, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 39, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The following are components of Post-abortion care<br />\n(a) Physical recovery<br />\n(b) Emotional support<br />\n(c ) Contraceptive administration<br />\n(d) Follow-up care</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5371, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 40, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Post-abortion care should be integrated into???????????<br />\n(a) Routine reproductive healthcare services<br />\n(b) Promoting seamless access to care<br />\n(c) Continuity of care<br />\n(d) Create reproductive goals</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5372, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 41, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The act of getting things done with people with the use of materials is refer to<br />\n(a) supervision<br />\n(b) advocacy<br />\n(c) refilent<br />\n(d) management</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5373, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 42, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The act of building an individual?s into organization and     with     managing     and     directing.     These organizations is refer to as (a) maldesignation<br />\n(b) supervision<br />\n(c) administration<br />\n(d) management</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5374, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 43, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The following are functions of management except <br />\n(a) staffing <br />\n(b) controlling <br />\n(c) co efficiency <br />\n(d)motivation <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5375, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 44, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The following are tools of management except<br />\n(a) division of labour<br />\n(b) motivation<br />\n(c) delegation<br />\n(d) mobilization</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5376, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 45, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The following are effect of proper budgeting except<br />\n(a) cut expanded<br />\n(b) actually save money<br />\n(c) plan for the future<br />\n(d) no control other money</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5377, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 46, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The following are elements of direction except<br />\n(a) motivation<br />\n(b) communication<br />\n(c) resources<br />\n(d) leadership</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5378, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 47, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Planning means<br />\n(a) efficient and making things done<br />\n(b) dictate course of action<br />\n(c) frustrate future organizational goal<br />\n(d) decide in advance what is to be done.</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5379, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 48, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The  followings  are  the  functions  of  management except<br />\n(a) planning<br />\n(b) organization<br />\n(c) executing<br />\n(d) directing</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5380, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 49, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Cost concept means<br />\n(a)   values   of   assets   are   shown   it   the   cost   of acquisition<br />\n(b)  concept  that  states  revenue  is  recognized  (c) information in financial transaction<br />\n(d) all transactions must be from aspects</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5381, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 50, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The following are the functions of primary health care except <br />\n(a) meeting people?s health needs through comprehensive promoter, protective, preventive health care service <br />\n(b) through primary health care service health need of people by curative, rehabilitative and palliative care <br />\n(c) systematically addressing the broader determinant  of health <br />\n(d) supporting treatment without the use of standing orders <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5382, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 51, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the normal heart rate range for a newborn?<br />\nA) 60-100 beats per minute<br />\nB) 100-160 beats per minute<br />\n(C) 120-180 beats per minute<br />\nD) 140-200 beats per minute.   Answer: B</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5383, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 52, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is the most accurate method to measure a newborn\'s temperature?<br />\n(A) Oral<br />\n(B) Axillary<br />\n(C) Rectal<br />\n(D) Tympanic</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5384, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 53, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Newborns have a higher respiratory rate compared to older children and adults.<br />\n(A) True<br />\n(B) False</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5385, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 54, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which reflex is typically checked for reflex irritability in the Apgar score?<br />\n(A) Rooting reflex<br />\n(B) Moro reflex<br />\n(C) Grasp reflex<br />\n(D) Response to stimulation</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5386, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 55, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the normal respiratory rate range for a newborn?<br />\n(A) 20-30 breaths per minute<br />\n(B) 30-60 breaths per minute<br />\n(C) 40-80 breaths per minute<br />\n(D) 60-100 breaths per minute</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5387, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 56, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The closure of which structure is a critical component of the newborn?s cardiovascular adaptation to extrauterine life?<br />\n(A) Foramen ovale<br />\n(B) Ductus arteriosus<br />\n(C) Ductus venosus<br />\n(D) All of the above</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5388, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 57, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which part of the fetal circulatory system allows blood to bypass the lungs?<br />\n(A) Foramen ovale<br />\n(B) Ductus venosus<br />\n(C) Ductus arteriosus<br />\n(D) Umbilical vein</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5389, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 58, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The initial breath of a newborn is stimulated by:<br />\n(A) Increased oxygen levels<br />\n(B) Decreased carbon dioxide levels<br />\n(C) Changes in temperature and environmental pressure<br />\n(D) Nutrient intake</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5390, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 59, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">A completely pink baby would receive a score of:<br />\n(A) 0<br />\n(B) 1<br />\n(C) 2<br />\n(D) 3</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5391, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 60, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a primary function of surfactant in the newborn?s lungs?<br />\n(A) Enhance lung compliance and prevent alveolar collapse<br />\n(B) Increase blood flow to the lungs<br />\n(C) Regulate heart rate<br />\n(D) Control body temperature</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5392, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 61, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What are examples of epidemic-prone diseases?<br />\nA) HIV, Tuberculosis, Chickenpox<br />\nB) Cholera, Ebola, Yellow Fever<br />\nC) Diabetes, Hypertension, Asthma<br />\nD) Alzheimer\'s disease, Parkinson\'s disease, Multiple sclerosis</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5393, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 62, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which diseases are targeted for eradication and elimination efforts?<br />\nA) Common cold, Seasonal allergies, Headaches<br />\nB) Polio, Guinea worm disease, Measles<br />\nC) Diabetes, Hypertension, Asthma<br />\nD) Alzheimer\'s disease, Parkinson\'s disease, Multiple sclerosis</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5394, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 63, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What defines diseases of public health importance?<br />\n   A) Diseases with high mortality rates<br />\n   B) Diseases affecting specific age groups<br />\n   C) Diseases that are reportable due to their significance<br />\n   D) Chronic diseases with long-lasting effects<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5395, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 64, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary means of breaking the chain of infection?<br />\nA) Vaccination<br />\nB) Hand hygiene<br />\nC) Quarantine<br />\nD) Antibiotic treatment</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5396, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 65, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is an infectious agent?<br />\nA) A disease vector<br />\nB) A reservoir for microorganisms<br />\nC) A means of disease transmission<br />\nD) A microorganism causing infectious disease</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5397, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 66, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Where do microorganisms thrive and reproduce in reservoirs?<br />\nA) Only in human beings<br />\nB) Only in animals<br />\nC) Only in inanimate objects<br />\nD) In human beings, animals, and inanimate objects</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5398, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 67, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a portal of exit?<br />\nA) A way for microorganisms to enter a new host<br />\nB) A way for microorganisms to leave the reservoir<br />\nC) A means of indirect transmission<br />\nD) A method of vector-borne transmission</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5399, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 68, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How are microorganisms carried from one place to another in the mode of transmission?<br />\nA) By contact only<br />\nB) By airborne particles only<br />\nC) By a combination of means<br />\nD) By vector-borne transmission only</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5400, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 69, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the portal of entry?<br />\nA) A way for microorganisms to leave the reservoir<br />\nB) A means by which microorganisms gain access to a new host<br />\nC) A method of transmission<br />\nD) A reservoir for microorganisms</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5401, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 70, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Who is a susceptible host?<br />\nA) A person with immunity to a disease<br />\nB) A person without physical resistance to a disease<br />\nC) A person with high pathogenicity<br />\nD) A person without exposure to microorganisms</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5402, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 71, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the main mode of direct transmission?<br />\n    A) Droplet transmission<br />\n    B) Airborne transmission<br />\n    C) Vector-borne transmission<br />\n    D) Contact transmission<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5403, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 72, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How does indirect contact transmission occur?<br />\nA) Through direct physical contact<br />\nB) Through large droplets in the air<br />\nC) Via transfer of microorganisms via an object<br />\nD) Through contaminated food or water</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27');
INSERT INTO `questions` (`id`, `session1`, `department`, `level`, `semester`, `course`, `exam_type`, `exam_mode`, `exam_category`, `no_of_qst`, `upload_no_of_qst`, `question_type`, `question_no`, `question`, `answer`, `graphic`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(5404, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 73, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is involved in droplet transmission?<br />\nA) Transfer of microorganisms via contaminated food<br />\nB) Transfer of microorganisms via large droplets from sneezing or coughing<br />\nC) Transfer of microorganisms via vectors<br />\nD) Transfer of microorganisms via direct physical contact</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5405, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 74, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How are microorganisms transmitted in airborne transmission?<br />\nA) Through contaminated objects<br />\nB) Through small particles suspended in the air<br />\nC) Through direct physical contact<br />\nD) Through droplets from sneezing or coughing</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5406, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 75, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What does common vehicle transmission refer to?<br />\nA) Transmission through vectors<br />\nB) Transmission through airborne particles<br />\nC) Transmission through contaminated sources<br />\nD) Transmission through direct physical contact</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5407, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 76, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How does vector-borne transmission occur?<br />\nA) Through contaminated objects<br />\nB) Through direct physical contact<br />\nC) Through animals and insects<br />\nD) Through small particles suspended in the air</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5408, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 77, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which mode of transmission involves transfer of microorganisms via an object?<br />\nA) Direct contact<br />\nB) Droplet transmission<br />\nC) Indirect contact<br />\nD) Airborne transmission</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5409, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 78, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a susceptible host lacking?<br />\nA) Immunity<br />\nB) Pathogenicity<br />\nC) Virulence<br />\nD) Resistance</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5410, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 79, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary method to control airborne transmission?<br />\n    A) Hand hygiene<br />\n    B) Quarantine<br />\n    C) Ventilation systems<br />\n    D) Vaccination<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
(5411, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PREPARATORY', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 80, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How can the chain of infection be effectively controlled?<br />\nA) By breaking one link in the chain<br />\nB) By vaccination only<br />\nC) By antibiotic treatment<br />\nD) By knowledge of specific diseases only</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-12 19:54:27', '2024-07-12 19:54:27'),
