(5457, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 26, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The spinal cord starts from _______ and terminate at _______<br />\n(a)C1 Vertebral and T12 Vertebra <br />\n(b)C4 Vertebra and L1/L2 vertebra <br />\n(c)Firemen Magnus <br />\n(d)Foranen magnum and coccygeal vertebra <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:58', '2024-07-15 15:44:58'),
(5458, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 27, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Chemical digestion of ________ starts from the mouth <br />\n(a)Protein <br />\n(b)fats and oil <br />\n(c) carbohydrate <br />\n(d)cabbage <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:58', '2024-07-15 15:44:58'),
(5459, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 28, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Optic nerve carries __________ impulses<br />\n(a)Olfactory <br />\n(b)Nervous  <br />\n(c)Taste <br />\n(d)Visual<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:58', '2024-07-15 15:44:58'),
(5460, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 29, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">A pinot of communication between a Neuron and another or an effector organ is<br />\n(a)junction <br />\n(b)Neural Junction <br />\n(c)Synapse <br />\n(d)Neuromuscular junction <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:58', '2024-07-15 15:44:58'),
(5461, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 30, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The protective layer of the eye is the<br />\n(a)Retina <br />\n(b)Choroid <br />\n(c)Sclera <br />\n(d)Pupil<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:58', '2024-07-15 15:44:58'),
(5462, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 31, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The following are classes of glands except <br />\n(a)Simple tubular gland <br />\n(b)Branched tubular gland <br />\n(c)Synovial glands <br />\n(d)Alveolar glands <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:58', '2024-07-15 15:44:58'),
(5463, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 32, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Blood is made up of the following except <br />\n(a)Leukocyte <br />\n(b)Thrombocytes <br />\n(c)Osteocytes <br />\n(d)Erythrocytes <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:58', '2024-07-15 15:44:58'),
(5464, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 33, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The pulmonary artery carries:<br />\n(a)Deoxgenzted blood from the heart to lung <br />\n(b)Oxygenated  blood from the heart to the lung <br />\n(c)Deoygenated blood from the lung to the heart <br />\n(d)Oxygenated blood from the heart to the other partsof the body.<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:58', '2024-07-15 15:44:58'),
(5465, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 34, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Patient with blood group O can only receive  blood from:<br />\n(a)Group AB <br />\n(b)Group O <br />\n(c)Group AD <br />\n(d)Group B <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:58', '2024-07-15 15:44:58'),
(5466, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 35, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">High blood pressure as a disease can affects one of the following system of the body<br />\n(a)Respiratory  system <br />\n(b)skeletal system <br />\n(c)cardiovascular system <br />\n(d)muscular system<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:58', '2024-07-15 15:44:58'),
(5467, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 36, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Child with haemoglobin less than 7.5% is said to be suffering from;<br />\n(a)Hemoglobininaemia <br />\n(b)Excess blood  loss <br />\n(c)Hyperthemia <br />\n(d)Hypovolaemia<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:58', '2024-07-15 15:44:58'),
(5468, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 37, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One of the following is a  complication of hypertension;<br />\n(a)Ocational throbbing headache <br />\n(b)Dysphasia <br />\n(c)Forgetfulness <br />\n(d)Stroke<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:58', '2024-07-15 15:44:58'),
(5469, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 38, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The pulse rate of a newborn at birth is :<br />\n(a)180beats/minutes <br />\n(b)100beats/minutes <br />\n(c)90beats/minutes <br />\n(d)60_80beats/minutes <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:58', '2024-07-15 15:44:58'),
(5470, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 39, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Deficiency of vitaminB12 causes:<br />\n(a)Nutritional anemia <br />\n(b)Haemorrhagic anemia <br />\n(c)pernicious anemia <br />\n(d)Iron deficiency anemia<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:58', '2024-07-15 15:44:58'),
(5471, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 40, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Normal haemoglobin values for men and women is;<br />\n(a)13__18g/100ml/11.5__16.5g/100mls <br />\n(b)11.5__14g/100ml/12.5__15g/100ml <br />\n(c)12__18g/100ml/12.5__15g/100ml <br />\n(d)13.5__18g/100ml/10.5__15g/100ml<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:59', '2024-07-15 15:44:59'),
(5472, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 41, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Vomiting of blood is known as;<br />\n(a)Hematemesis <br />\n(b)Haemoptysis <br />\n(c)Haematuria <br />\n(d)Haematoma<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:59', '2024-07-15 15:44:59'),
(5473, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 42, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of these cells does not have nucleus?<br />\n(a)Eosinophil <br />\n(b)Mature red blood cells <br />\n(c)Epithelial cells <br />\n(d)White blood cells<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:59', '2024-07-15 15:44:59'),
(5474, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 43, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The following except one are the signs of heart problemin a person;<br />\n(a)Blueness of the lips and fingers <br />\n(b)Clubbing of the fingers <br />\n(c)Emphysema <br />\n(d)Rapid breathing<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:59', '2024-07-15 15:44:59'),
(5475, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 44, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Normal range of time for  blood to cloth outside the body is <br />\n(a)11__15seconds <br />\n(b)5__10 seconds <br />\n(c)5__25seconds <br />\n(d)1__5seconds<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:59', '2024-07-15 15:44:59'),
(5476, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 45, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One of the following is a phagocyte;<br />\n(a)Bosophil <br />\n(b)Eosinophil <br />\n(c)Neutrophils <br />\n(d)Lymphocyte<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:59', '2024-07-15 15:44:59'),
(5477, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 46, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The bicuspid valve is also known as;<br />\n(a)Mitral valve <br />\n(b)Right atrioventricular valve <br />\n(c)seminar valve <br />\n(d)Tricuspid valve<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:59', '2024-07-15 15:44:59'),
(5478, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 47, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following instruments is used for measuring blood pressure?<br />\n(a)Thermometer <br />\n(b)Sphygmomanometer <br />\n(c)Stethoscope <br />\n(d)Auroscope <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:59', '2024-07-15 15:44:59'),
(5479, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 48, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Neonatal jaundice is;<br />\n(a)Caused where there is massive destruction of red blood cell in a new born <br />\n(b)Caused by yellow fever virus <br />\n(c)A disease inherited from the child \'s mother <br />\n(d)The first stage of neonatal tetanus <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:59', '2024-07-15 15:44:59'),
