(5485, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 54, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The thrombocytes function primarily in ______<br />\n (a) Haemostasis <br />\n(b) Erythropoiesis <br />\n(c) Thrombopoiesis <br />\n(d) Homeostasis<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:59', '2024-07-15 15:44:59'),
(5486, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 55, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Low level of thrombocytes is referred to as: <br />\n(a) Athrombocytes <br />\n(b) Thrombocytopenia <br />\n(c) Thrombocytis <br />\n(d) Leukemia<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:59', '2024-07-15 15:44:59'),
(5487, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 56, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Cardiac output is calculated by one of the following <br />\n(a) stroke volume ? heart rate <br />\n(b) stroke volume ? 100 <br />\n(c) stroke volume ? 10 <br />\n(d) None of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:59', '2024-07-15 15:44:59'),
(5488, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'ANATOMY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 57, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The specialized cardiac muscle in the heart is known as: <br />\n(a) pericardium <br />\n(b) myocardium <br />\n(c) Endocardium <br />\n(d) pleura<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-15 15:44:59', '2024-07-15 15:44:59'),
