(5955, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'CLINICAL SKILLS', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 84, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is NOT a common visual acuity test? <br />\n(a) Snellen test <br />\n(b) LogMAR test <br />\n(c) Jaeger test <br />\n(d) Ishihara test  <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:55:13', '2024-07-16 14:55:13'),
(5956, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'CLINICAL SKILLS', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 85, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How is a visual acuity test typically performed? <br />\n(a) The patient reads letters on a chart from a distance <br />\n(b) The patient distinguishes between different colors <br />\n(c) The patient identifies shapes in their peripheral vision <br />\n(d) The patient follows a moving light with their eyes  <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:55:13', '2024-07-16 14:55:13'),
(5957, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'CLINICAL SKILLS', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 86, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary purpose of a urine test? <br />\n(a) To measure blood pressure <br />\n(b) To check for abnormalities in the urine <br />\n(c) To assess heart function <br />\n(d) To test lung capacity  <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:55:13', '2024-07-16 14:55:13'),
