(5959, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'CLINICAL SKILLS', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 88, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What might the presence of protein in the urine indicate? <br />\n(a) Dehydration <br />\n(b) Kidney disease <br />\n(c) Lung infection <br />\n(d) Heart disease  <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:55:13', '2024-07-16 14:55:13'),
(5960, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'CLINICAL SKILLS', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 89, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following urine tests can help diagnose a urinary tract infection (UTI)? <br />\n(a) Urine glucose test <br />\n(b) Urine protein test <br />\n(c) Urine culture <br />\n(d) Urine pH test<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:55:13', '2024-07-16 14:55:13'),
(5961, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'CLINICAL SKILLS', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 90, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What does a high level of glucose in the urine typically indicate? <br />\n(a) Liver disease <br />\n(b) Diabetes <br />\n(c) Heart failure <br />\n(d) Anemia  <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:55:13', '2024-07-16 14:55:13'),
