(5967, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'CLINICAL SKILLS', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 96, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the main purpose of performing a breast self-examination (BSE)? <br />\n(a) To detect any changes or abnormalities in the breasts <br />\n(B) To diagnose breast cancer <br />\n(C) To measure breast size <br />\n(d) To enhance breast shape<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:55:13', '2024-07-16 14:55:13'),
(5968, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'CLINICAL SKILLS', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 97, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">When is the best time to perform a breast self-examination? <br />\n(a) During menstruation <br />\n(b) A few days before menstruation<br />\n(c) A few days after menstruation ends <br />\n(d) Any time of the month  <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:55:13', '2024-07-16 14:55:13'),
