(5970, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'CLINICAL SKILLS', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 99, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What should you look for when performing a breast self-examination? <br />\n(a) Changes in skin texture, such as dimpling <br />\n(b) Unexplained pain in the breast or nipple <br />\n(c) Lumps or thickened areas <br />\n(d) All of the above <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:55:13', '2024-07-16 14:55:13'),
(5971, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'CLINICAL SKILLS', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 100, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">If you find a lump during a breast self-examination, what should you do? <br />\n(a) Ignore it, as it is probably nothing <br />\n(b) Wait a few months to see if it changes <br />\n(c) Schedule an appointment with a healthcare provider <br />\n(d) Try to diagnose it yourself using online resources <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:55:13', '2024-07-16 14:55:13'),
(5972, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 1, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">In neonatal resuscitation, the following materials are needed are <br />\na) Bag valve mask, gloves, cotton swab, needle and syringe.<br />\nb) Bag valve mask, gloves, cotton swab, needle and syringe,<br />\nc) Bag valve mask, gloves, bulb syringe and hydrocortisone<br />\nd) Bag valve mask gloves, bulb syringe and stethoscope<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(5973, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 2, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Prevention of congenital anomalies include the following except<br />\na) Access to antenatal care <br />\nb) Adequate diet <br />\nc) Indiscriminate use of drug  <br />\nd) Restriction of pregnant women to infectious region<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(5974, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 3, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Select the odd among these cause of congenital anomalies <br />\na) genetic factors <br />\nb) environmental factors <br />\nc) psychosocial factors  <br />\nd) teratogenic factors<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(5975, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 4, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">At transitional phase, all but one occur in the in the neonate lungs<br />\na) There\'s a decrease in blood flow resistance in the lungs due to increased oxygen<br />\nb) The lungs are deflated and start working on their own<br />\nc) Fluids are absorbed from the respiratory system<br />\nd) The lungs are inflated and start working on their own<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
