(5979, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 8, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Swollen breasts are present during the early weeks of life in neonates because of<br />\na) Maternal hormone - estrogen. <br />\nb) Breast massage<br />\nc) Gender<br />\nd) Excess fat<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
