(5986, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 15, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">These are advantages of exclusive breastfeeding to an infant except<br />\na) Prevents malnutrition<br />\nb) Confers immunity<br />\nc) Reduces risk of breast engorgement      <br />\nd) Easily digestible <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(5987, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 16, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One of these excludes the management of mastitis<br />\na) Incision and drainage   <br />\nb) Express the milk from the breast gently <br />\nc) Give warm compress<br />\nd) Give antibiotics <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(5988, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 17, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">These are mother\'s problem s of breastfeeding<br />\na) Mastitis<br />\nb) Breast engorgement<br />\nc) Abnormal nipple shapes<br />\nd) Poor sucking reflex <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(5989, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 18, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One of the following is not true about Vitamin K supplementation<br />\na) Given to prevent hemorrhage<br />\nb) Administered intramuscularly<br />\nc) Dosage of 0.5mg to 1mg PRN<br />\nd) Given as prophylaxis <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(5990, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 19, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Breastfeeding is best initiated at <br />\na) At least within 30 minutes to 1 hour of birth. <br />\nb) After 1 hour of birth<br />\nc) 30 seconds after birth<br />\nd) After 24 hours of birth<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(5991, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 20, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Physical examination is conducted on neonates in order to<br />\na) Treat babies with injuries<br />\nb) Detect congenital anomalies<br />\nc) Detect injuries<br />\nd) Frighten the parents<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(5992, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 21, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The following can be cause(s) of umbilical cord compression except<br />\na) Multiple gestation/pregnancy<br />\nb) Multiple deliveries<br />\nc) Cord round the neck<br />\nd) Placenta previa<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(5993, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 22, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">These are common causes of asphyxia except<br />\na) Placenta abruptio<br />\nb) Placenta previa<br />\nc) Hypotonic uterine contractions <br />\nd) Hypertonic uterine contractions <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(5994, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 23, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The cause of yellowish discoloration of the skin eyes and mucus membrane in jaundice is <br />\na) Hyperbilirubinemia<br />\nb) Heparin <br />\nc) Lanugo <br />\nd) Surfactant <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(5995, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 24, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One of the following is odd.<br />\na)  Ensure the baby\'s mouth is attached to the nipple <br />\nb) Ensure the baby\'s mouth covers the  areola <br />\nc) The baby should be put to breasts and not the mother bending to breastfeed <br />\nd) Mother should support baby\'s buttocks and back with the hand<br />\n</p>', '', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(5996, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 25, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Asphyxia is a result of<br />\na)  Inadequate oxygen <br />\nb) Hyper perfusion of oxygen <br />\nc) Inadequate carbon dioxide<br />\nd) Hyper perfusion of carbon dioxide <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(5997, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 26, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Neonates can be assisted to breathe through <br />\na) Administration of oxygen <br />\nb) Administration of hydrocortisone injection <br />\nc) Slapping the back and buttocks of the baby <br />\nd) Application of methylated spirit on pad for inhalation<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(5998, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 27, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One of the following is true about physiological jaundice <br />\na) Due to an underlying health risk<br />\nb) Usually results on its own <br />\nc) Exacerbated by dehydration<br />\nd) Less common in preterm babies <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(5999, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 28, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">This is true about the skin color of a normal neonate<br />\na) Reddish brown<br />\nb) Purplish dark red<br />\nc) Purplish red<br />\nd) Brownish red<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6000, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 29, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">This is the function of the liver in neonates<br />\na) Produces bilirubin that breakdown protein<br />\nb) It produces substances that help the blood to clot<br />\nc) Excrete waste products in the body<br />\nd) Serves as hemopoietic organ<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6001, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 30, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">A baby placed on weighing scale naked will loose heat through<br />\na) Conduction<br />\nb) Convection<br />\nc) Evaporation<br />\nd) Radiation<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6002, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 31, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The initial thick , bright, yellow milk secreted from the breast after delivery is called<br />\na) Colomstrum<br />\nb) Clostridium<br />\nc) Colostrum<br />\nd) Clostrum <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6003, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 32, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">These are components of kangaroo mother care except<br />\na) Kangaroo nutrition<br />\nb) Kangaroo sponsor<br />\nc) Kangaroo position<br />\nd) Kangaroo discharge <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6004, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 33, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Grimace in APGAR scoring scale means<br />\na) Response to climate observed by facial expression<br />\nb) Response to external stimuli observed by facial expression<br />\nc) Response to internal stimuli observed by facial expression<br />\nd) Response to birth injury observed by facial expression<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6005, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 34, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Muscle tone can be rated as the following except;<br />\na) Some flexion of extremities<br />\nb) Most flexion of extremities<br />\nc) Limp/Flaccid<br />\nd) Active motion/Well flexed <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6006, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 35, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Baby Oyemade \'s APGAR score is 4. This denotes the baby<br />\na) Is normal<br />\nb) Require doctor\'s intervention<br />\nc) Require resuscitation<br />\nd) Dead<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6007, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 36, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Jaundice is common in newborn because<br />\na) They have extra RBC that begins to breakdown after birth <br />\nb) They have extra WBC that begins to breakdown after birth <br />\nc) They have extra thrombocytes that begins to breakdown after birth <br />\nd) They have extra lymphocytes that begins to breakdown after birth <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6008, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 37, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The newborn hemoglobin level ranges between<br />\na) 1.4 - 2.4g/dL<br />\nb) 14 - 24g/dL<br />\nc) 1.4 - 2.4mg/dL<br />\nd) 14 - 24mg/dL<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6009, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 38, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">These conditions often time lead to respiratory compromise in newborn except<br />\na) Fetal distress<br />\nb) Preterm delivery<br />\nc) Cephalic delivery<br />\nd) Vaginal breech delivery <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6010, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 39, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">KMC is beneficial to hospitals because of<br />\na) Effective thermal control<br />\nb) Less dependence on incubator<br />\nc) Improved bonding between mother and child.<br />\nd) Better organized sleep pattern<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6011, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 40, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Mrs Ogungbade switched on fan in the labour room because of the sweating mother forgetting the baby has not been clothed. This means of heat loss is<br />\na) Convection<br />\nb) Radiation<br />\nc) Evaporation<br />\nd) Conduction <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6012, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 41, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">These skin diseases are peculiar to newborn except<br />\na) Heat rash<br />\nb) Dermatitis<br />\nc) Pneumonia<br />\nd) Pemphigus<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6013, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 42, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Symptoms of infection in neonates include the following except<br />\na) Fever<br />\nb) Abdominal distension<br />\nc) Alertness<br />\nd) Hypothermia<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6014, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 43, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One of the following is not a feature of prematurity.<br />\na) Fused eyelid<br />\nb) Translucent and flaky skin<br />\nc) Very little hair on the head<br />\nd) Ability to regulate body temperature<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6015, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 44, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Complication of prematurity is <br />\na) Jaundice<br />\nb) Kwashiorkor<br />\nc) Tetanus<br />\nd) Malaria <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6016, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 45, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Spina bifida occurs in newborn as a result of deficiency in <br />\na) Folic acid<br />\nb) Citric acid<br />\nc) Acetylsalicylic acid<br />\nd) Acetaminophen<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11');
