(6017, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 46, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Imperforate anus means<br />\na) There is no anal opening<br />\nb) There is no colon opening <br />\nc) There is no hymen opening <br />\nd) There is no esophageal opening <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6018, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 47, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">In resuscitation, neonate should be in <br />\na) Prone position<br />\nb) Supine position<br />\nc) Lithotomy position<br />\nd) Dorsal recumbent position <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6019, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 48, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">A baby who is completely pink will be rated ____ under color<br />\na) 2<br />\nb) 1<br />\nc) 0<br />\nd) 10<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6020, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 49, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">A baby with heart rate of 97b/m will be rated in heart rate column as <br />\na) 1<br />\nb) 2<br />\nc) 0<br />\nd) 6<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6021, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 50, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The acronym M-N in suctioning is <br />\na) Mouth and nares<br />\nb) Mastoid and nasal congestion<br />\nc) Mouth and nose<br />\nd) Malleus and nares<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6022, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 51, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Mouth -Nose is the order of suctioning a neonate so as to<br />\na) Prevent asthma<br />\nb) Prevent aspiration <br />\nc) Prevent jaundice <br />\nd) Prevent pneumonia <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6023, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 52, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">In ventilating neonates, the mask should cover the<br />\na) Nose and mouth<br />\nb) Chin, mouth and nose<br />\nc) Chin, mouth and eyes<br />\nd) Nose and chin<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6024, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 53, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Causes of prematurity include all except<br />\na) Maternal infection<br />\nb) Neonatal infection<br />\nc) Obesity<br />\nd) Underweight <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6025, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 54, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Idiopathic cause of congenital anomaly indicates<br />\na) The anomaly is caused by infection <br />\nb) The anomaly is caused by exposure to chemicals <br />\nc) The anomaly is caused by biological factors <br />\nd) The anomaly is caused by unknown factor<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6026, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 55, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">These are suctioning devices except<br />\na) Mucus extractor<br />\nb) Suctioning machine<br />\nc) Oropharyngeal airway<br />\nd) Bulb syringe <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
(6027, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'MODIFIED ESSENTIAL NEWBORN', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 80, 80, 'text', 56, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Hydrocephalus is a congenital anomaly of the<br />\na) Brain<br />\nb) Head<br />\nc) Caput<br />\nd) Occiput <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:56:11', '2024-07-16 14:56:11'),
