(6271, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 40, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What are the objectives of the National Health Policy 2016?<br />\n    A. Legal reforms  <br />\n    B. Achieving universal health coverage, enhancing health security, and strengthening health systems  <br />\n    C. Financial oversight  <br />\n    D. Educational development  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6272, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 41, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is not a component of the health care system?<br />\n    A. Health service delivery  <br />\n    B. Leadership and governance  <br />\n    C. Financial management  <br />\n    D. Manufacturing industry  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6273, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 42, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the role of medical products and technology in a health system?<br />\n    A. Legal adjudication  <br />\n    B. Ensuring the availability of essential medicines and medical products  <br />\n    C. Financial strategies  <br />\n    D. Educational reforms  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6274, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 43, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the goal of a health system?<br />\n    A. Legal reforms  <br />\n    B. Protect and improve people\'s health  <br />\n    C. Financial oversight  <br />\n    D. Educational development  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6275, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 44, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is not a goal of population policy?<br />\n    A. Addressing fertility  <br />\n    B. Managing mortality  <br />\n    C. Controlling legal documentation  <br />\n    D. Regulating migration  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6276, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 45, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which agency was created to sustain the PHC agenda?<br />\n    A. Federal Ministry of Health  <br />\n    B. National Primary Health Care Development Agency  <br />\n    C. National Health Insurance Scheme  <br />\n    D. National Council on Health  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6277, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 46, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the role of health financing?<br />\n    A. Legal documentation  <br />\n    B. Mobilizing funds for healthcare  <br />\n    C. Building infrastructure  <br />\n    D. Educational reforms  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6278, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 47, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What does governance and stewardship in health provide?<br />\n    A. Legal reforms  <br />\n    B. Effective leadership  <br />\n    C. Financial oversight  <br />\n    D. Educational strategies  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6279, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 48, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the aim of the health information system?<br />\n    A. Legal documentation  <br />\n    B. Providing integrated health information  <br />\n    C. Financial management  <br />\n    D. Educational reforms  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6280, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 49, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What does partnership for health promote?<br />\n    A. Legal reforms  <br />\n    B. Effective cooperation among health stakeholders  <br />\n    C. Financial strategies  <br />\n    D. Educational development  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6281, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 50, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What does the health infrastructure aim for?<br />\n    A. Legal reforms  <br />\n    B. Adequate health care network  <br />\n    C. Financial oversight  <br />\n    D. Educational reforms  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6282, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 51, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary level of healthcare delivery in Nigeria?<br />\n    A. Secondary level  <br />\n    B. Tertiary level  <br />\n    C. Primary level  <br />\n    D. Quaternary level  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6283, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 52, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which level of healthcare is provided by district health centers?<br />\n    A. Primary level  <br />\n    B. Secondary level  <br />\n    C. Tertiary level  <br />\n    D. Quaternary level  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6284, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 53, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What type of healthcare facility operates at the federal level?<br />\n    A. Primary health center  <br />\n    B. District hospital  <br />\n    C. Teaching hospital  <br />\n    D. Private clinic  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6285, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 54, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Who chairs the health team at the primary level in Nigeria?<br />\n    A. Community health officer  <br />\n    B. Medical officer of health  <br />\n    C. Environmental health officer  <br />\n    D. Registered nurse  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6286, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 55, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is not a function of the primary level of healthcare?<br />\n    A. Enforce and supervise environmental health laws  <br />\n    B. Implement PHC services  <br />\n    C. Provide specialized surgical interventions  <br />\n    D. Facilitate referral services  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6287, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 56, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">At which level of healthcare are in-patient and out-patient services such as diagnostic, medical, and surgical interventions provided?<br />\n    A. Primary level  <br />\n    B. Secondary level  <br />\n    C. Tertiary level  <br />\n    D. Quaternary level  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6288, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 57, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which healthcare level is involved in the organization and management of health training institutions?<br />\n    A. Primary level  <br />\n    B. Secondary level  <br />\n    C. Tertiary level  <br />\n    D. Quaternary level  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6289, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 58, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the main focus of tertiary healthcare in Nigeria?<br />\n    A. Health education  <br />\n    B. Preventive care  <br />\n    C. Specialized care and research  <br />\n    D. Environmental health  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6290, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 59, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which professional is not typically part of the primary healthcare team?<br />\n    A. Community health extension worker  <br />\n    B. Dental therapist  <br />\n    C. Ophthalmologist  <br />\n    D. Medical laboratory technician  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6291, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 60, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which level of healthcare provides the bulk of preventive services?<br />\n    A. Primary level  <br />\n    B. Secondary level  <br />\n    C. Tertiary level  <br />\n    D. Quaternary level  <br />\n   <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6292, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 61, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Who is responsible for formulating state health policies in Nigeria?<br />\n    A. Federal Ministry of Health  <br />\n    B. Local Government Health Authority  <br />\n    C. State Ministry of Health  <br />\n    D. Private healthcare providers  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6293, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 62, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which healthcare level emphasizes the recruitment and discipline of staff?<br />\n    A. Primary level  <br />\n    B. Secondary level  <br />\n    C. Tertiary level  <br />\n    D. Quaternary level  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6294, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 63, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a key function of the tertiary level healthcare system?<br />\n    A. Mobilize community members  <br />\n    B. Provide funds for manpower training  <br />\n    C. Enforce environmental health laws  <br />\n    D. Liaise with state governments  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6295, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 64, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which healthcare level is most involved in maternal and child health services at the local community level?<br />\n    A. Primary level  <br />\n    B. Secondary level  <br />\n    C. Tertiary level  <br />\n    D. Quaternary level  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6296, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 65, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary objective of policy formulation in healthcare?<br />\n    A. Creating financial oversight  <br />\n    B. Identifying and planning solutions to health problems  <br />\n    C. Organizing training programs  <br />\n    D. Establishing private hospitals  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6297, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 66, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which factor is not typically considered in the policy formulation process?<br />\n    A. Problem definition  <br />\n    B. Policy tools selection  <br />\n    C. Policy evaluation  <br />\n    D. Financial auditing  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6298, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 67, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which level of healthcare is responsible for monitoring and supervising projects and programs at state and local government levels?<br />\n    A. Primary level  <br />\n    B. Secondary level  <br />\n    C. Tertiary level  <br />\n    D. Quaternary level  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6299, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 68, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a distributive policy example?<br />\n    A. Speed limits  <br />\n    B. Public education spending  <br />\n    C. Establishing regulatory agencies  <br />\n    D. Tax collection  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6300, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 69, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following factors influences health in Nigeria?<br />\n    A. Cultural factors  <br />\n    B. Technological factors  <br />\n    C. Geological factors  <br />\n    D. Astrological factors  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6301, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 70, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What does NSHDP stand for?<br />\n    A. National Strategic Health Development Plan  <br />\n    B. National Strategic Health Delivery Program  <br />\n    C. National Sustainable Health Development Policy  <br />\n    D. National Systems Health Development Plan  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6302, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 71, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which is not a function of the National Health Act?<br />\n    A. Provide framework for regulation of national health system  <br />\n    B. Establish the Federal Ministry of Health  <br />\n    C. Enforce international health standards  <br />\n    D. Set standards for rendering health services  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6303, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 72, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which level of healthcare would handle more complex problems that require secondary level services?<br />\n    A. Primary level  <br />\n    B. Secondary level  <br />\n    C. Tertiary level  <br />\n    D. Quaternary level  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6304, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 73, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which policy is involved with the management of health training institutions?<br />\n    A. Distributive policy  <br />\n    B. Regulatory policy  <br />\n    C. Constituent policy  <br />\n    D. Miscellaneous policy  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6305, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 74, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a key focus of socio-economic factors affecting health in Nigeria?<br />\n    A. Cultural beliefs  <br />\n    B. Inadequate infrastructure  <br />\n    C. Technological advancements  <br />\n    D. Astrological beliefs  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10'),
(6306, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'NIGERIA HEALTHCARE SYSTEM', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 75, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a personal factor that influences health status?<br />\n    A. Environmental pollution  <br />\n    B. Economic policies  <br />\n    C. Personal hygiene  <br />\n    D. Cultural taboos  <br />\n    <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-16 14:58:10', '2024-07-16 14:58:10');
