(6487, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PHARMACOLOGY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 56, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary goal of pharmacology?<br />\na) To study the effects of drugs on the body<br />\nb) To develop new drugs<br />\nc) To treat diseases<br />\nd) To understand drug interactions<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-17 14:43:40', '2024-07-17 14:43:40'),
(6488, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PHARMACOLOGY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 57, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the term for the study of the absorption, distribution, metabolism, and excretion of drugs?<br />\na) Pharmacokinetics<br />\nb) Pharmacodynamics<br />\nc) Pharmacotherapeutics<br />\nd) Clinical pharmacology<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-17 14:43:40', '2024-07-17 14:43:40'),
