(6498, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PHARMACOLOGY', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 67, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following drugs is an example of a competitive antagonist?<br />\na) Atropine<br />\nb) Propranolol<br />\nc) Morphine<br />\nd) Aspirin<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-17 14:43:40', '2024-07-17 14:43:40'),
