(6878, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 47, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The drug that is commonly used to deworm  pregnant mothers is called<br />\na. Dazolin<br />\nb. Meperazine<br />\nc. Mebendazole<br />\nd. Combatin<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
