(6881, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 50, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">increased fetal heart rate during labour is a sign of <br />\na. maternal pain<br />\nb. fetal presentation<br />\nc. flat applause<br />\nd. foetal distress<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6882, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 51, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One of the physiological charges in the pregnant woman is<br />\na. Manage breasts<br />\nb. Increased rate of smile<br />\nc. Protruding belly<br />\nd. Increased insomnia<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6883, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 52, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Bloody discharge by the mother days after delivery is called<br />\na. diadem<br />\nb. lochia<br />\nc. mucous discharge<br />\nd. blood clots<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6884, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 53, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Placenta is said to be retained when<br />\na. it can not be delivered within 24hrs after delivery<br />\nb. it can not be delivered after a caesarian operation<br />\nc. it can not be delivered within 30mins ---1hour after delivery<br />\nd. when it is delivered by controlled cord traction<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6885, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 54, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The normal process of placenta delivery is called<br />\na. controlled blood pressure<br />\nb. controlled cord traction<br />\nc. controlled blood traction<br />\nd. controlled cord compress<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
