(6887, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 56, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">A patient is said to be in active labour when <br />\na. there is lochia<br />\nb. there is regular painful contraction and cervix is 4cm dilated<br />\nc. contaction is weak and irregular<br />\nd. contraction is regular and cervix is 2cm dilated<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6888, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 57, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One  characteristics of lochia is that <br />\na. it is alkaline<br />\nb. the odour is not offensive and it should decrease daily<br />\nc. the odour is offensive and alkaline<br />\nd. it has a distinctive  odour <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6889, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 58, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Active post natal care starts with<br />\na. repair of Episiotomy<br />\nb. normal delivery<br />\nc. early initiation of breastfeeding<br />\nd. nutrition counselling <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6890, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 59, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One of the problems of exclusive breastfeeding is<br />\na. none nipples<br />\nb. flat nipples <br />\nc. whole nipples<br />\nd. normal pioted nipples<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6891, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 60, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Accurate record keeping during labour include<br />\na. Creating rapport<br />\nb. Noting the time of delivery of the baby and placenta<br />\nc. Noting the type of discharge<br />\nd. Using aseptic technique<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6892, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 61, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One of the signs of fetal distress is<br />\na. no contractions<br />\nb. cervix dystocia<br />\nc. passage of meconium in vertex presentation<br />\nd. placenta abrutio<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6893, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 62, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">To prevent infection during labour the vaginal examination should not be more than <br />\na. 10 times during labour<br />\nb. 15 times during labour<br />\nc. 12 times during labour<br />\nd. 4 times during labour<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6894, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 63, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Tubal pregnancy is called <br />\na. multiple pregnancy<br />\nb. ectopic pregnancy<br />\nc. molas pregnancy<br />\nd. cystic pregnancy<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6895, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 64, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The normal gestation period is<br />\na. 365 days or 52 weeks<br />\nb. 6 weeks or 40 days<br />\nc. 9 weeks or 90 days<br />\nd. 40 weeks or 280 days<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6896, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 65, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">?At Risk? pregnant woman include<br />\na. Short stature and previous C\\S<br />\nb. A woman with normal vital signs<br />\nc. A woman with uncomplicated normal delivery<br />\nd. A woman with good obstetric history<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6897, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 66, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Post- natal period is also known as <br />\na. puerperal sepsis<br />\nb. puerperium<br />\nc. puerperal position<br />\nd. maniac period<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6898, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 67, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">When labour becomes obstructed there is <br />\na. no progress of the descending part despite good uterine contraction<br />\nb. progressive dilation of cervix<br />\nc. decreased foetal heart beats<br />\nd. regular painful uterine contractions<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6899, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 68, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Signs of uterine rupture include<br />\na. rapid pulse, severe continous pain and vaginal bleeding<br />\nb. continous pain, removal of placenta<br />\nc. progressive dilation of cervix<br />\nd. no vaginal examination<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6900, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 69, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Causes of uterine rupture are<br />\na. Injudicious use of oxytocic drug, previous C\\S scar and during manual removal of placenta<br />\nb. Normal examination procedure<br />\nc. Careful use of oxytocic drugs<br />\nd. Use of catheter<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6901, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 70, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The purpose of anti- shock garment is to<br />\na. Reduce blood flow to the uterus and treat hypovolemic shock<br />\nb. Produce more blood<br />\nc. Follow up measure<br />\nd. Master mind healing<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
