(6921, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 90, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">In newborn eye care, the newborn should have<br />\na. eye drop of chloramphenical<br />\nb. eye drop of chlorheridine<br />\nc. eye drop of 0.5mg of erythromycin<br />\nd. eye drop of anti- pain<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6922, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 91, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Home visit should be carried out between <br />\na. 4- 5 days after delivery<br />\nb. 8 days after delivery<br />\nc. 2 ? 3 days after delivery<br />\nd. 10 days after delivery<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6923, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 92, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Abnormal pregnancies include<br />\na. a fertilized ovum<br />\nb. molar pregnancy, tubal pregnancy and cystic pregnancy or fibroids<br />\nc. fibroids, a well implanted fetus<br />\nd. first pregnancies and multipavity<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6924, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 93, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Birth preparedness involve<br />\na. the involvement of all involved in maternal care<br />\nb.  the purchase of baby items and mother craft lectures<br />\nc. Discouraging food cravings<br />\nd. Dislodging of taboos<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
