(6926, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 95, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">A bleeding cord after 8days of delivery is a sign of<br />\na. wound healing<br />\nb. infection<br />\nc. cord duress<br />\nd. top ?up<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6927, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 96, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">A patient having fits should be delivered at the<br />\na. primary health care centre<br />\nb. health clinic <br />\nc. state hospital<br />\nd. TSAS<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6928, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 97, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Progress of labour should be monitored by checking <br />\na. The mother?s behaviours<br />\nb. The mother temperature, pulse, respiration, B/P, uterine contractions and dilatation of cervix and fetal heart sound<br />\nc. FHR, membranes, contractions and PPH<br />\nd. Pulse, respiration, FHR, pain killers and breathe<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6929, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 98, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Patients with early rupture of membranes should not be allowed to move about to<br />\na. prevent hand washing<br />\nb. prevent head prolapse<br />\nc. prevent cord prolapse<br />\nd. prevent maternal prolapse<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6930, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 99, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\"> In multipara, the process of cervical dilatation is<br />\na. more difficult<br />\nb. more done<br />\nc. more rapid and easier<br />\nd. more lifting<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6931, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'MATERNAL HEALTH', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 100, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Normally the membranes should rupture after the full dilatation of cervix in<br />\na. the 2rd stage of labour<br />\nb. the 1st stage of labour<br />\nc. the 3rd stage of labour<br />\nd. the 4th stage of labour<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:17:09', '2024-07-18 15:17:09'),
(6932, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 1, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the aim of Community Eye Care? <br />\na. To sell eye products to individuals and families b. To provide affordable eye care services to everyone in the community c. To prevent eye diseases in the community d. To provide free eye surgeries to everyone in the community</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6933, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 2, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One of the following is an objective of Community Eye Care? <br />\na. To provide eye health education b. To sell eye drops to individuals and families c. To make people blind d. To give people the wrong eye prescriptions <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15');
