(6936, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 5, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the function of the cornea in the eye? <br />\na. To nourish the blood in the eye b. To allow light to enter the eye c. To send messages to the brain d. None of the above</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
