(6939, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 8, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is NOT a major layer of the eye? <br />\na. Protective layer b. Vascular layer c. Inner auditory layer d. Visual layer</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6940, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 9, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What part of the eye controls the amount of light that enters the eye? <br />\na. Pupil b. Cornea c. Retina d. Optic nerve</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6941, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 10, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the overall aim of Community Eye Care? <br />\na. To provide basic eye services to families living in mansions b. To make eye care services unaffordable to people in rural areas c. To prevent eye diseases in every community d. To provide free computer eye tests</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
