(6945, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 14, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What are the categories of eye care in Community Eye Care? <br />\na. Promotive, preventive, curative, and rehabilitation b. Curative, expensive, prevention, and diagnosis c. Promiscuous, pre-emptive, excessive and hyperactive d. None of the above</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6946, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 15, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What factors affect the success of Community Eye Care Programs? <br />\na. Accessibility and availability of PHC system and well-trained Primary Health Workers b. Absence of co-operation of the community members and inter-sectoral competition. c. Food supply in the community and immunization services. d. Increase in the cost of eye care services to poor families<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6947, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 16, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which layer of the eye is responsible for focusing light into the eye? <br />\na. The cornea <br />\nb. The sclera <br />\nc. The choroid <br />\nd. The iris <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6948, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 17, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the function of the conjunctivae? <br />\na. To focus light onto the retina <br />\nb. To control the amount of light entering the eye <br />\nc. To cover the front of the sclera <br />\nd. To line the inner part of the eyelids <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6949, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 18, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the colored part of the eye called? <br />\na. The cornea <br />\nb. The sclera <br />\nc. The conjunctivae <br />\nd. The iris <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6950, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 19, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which layer of the eye is responsible for changing the thickness of the lens? <br />\na. The pupil <br />\nb. The cornea <br />\nc. The choroid <br />\nd. The ciliary body <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6951, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 20, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the function of the vitreous humor? <br />\na. To control the pressure inside the eye <br />\nb. To fill the space between the lens and the retina <br />\nc. To give the eye ball its round shape <br />\nd. To carry the sensation of sight to the brain <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6952, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 21, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which layer of the eye contains rods and cones? <br />\na. The cornea <br />\nb. The sclera <br />\nc. The choroid <br />\nd. The retina <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6953, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 22, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the function of the six muscles of the eye? <br />\na. To control the amount of light entering the eye <br />\nb. To trap small objects from getting into the eye <br />\nc. To provide three-dimensional vision <br />\nd. To clean dust and other particles from the eye <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6954, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 23, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which muscle controls right movements of the eye? <br />\na. Superior rectus <br />\nb. Medial rectus <br />\nc. Lateral rectus <br />\nd. Inferior rectus <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6955, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 24, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which muscle controls up and downward movements of the eye? <br />\na. Superior rectus <br />\nb. Inferior rectus <br />\nc. Superior oblique <br />\nd. Inferior oblique <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6956, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 25, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How many extrinsic muscles are there in the human eye? <br />\na. 4 <br />\nb. 6 <br />\nc. 8 <br />\nd. 10 <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6957, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 26, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the function of the superior oblique muscle? <br />\na. To control left and right movements of the eye <br />\nb. To control up and outward movements of the eye <br />\nc. To control up and down and medial movements of the eye <br />\nd. None of the above <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6958, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 27, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the function of the inferior oblique muscle? <br />\na. To control left and right movements of the eye <br />\nb. To control up and down and outward movements of the eye <br />\nc. To control down and outward movements of the eye <br />\nd. None of the above <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6959, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 28, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which layer of the eye is located behind the cornea but in front of the lens? <br />\na. The sclera <br />\nb. The iris <br />\nc. The anterior chamber <br />\nd. The choroid <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6960, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 29, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the function of the punctum? <br />\na. To trap small objects from getting into the eye <br />\nb. To control the amount of light entering the eye <br />\nc. To drain tears produced by the tear gland <br />\nd. To give the eye ball its round shape <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6961, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 30, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which layer of the eye is responsible for giving strength and support to the eye ball from the front part? <br />\na. The cornea <br />\nb. The sclera <br />\nc. The iris <br />\nd. The vitreous humor<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6962, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 31, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the principal cause of preventable blindness worldwide?<br />\na. Cataracts<br />\nb. Trachoma<br />\nc. Glaucoma<br />\nd. Diabetes<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6963, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 32, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which medical condition can cause blindness due to corneal opacity?<br />\na. Refractive errors<br />\nb. Diabetes Myelitis <br />\nc. Congenital abnormalities<br />\nd. Trauma/accident<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6964, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 33, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">33. According to the World Health Organization (W.H.O), what vision level qualifies as blindness?<br />\na. 4/60 or less<br />\nb. 3/60 or less<br />\nc. 6/60 or less<br />\nd. NPL in both eyes<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6965, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 34, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is visual acuity?<br />\na. The measurement of how well one eye can see up close<br />\nb. The measurement of how well one eye can see far away<br />\nc. The measurement of how well both eyes can see up close<br />\nd. The measurement of how well both eyes can see both up close and far away<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6966, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 35, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How is trachoma transmitted?<br />\na. Through direct contact<br />\nb. Through transmission by flies <br />\nc. By mechanical transmission<br />\nd. All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6967, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 36, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which bacterial infection can cause conjunctivitis?<br />\na. Staphylococci<br />\nb. Chlamydia trachomatis<br />\nc. Streptococci<br />\nd. Escherichia coli<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6968, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 37, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the incubation period of trachoma?<br />\na. 2-5 days<br />\nb. 5-12 days<br />\nc. 12-20 days<br />\nd. 20-30 days<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6969, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 38, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the recommended intervention program to combat trachoma?<br />\na. Antibiotics and steroids <br />\nb. Good personal hygiene and adequate health services <br />\nc. Surgery and flies control only<br />\nd. SAFE strategy: Surgery, Antibiotics, Facial cleanliness, and Environmental control<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6970, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 39, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the cause of ophthalmianeonatorum?<br />\na. Vitamin A deficiency<br />\nb. Refractive errors<br />\nc. Bacterial infection<br />\nd. Glaucoma<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6971, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 40, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How can ophthalmianeonatorum be transmitted?<br />\na. Contact with fomites agents<br />\nb. Direct contact with eye, nose, and throat secretion of the infected person <br />\nc. Cross infection<br />\nd. All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6972, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 41, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the recommended treatment for conjunctivitis?<br />\na. Local antibiotic<br />\nb. Antihistamines for 1-3 days<br />\nc. Clean eyes with boiled water or 0.9% sodium chloride <br />\nd. All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6973, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 42, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary cause of onchocerciasis?<br />\na. Bacterial infection<br />\nb. Fungal infection<br />\nc. Parasitic infection<br />\nd. Viral infection<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6974, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 43, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is xerophthalmia?<br />\na. A precursor to blindness caused by vitamin A deficiency<br />\nb. Refractive errors caused by aging<br />\nc. A bacterial infection of the cornea <br />\nd. An allergic reaction to foreign substances<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6975, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 44, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is cataract?<br />\na. A condition when the cornea loses its transparency <br />\nb. A condition when the lens of the eye becomes opaque <br />\nc. A condition when the optic nerve is damaged <br />\nd. A condition when the retina detaches <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6976, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 45, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What causes cataract?<br />\na. Diabetes mellitus<br />\nb. Trauma and eye injuries <br />\nc. Congenital <br />\nd. All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6977, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 46, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How does cataract lead to blindness?<br />\na. By making the central hole in the eye look whitish or grey<br />\nb. By causing gradual loss of vision<br />\nc. By losing the transparency of the normal crystalline lens <br />\nd. All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6978, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 47, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is NOT a cause of cataract?<br />\na. Harmful traditional medication and other undue practices to the eye<br />\nb. Prolong use of drugs contains steroid <br />\nc. High blood pressure <br />\nd. Undernutrition<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6979, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 48, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is NOT a treatment for cataract?<br />\na. Intra-capsular cataract extraction (I C C E) <br />\nb. Extra-capsular cataract extraction (E C C E) <br />\nc. Antibiotics <br />\nd. Surgery <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6980, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 49, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Can blindness caused by cataract be reversed?<br />\na. Yes<br />\nb. No<br />\nc. Only partially<br />\nd. Depends on the severity of the case<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6981, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 50, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which type of diabetes is a known cause of cataract?<br />\na. Type 1<br />\nb. Type 2<br />\nc. Both type 1 and type 2<br />\nd. Neither type 1 nor type 2<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6982, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 51, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which treatment involves removing the entire lens including the capsule?<br />\na. Intra-capsular cataract extraction (I C C E) <br />\nb. Extra-capsular cataract extraction (E C C E)<br />\nc. Photorefractive keratectomy (PRK) <br />\nd. Laser in-situ keratomileusis (LASIK)<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6983, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 52, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">52. What is the difference between intra-capsular cataract extraction (I C C E) and extra-capsular cataract extraction (E C C E)?<br />\na. None, they are the same procedure<br />\nb. I C C E involves removal of the entire lens including the capsule while E C C E removes only the nucleus <br />\nc. E C C E involves removal of the entire lens while I C C E removes only the nucleus with surrounding capsule <br />\nd. Both procedures only remove the cataract from one eye <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6984, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 53, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is NOT a cause of cataract?<br />\na. Extended periods of reading or using electronic screens<br />\nb. Aged <br />\nc. Congenital <br />\nd. Undernutrition<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6985, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 54, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a corneal ulcer?<br />\na. Inflammation of the cornea <br />\nb. A type of infection on the retina <br />\nc. A fungal infection in the eye <br />\nd. An ulcer on the surface of the cornea <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6986, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 55, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the most common cause of corneal ulcer?<br />\na. Bacterial infection <br />\nb. Fungal infection<br />\nc. Acanthamoeba keratitis <br />\nd. Herpes simplex virus <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6987, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 56, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What are the symptoms of corneal ulcer?<br />\na. Blurred vision <br />\nb. Redness and swelling in the eye <br />\nc. Sensitivity to light <br />\nd. All of the above <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6988, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 57, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How is corneal ulcer diagnosed?<br />\na. CT scan<br />\nb. MRI<br />\nc. Ophthalmic examination <br />\nd. Blood test <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6989, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 58, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the treatment for corneal ulcer?<br />\na. Antibiotic eye drops or ointment <br />\nb. Antifungal eye drops or ointment<br />\nc. Corticosteroid eye drops <br />\nd. Surgery<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6990, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 59, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a refractive error?<br />\na. A type of visual impairment caused by clouding of the eye lens <br />\nb. A type of visual impairment caused by damage to the optic nerve <br />\nc. A type of visual impairment caused by abnormal curvature of the cornea or lens <br />\nd. A type of visual impairment caused by damage to the retina<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6991, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 60, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What are the three main types of refractive errors?<br />\na. Myopia, hyperopia, and astigmatism <br />\nb. Cataract, macular degeneration, and glaucoma <br />\nc. Conjunctivitis, uveitis, and keratitis <br />\nd. None of the above<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6992, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 61, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is myopia?<br />\na. A condition where the eye is too short <br />\nb. A condition where the cornea is too steep <br />\nc. A condition where the lens is too strong <br />\nd. A condition where the eye is irregularly shaped <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6993, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 62, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is hyperopia?<br />\na. A condition where the eye is too long<br />\nb. A condition where the cornea is too steep <br />\nc. A condition where the lens is too weak <br />\nd. A condition where the eye is irregularly shaped <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6994, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 63, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is astigmatism?<br />\na. A condition where the eye is too short <br />\nb. A condition where the cornea is too steep <br />\nc. A condition where the lens is too weak <br />\nd. A condition where the cornea or lens is irregularly shaped <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6995, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 64, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the most common symptom of refractive errors?<br />\na. Blurred vision <br />\nb. Double vision <br />\nc. Eye pain <br />\nd. None of the above<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6996, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 65, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a common treatment for refractive errors?<br />\na. Eyeglasses or contact lenses <br />\nb. LASIK surgery <br />\nc. PRK surgery <br />\nd. Corneal transplant <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6997, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 66, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Can refractive errors be prevented?<br />\na. Yes<br />\nb. No<br />\nc. Only in people with a family history of refractive errors <br />\nd. Only in people who regularly visit an ophthalmologist <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6998, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 67, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following lifestyle factors can contribute to the development of refractive errors?<br />\na. Excessive screen time <br />\nb. Lack of outdoor activities <br />\nc. Poor nutrition <br />\nd. All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(6999, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 68, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the most common cause of blindness related to a tropical disease?<br />\na. Malaria <br />\nb. Dengue fever <br />\nc. Onchocerciasis<br />\nd. Chikungunya<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7000, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 69, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is onchocerciasis?<br />\na. A parasitic infection transmitted by blackflies <br />\nb. A viral infection transmitted by mosquitoes <br />\nc. A bacterial infection transmitted by ticks <br />\nd. A fungal infection transmitted by soil <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7001, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 70, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What are the eye complications of onchocerciasis?<br />\na. Scratched cornea <br />\nb. Cataracts <br />\nc. Optic neuritis <br />\nd. River blindness <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7002, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 71, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the most effective treatment for onchocerciasis?<br />\na. Antibiotics <br />\nb. Antimalarial medication <br />\nc. Ivermectin<br />\nd. Surgery <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7003, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 72, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is trachoma?<br />\na. A bacterial infection transmitted by flies <br />\nb. A viral infection transmitted by mosquitoes <br />\nc. A fungal infection transmitted by soil <br />\nd. A parasitic infection transmitted by blackflies <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7004, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 73, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What are the eye complications of trachoma?<br />\na. Conjunctivitis <br />\nb. Redness and swelling in the eye <br />\nc. Corneal scarring <br />\nd. All of the above <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7005, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 74, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the most effective treatment for trachoma?<br />\na. Antibiotics <br />\nb. Antimalarial medication <br />\nc. Ivermectin<br />\nd. Surgery <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7006, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 75, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is leprosy?<br />\na. An infection caused by a bacterium that affects the skin, nerves, and mucous membranes <br />\nb. A viral infection that causes fever, rash, and joint pain <br />\nc. A fungal infection that affects the skin and nails <br />\nd. A parasitic infection transmitted by blackflies <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7007, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 76, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What are the eye complications of leprosy?<br />\na. Blindness <br />\nb. Uveitis <br />\nc. Corneal ulcer <br />\nd. All of the above <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7008, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 77, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following habits can increase the risk of eye problems?<br />\na. Rubbing your eyes frequently <br />\nb. Wearing sunglasses in bright sunlight <br />\nc. Getting enough sleep every night <br />\nd. Eating a balanced diet <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7009, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 78, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is NOT a harmful eye practice?<br />\na. Wearing dirty contact lenses <br />\nb. Not wearing eye protection when using power tools <br />\nc. Getting regular eye exams <br />\nd. Smoking <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7010, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 79, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a common cause of eye infections?<br />\na. Excessive exposure to sunlight <br />\nb. Wearing contact lenses overnight <br />\nc. Exercising regularly <br />\nd. Eating a diet high in fruits and vegetables <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7011, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 80, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What eye condition can be caused by not removing makeup before bed?<br />\na. Conjunctivitis <br />\nb. Cataracts <br />\nc. Glaucoma <br />\nd. None of the above <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7012, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 81, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What eye condition can be caused by overexposure to screens or devices?<br />\na. Dry eye syndrome <br />\nb. Retinal detachment <br />\nc. Eye floaters <br />\nd. Nystagmus<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7013, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 82, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following bad habits can cause dry eyes?<br />\na. Not drinking enough water <br />\nb. Wearing sunglasses <br />\nc. Getting too much sleep <br />\nd. None of the above <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7014, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 83, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What eye condition can be caused by not taking breaks during extended periods of reading or computer work?<br />\na. Eye strain <br />\nb. Retinal detachment <br />\nc. Glaucoma <br />\nd. None of the above <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7015, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 84, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a harmful practice that can increase the risk of eye infections?<br />\na. Not washing your hands before touching your eyes <br />\nb. Getting enough sleep every night <br />\nc. Exercising regularly <br />\nd. Eating a diet high in processed foods <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7016, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 85, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What eye condition can be caused by smoking?<br />\na. Macular degeneration <br />\nb. Retinal detachment <br />\nc. Eye floaters <br />\nd. Nystagmus<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7017, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 86, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a harmful practice that can increase the risk of eye injuries?<br />\na. Wearing eye protection when using power tools <br />\nb. Wearing contact lenses overnight <br />\nc. Not getting regular eye exams <br />\nd. Rubbing your eyes frequently<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7018, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 87, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a preventive measure to protect your eyesight?<br />\na. Taking regular breaks while using a computer <br />\nb. Drinking alcohol regularly <br />\nc. Not wearing sunglasses in bright sunlight <br />\nd. Eating a diet high in processed foods <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7019, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 88, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a healthy habit to prevent visual impairment?<br />\na. Smokingcigarettes <br />\nb. Exercising regularly <br />\nc. Rubbing your eyes frequently <br />\nd. Wearing dirty contact lenses <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7020, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 89, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What should you do to prevent eye infections?<br />\na. Drink plenty of water <br />\nb. Wash your hands regularly <br />\nc. Never wear sunglasses outside <br />\nd. Sleep with your contact lenses <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7021, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 90, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a common way to prevent dry eyes?<br />\na. Drinking alcohol <br />\nb. Rubbing your eyes frequently <br />\nc. Adding more salt to your diet <br />\nd. Using artificial tears <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7022, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 91, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a healthy habit to prevent age-related macular degeneration?<br />\na. Eating a diet high in processed foods <br />\nb. Smoking cigarettes <br />\nc. Wearing sunglasses in bright sunlight <br />\nd. Getting regular eye exams <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7023, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 92, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following can help prevent glaucoma?<br />\na. Wearing contacts overnight <br />\nb. Eating a diet high in fruits and vegetables <br />\nc. Excessive exposure to blue light <br />\nd. None of the above<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7024, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 93, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a preventive measure to protect your eyesight against UV radiation?<br />\na. Wearing sunglasses in bright sunlight <br />\nb. Not wearing sunglasses outside <br />\nc. Drinking alcohol frequently <br />\nd. Eating a diet high in processed foods <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7025, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 94, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What can you do to prevent eye strain?<br />\na. Exercising regularly <br />\nb. Taking frequent breaks during extended periods of computer work      <br />\nc. Sleeping with your contact lenses <br />\nd. None of the above <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7026, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 95, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What can you do to prevent cataracts?<br />\na. Getting regular eye exams <br />\nb. Wearing contact lenses overnight <br />\nc. Smoking cigarettes <br />\nd. None of the above <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7027, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 96, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a preventive measure to protect children\'s eye health?<br />\na. Encouraging outdoor play <br />\nb. Allowing excessive screen time <br />\nc. Providing sugary snacks regularly <br />\nd. None of the above <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7028, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 97, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a healthy habit to prevent diabetic retinopathy?<br />\na. Eating a diet high in processed foods <br />\nb. Smoking cigarettes <br />\nc. Maintaining healthy glucose levels <br />\nd. Rubbing your eyes frequently <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7029, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 98, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a preventive measure to protect your eyesight during sports activities?<br />\na. Wearing protective eyewear <br />\nb. Not wearing protective eyewear <br />\nc. Drinking plenty of water <br />\nd. Eating a diet high in protein<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7030, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 99, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which instrument in an eye clinic is used to measure the visual acuity of a patient?<br />\na. Slit lamp <br />\nb. Fundus camera <br />\nc. Snellen chart <br />\nd. Perimetry<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7031, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 100, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What instrument in an eye clinic is used to examine the retina and optic nerve?<br />\na. Slit lamp <br />\nb. Fundus camera <br />\nc. Tonometry <br />\nd. Keratometer<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:15', '2024-07-18 15:18:15'),
(7032, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 1, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the aim of Community Eye Care? <br />\na. To sell eye products to individuals and families b. To provide affordable eye care services to everyone in the community c. To prevent eye diseases in the community d. To provide free eye surgeries to everyone in the community</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
(7033, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 2, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One of the following is an objective of Community Eye Care? <br />\na. To provide eye health education b. To sell eye drops to individuals and families c. To make people blind d. To give people the wrong eye prescriptions <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
(7034, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 3, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is not one of the essential components of Community Eye Care? <br />\na. Promotive b. Preventive c. Curative d. Expensive </p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
(7035, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 4, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is a section of the eye? <br />\na. Vitality b. Mortality c. Formality d. Visual layer</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57');
