(7045, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 14, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What are the categories of eye care in Community Eye Care? <br />\na. Promotive, preventive, curative, and rehabilitation b. Curative, expensive, prevention, and diagnosis c. Promiscuous, pre-emptive, excessive and hyperactive d. None of the above</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
(7046, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 15, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What factors affect the success of Community Eye Care Programs? <br />\na. Accessibility and availability of PHC system and well-trained Primary Health Workers b. Absence of co-operation of the community members and inter-sectoral competition. c. Food supply in the community and immunization services. d. Increase in the cost of eye care services to poor families<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
(7047, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 16, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which layer of the eye is responsible for focusing light into the eye? <br />\na. The cornea <br />\nb. The sclera <br />\nc. The choroid <br />\nd. The iris <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
