(7049, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 18, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the colored part of the eye called? <br />\na. The cornea <br />\nb. The sclera <br />\nc. The conjunctivae <br />\nd. The iris <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
(7050, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 19, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which layer of the eye is responsible for changing the thickness of the lens? <br />\na. The pupil <br />\nb. The cornea <br />\nc. The choroid <br />\nd. The ciliary body <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
