(7052, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 21, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which layer of the eye contains rods and cones? <br />\na. The cornea <br />\nb. The sclera <br />\nc. The choroid <br />\nd. The retina <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
(7053, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 22, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the function of the six muscles of the eye? <br />\na. To control the amount of light entering the eye <br />\nb. To trap small objects from getting into the eye <br />\nc. To provide three-dimensional vision <br />\nd. To clean dust and other particles from the eye <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
(7054, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 23, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which muscle controls right movements of the eye? <br />\na. Superior rectus <br />\nb. Medial rectus <br />\nc. Lateral rectus <br />\nd. Inferior rectus <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
