(7056, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 25, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How many extrinsic muscles are there in the human eye? <br />\na. 4 <br />\nb. 6 <br />\nc. 8 <br />\nd. 10 <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
(7057, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 26, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the function of the superior oblique muscle? <br />\na. To control left and right movements of the eye <br />\nb. To control up and outward movements of the eye <br />\nc. To control up and down and medial movements of the eye <br />\nd. None of the above <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
(7058, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 27, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the function of the inferior oblique muscle? <br />\na. To control left and right movements of the eye <br />\nb. To control up and down and outward movements of the eye <br />\nc. To control down and outward movements of the eye <br />\nd. None of the above <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
