(7061, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 30, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which layer of the eye is responsible for giving strength and support to the eye ball from the front part? <br />\na. The cornea <br />\nb. The sclera <br />\nc. The iris <br />\nd. The vitreous humor<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
(7062, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 31, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the principal cause of preventable blindness worldwide?<br />\na. Cataracts<br />\nb. Trachoma<br />\nc. Glaucoma<br />\nd. Diabetes<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
