(7064, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 33, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">33. According to the World Health Organization (W.H.O), what vision level qualifies as blindness?<br />\na. 4/60 or less<br />\nb. 3/60 or less<br />\nc. 6/60 or less<br />\nd. NPL in both eyes<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
(7065, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 34, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is visual acuity?<br />\na. The measurement of how well one eye can see up close<br />\nb. The measurement of how well one eye can see far away<br />\nc. The measurement of how well both eyes can see up close<br />\nd. The measurement of how well both eyes can see both up close and far away<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
(7066, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 35, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How is trachoma transmitted?<br />\na. Through direct contact<br />\nb. Through transmission by flies <br />\nc. By mechanical transmission<br />\nd. All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
(7067, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 36, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which bacterial infection can cause conjunctivitis?<br />\na. Staphylococci<br />\nb. Chlamydia trachomatis<br />\nc. Streptococci<br />\nd. Escherichia coli<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
(7068, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'PRIMARY EYE CARE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 37, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the incubation period of trachoma?<br />\na. 2-5 days<br />\nb. 5-12 days<br />\nc. 12-20 days<br />\nd. 20-30 days<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-18 15:18:57', '2024-07-18 15:18:57'),
