(7327, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'Research', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 50, 50, 'text', 47, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The Standard Deviation (SD) is an_____________________                                                         A. estimate of how much all the individual values deviate from the group mean                        B. estimate of how much all the individual values deviate from the group mode                          C. estimate of how much all the individual data-sets deviate from the group mean                     D.estimate of how much all the individual data-sets deviate from the group mode</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-19 14:48:21', '2024-07-19 14:48:21'),
