(7514, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'SUPERVISED CLINICAL EXPERIENCE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 84, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the purpose of the BMI (Body Mass Index) measurement during a community health assessment?<br />\n - A) To assess nutritional status<br />\n   - B) To measure muscular strength<br />\n   - C) To evaluate lung function<br />\n   - D) To assess bone density<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-19 16:55:48', '2024-07-19 16:55:48'),
