(7517, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'SUPERVISED CLINICAL EXPERIENCE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 87, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">During a cardiovascular assessment, where is the point of maximal impulse (PMI) typically palpated?<br />\n   - A) Over the left upper quadrant<br />\n   - B) Over the right lower quadrant<br />\n   - C) Over the right upper quadrant<br />\n   - D) Over the left lower quadrant<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-19 16:55:48', '2024-07-19 16:55:48'),
(7518, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'SUPERVISED CLINICAL EXPERIENCE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 88, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is an appropriate way to ensure patient safety during a physical examination in a community setting?<br />\n    - A) Using unsterile equipment<br />\n    - B) Ignoring patient preferences<br />\n    - C) Providing privacy and modesty<br />\n    - D) Rushing through the examination<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-19 16:55:48', '2024-07-19 16:55:48'),
(7519, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'SUPERVISED CLINICAL EXPERIENCE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 89, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which technique is used to assess the symmetry of chest expansion during respiratory examination?<br />\n   - A) Percussion<br />\n   - B) Palpation<br />\n   - C) Auscultation<br />\n- D) Inspection<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-19 16:55:48', '2024-07-19 16:55:48'),
(7520, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'SUPERVISED CLINICAL EXPERIENCE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 90, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the purpose of assessing cranial nerve function during a community health physical examination?<br />\n   - A) To measure muscle strength<br />\n   - B) To evaluate sensory perception<br />\n- C) To assess neurological function<br />\n   - D) To examine joint mobility<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-19 16:55:48', '2024-07-19 16:55:48'),
(7521, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'SUPERVISED CLINICAL EXPERIENCE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 91, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">During a musculoskeletal assessment, what does the ?range of motion? refer to?<br />\n   - A) Strength of muscle contraction<br />\n- B) Ability to flex and extend joints<br />\n   - C) Sensory perception in joints<br />\n   - D) Stability of ligaments<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-19 16:55:48', '2024-07-19 16:55:48'),
(7522, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'SUPERVISED CLINICAL EXPERIENCE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 92, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which assessment technique involves tapping the body surface with fingers to assess underlying structures?<br />\n- A) Percussion<br />\n   - B) Palpation<br />\n   - C) Auscultation<br />\n   - D) Inspection<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-19 16:55:48', '2024-07-19 16:55:48'),
(7523, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'SUPERVISED CLINICAL EXPERIENCE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 93, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">During an abdominal examination, which sound indicates the presence of fluid or gas in the intestines?<br />\n   - A) Dullness<br />\n   - B) Hyperresonance<br />\n- C) Tympany<br />\n   - D) Flatness<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-19 16:55:48', '2024-07-19 16:55:48'),
(7524, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'SUPERVISED CLINICAL EXPERIENCE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 94, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is an important initial step to establish rapport with a patient?<br />\n   - A) Maintain a professional distance<br />\n   - B) Avoid making eye contact<br />\n  - C) Introduce yourself and greet the patient warmly<br />\n   - D) Keep conversations strictly related to medical history<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-19 16:55:48', '2024-07-19 16:55:48'),
(7525, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'SUPERVISED CLINICAL EXPERIENCE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 95, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Effective communication with patients involves:<br />\n   - A) Using medical jargon to convey expertise<br />\n   - B) Speaking quickly to save time<br />\n- C) Listening actively and empathetically<br />\n   - D) Interrupting the patient to steer the conversation<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-19 16:55:48', '2024-07-19 16:55:48'),
(7526, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'SUPERVISED CLINICAL EXPERIENCE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 96, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which non-verbal communication technique helps in building rapport with patients?<br />\n   - A) Crossing arms while talking<br />\n- B) Maintaining eye contact<br />\n   - C) Looking at the computer screen<br />\n   - D) Checking the watch frequently<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-19 16:55:48', '2024-07-19 16:55:48'),
(7527, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'SUPERVISED CLINICAL EXPERIENCE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 97, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">When discussing treatment options with a patient, it?s important to:<br />\n   - A) Only provide one option to avoid confusion<br />\n   - B) Rush through the explanation to save time<br />\n   - C) Use plain language and check for understanding<br />\n   - D) Assume the patient already knows everything<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-19 16:55:48', '2024-07-19 16:55:48'),
(7528, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'SUPERVISED CLINICAL EXPERIENCE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 98, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Showing empathy towards a patient involves:<br />\n   - A) Minimizing the patient?s concerns<br />\n- B) Acknowledging and validating their feelings<br />\n   - C) Providing unsolicited advice<br />\n   - D) Focusing solely on medical facts<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-19 16:55:48', '2024-07-19 16:55:48'),
(7529, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'SUPERVISED CLINICAL EXPERIENCE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 99, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following behaviors helps in establishing trust with patients?<br />\n   - A) Being defensive when patients ask questions<br />\n   - B) Sharing personal opinions about treatment options<br />\n   - C) Respecting patient autonomy and choices<br />\n   - D) Rushing through appointments to save time<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-19 16:55:48', '2024-07-19 16:55:48'),
(7530, '2024/2025', 'Diploma in Community Health(CHEW)(DE)', '200', 'Second', 'SUPERVISED CLINICAL EXPERIENCE', 'SEMESTER-EXAM', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 100, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How can body language contribute to building rapport with patients?<br />\n   - A) Crossing arms and legs to appear confident<br />\n   - B) Avoiding eye contact to show<br />\nC. Using open and welcome gestures<br />\nD. Standing at a distance to maintain personal space <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '2024-07-19 16:55:48', '2024-07-19 16:55:48'),
(7531, '2024/2025', 'ND in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 1, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Abidjan is 4 degree west of Accra and on the same circle of latitude. If the radius of this circle of latitude is 6370km, how far is Abidjan west of Accra, correct to the nearest kilometer? [Take &pi; = 22/7]<br />\r\nA. 222km &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. 445km &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. 890km &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">D. 5005km</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(7532, '2024/2025', 'ND in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 2, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">If Q = (all perfect squares less than 30) and P = (all odd numbers from 1 to 10). Find Q &cap; P.<br />\r\nA. (1, 4, 9, 16, 25) &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. (1, 3, 4, 5, 7, 9, 16, 25)</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. (1, 3, 5, 7, 9) &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">D. (1, 9)</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
