(7540, '2024/2025', 'ND in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 10, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">A ladder 9m long leans against a vertical wall, making an angle of 64? with the horizontal ground. calculate correct to one decimal place, how far the foot of the ladder is from the wall.<br />\r\nA. 4.0m</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. 5.8m</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. 7.1m</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">D. 8.1m</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(7541, '2024/2025', 'ND in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 11, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The number 186,470 was corrected to 186,000. Which of the following describe the degree of approximation made?<br />\r\nI. to the nearest hundred</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">II. to the nearest thousand</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">III. to 3 significant figures</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">IV. to 4 significant figures</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\"><br />\r\nA. I &amp; III only</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. I &amp; IV only</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. II &amp; III only<br />\r\n<br />\r\nD. II &amp; IV only</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(7542, '2024/2025', 'ND in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 12, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Points P and Q respectively 24m north and 7m east point R. Calculate |PQ| in meters<br />\r\nA. 20</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. 24</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. 25</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">D. 31</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
