(7544, '2024/2025', 'ND in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 14, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Instead of recording the number 1.23cm of the radius of a tube, a student recorded 1.32cm. Find the percentage of error, correct to one decimal place.<br />\r\nA. 6.8%</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. 7.3%</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. 9.6%</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">D. 14.4%</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
