(7546, '2024/2025', 'ND in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 16, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">For a class of 30 students, the scores in a Mathematics test out of 10 marks were as follows;<br />\r\n4,5,7,2,3,6,5,5,8,9,5,4,2,3,7,9,8,7,7,7,3,4,5,5,2,3,6,7,7,2.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the median score?<br />\r\nA. 2</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. 7</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. 8</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">D. 9</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(7547, '2024/2025', 'ND in Environmental Health Technology', 'NDI', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 17, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">For a class of 30 students, the scores in a Mathematics test out of 10 marks were as follows;<br />\r\n4,5,7,2,3,6,5,5,8,9,5,4,2,3,7,9,8,7,7,7,3,4,5,5,2,3,6,7,7,2.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the range of the distribution?<br />\r\nA. 2</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. 7</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. 9</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">D. 10</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
