(7727, '2024/2025', 'ND Nutrition and Dietetics', 'NDI', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 97, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to E below each of the following sentences, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the underlined expression as it is used in the sentence.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The girl has just come out of the fattening room and her waist is <strong><ins>adorned</ins></strong> with beads.<br />\r\nA. surrounded &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. decorated &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. besieged<br />\r\n<br />\r\nD. defaced</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(7728, '2024/2025', 'ND Nutrition and Dietetics', 'NDI', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 98, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to E below each of the following sentences, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the underlined expression as it is used in the sentence.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Ade is very winsome yet his neighbour finds it difficult to <strong><ins>put up</ins></strong> with him.<br />\r\nA. live with &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. tolerate &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. depend on &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">D. rely on</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(7729, '2024/2025', 'ND Nutrition and Dietetics', 'NDI', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 99, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to E below each of the following sentences, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the underlined expression as it is used in the sentence.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">There are some drugs that could <strong><ins>exacerbate</ins></strong> a particular illness<br />\r\nA. heal &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. ameliorate &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. lengthen &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">D. worsen</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(7730, '2024/2025', 'ND Nutrition and Dietetics', 'NDI', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 100, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">From the words lettered A to E below each of the following sentences, choose the word or group of words that is nearest in meaning to the underlined expression as it is used in the sentence.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">In accordance with the practice of his religion, Raman&#39;s body was <strong><ins>interred</ins></strong> the day he died<br />\r\nA. sanctified &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. preserved &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. cremated<br />\r\n<br />\r\nD. buried</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(7731, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDI', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 1, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Abidjan is 4 degree west of Accra and on the same circle of latitude. If the radius of this circle of latitude is 6370km, how far is Abidjan west of Accra, correct to the nearest kilometer? [Take &pi; = 22/7]<br />\r\nA. 222km &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. 445km &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. 890km &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">D. 5005km</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(7732, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDI', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 2, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">If Q = (all perfect squares less than 30) and P = (all odd numbers from 1 to 10). Find Q &cap; P.<br />\r\nA. (1, 4, 9, 16, 25) &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. (1, 3, 4, 5, 7, 9, 16, 25)</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. (1, 3, 5, 7, 9) &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">D. (1, 9)</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
