(7903, '2024/2025', 'ND Dental Therapy', 'NDI', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 73, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which structure in the maize grain stores food?<br />\r\nA. Endosperm.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. Embryo</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. Cytoplasm</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">D. Seed coat</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(7904, '2024/2025', 'ND Dental Therapy', 'NDI', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 74, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Even though some flowering plants contain accessory pigments which give them colours they still contain<br />\r\nthe pigment<br />\r\nA. melanin</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. chlorophyll</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. xanthrophyll<br />\r\n<br />\r\nD. carotene</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(7905, '2024/2025', 'ND Dental Therapy', 'NDI', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 75, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The relationship between a herbivore and the bacteria which live in its caecum is known as<br />\r\nA. parasitism</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">B. symbiosis</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">C. predation<br />\r\n<br />\r\nD. saprophytism</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
(7906, '2024/2025', 'ND Dental Therapy', 'NDI', 'First', 'ENTRANCE', 'ENTRANCE', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 76, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Autotropic nutrition may be defined in terms of food obtained<br />\r\nA. from other organisms in exchange for some products.<br />\r\nB. by the breakdown of complex substances<br />\r\nC. by an organism utilizing its own store of energy<br />\r\nD. by synthesizing simple substances using energy from an external source</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', NULL, NULL),
