(8036, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'BIOSTATISTICS', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 6, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">When a distribution is arranged in order of magnitude of the items, measures that depends upon their position in the distribution are called the following except<br />\nA. Quartiles<br />\nB.  Deciles<br />\nC.  Percentiles<br />\nD. Coefficient of variation</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
