(8043, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'BIOSTATISTICS', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 13, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What does a low Bed Turnover Rate (BTR) indicate?<br />\nA) Longer average length of stay<br />\nB) Higher bed occupancy rate<br />\nC) More admissions per bed<br />\nD) Higher turnover interval</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8044, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'BIOSTATISTICS', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 14, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a cohort study?<br />\nA) A study that compares individuals with a specific condition to those without the condition<br />\nB) A study that collects data from a population at a single point in time<br />\nC)  A  study that  follows  a  group  of  people  with  a  common characteristic over time<br />\nD)  An  experimental  study  where  participants  are  randomly assigned to groups</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8045, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'BIOSTATISTICS', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 15, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The following are methods of data collection except<br />\nA. Library.             B. Observational<br />\nC. Experimental.  D. Histogram</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
