(8224, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'COMPUTER', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 94, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">An Os that allows many users to enter their data into the system at a time with one central computer is known as (a) Multi users (b) Single User (c) Multi processing (d) Many user</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8225, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'COMPUTER', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 95, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">_____________ is used to translate programs written in low level language to machine language. (a) Interpreter (b) Translator (c) Complier (d) Assembler</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8226, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'COMPUTER', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 96, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The technology adopted in the 2nd generation of computer is known as ________________ (a) IC (b) Transistor (c) Vacuum Tube (d) Values</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8227, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'COMPUTER', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 97, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">_____________ is referred to as the combination of hardware, software and people ware. (a) OS (b) Computer System (c) Data Processing (d) Networking</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8228, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'COMPUTER', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 98, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The Act of recovering or bringing back several documents saved before is known as ______________ (a) Creating (b) Saving (c) Editing (d) Retrieving </p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8229, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'COMPUTER', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 99, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">SMS is a short form for _________________ (a) Short message service (b) Small message service (c) Short mail system (d) Short mail service </p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8230, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'COMPUTER', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 100, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">In BASIC, ___________ statement makes computer to display information or output on the screen (a) GOTE (b) INPUT (c) PRINT (d) READ </p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8231, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 1, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Organizing is the process of arranging and allocating __________ among an organization?s members.<br />\n    (a) Time and Effort<br />\n    (b) Resources and Authority<br />\n    (c) Money and Power<br />\n    (d) People and Goals<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8232, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 2, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">According to Louis A. Allen, organization involves defining and grouping the works to be performed and delegating __________ and __________.<br />\n   (a) Time, Effort<br />\n   (b) Responsibility, Authority<br />\n   (c) Money, Resources<br />\n   (d) Goals, Objectives<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8233, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 3, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the first step in the process of organizing health services?<br />\n   (a) Delegation of Authority<br />\n   (b) Assignment of Duties<br />\n   (c) Identification of Activities<br />\n   (d) Grouping of Activities<br />\n<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8234, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 4, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">An organization is a group of people working together for the achievement of __________.<br />\n   (a) Personal Objectives<br />\n   (b) Financial Goals<br />\n   (c) Common Objectives<br />\n   (d) Social Status<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8235, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 5, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\"> Which of the following is NOT a characteristic of organization?<br />\n   (a) Specialization and Division of Work<br />\n    (b) Cooperative Efforts<br />\n    (c) Random Assignment of Tasks<br />\n   (d) Central Authority<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8236, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 6, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The __________ function involves setting of performance and deciding on how to accomplish it.<br />\n   (a) Planning<br />\n   (b) Organizing<br />\n   (c) Leading<br />\n   (d) Controlling<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8237, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 7, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What facilitates effective administration by clearly defining the extent of authority and responsibility?<br />\n   (a) Division of Work<br />\n   (b) Organizing<br />\n   (c) Planning<br />\n   (d) Staffing<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8238, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 8, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Staffing is also known as __________ management.<br />\n   (a) Financial<br />\n   (b) Resource<br />\n   (c) Human Resource<br />\n   (d) Project<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8239, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 9, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The __________ element in an organization refers to the need to adapt to changes in culture, ideas, and attitudes.<br />\n   (a) Dynamic<br />\n   (b) Static<br />\n   (c) Regulatory<br />\n   (d) Procedural<br />\n<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8240, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 10, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What type of organizational structure places the top official at the head of the chart?<br />\n    (a) Matrix<br />\n    (b) Hierarchical<br />\n    (c) Flat<br />\n    (d) Circular<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8241, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 11, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The primary purpose of an organization chart is to show the __________ structure of the organization.<br />\n    (a) Financial<br />\n    (b) Cultural<br />\n    (c) Hierarchical<br />\n    (d) Social<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8242, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 12, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">In staffing, __________ is the process of inducing people to apply for jobs in the organization.<br />\n    (a) Selection<br />\n    (b) Recruitment<br />\n    (c) Training<br />\n    (d) Placement<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8243, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 13, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which function involves acquiring, developing, employing, and compensating employees?<br />\n    (a) Planning<br />\n    (b) Organizing<br />\n    (c) Staffing<br />\n    (d) Controlling<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8244, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 14, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which type of organizational chart shows the internal structures and relationships between jobs?<br />\n    (a) Matrix<br />\n    (b) Flat<br />\n    (c) Hierarchical<br />\n    (d) Circular<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00');
INSERT INTO `questions` (`id`, `session1`, `department`, `level`, `semester`, `course`, `exam_type`, `exam_mode`, `exam_category`, `no_of_qst`, `upload_no_of_qst`, `question_type`, `question_no`, `question`, `answer`, `graphic`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(8245, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 15, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The steps involved in the staffing process begin with __________ manpower requirement.<br />\n    (a) Estimating<br />\n    (b) Recruiting<br />\n    (c) Training<br />\n    (d) Appraising<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8246, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 16, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the importance of organizing in encouraging __________ and __________ within an organization?<br />\n    (a) Growth, Diversification<br />\n    (b) Efficiency, Stability<br />\n    (c) Flexibility, Rigidity<br />\n    (d) Consistency, Uniformity<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8247, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 17, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Effective administration is achieved through the __________ and __________ of authority.<br />\n    (a) Delegation, Control<br />\n    (b) Coordination, Network<br />\n    (c) Planning, Leading<br />\n    (d) Staffing, Monitoring<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8248, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 18, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Specialization and division of work result in __________ and __________.<br />\n    (a) Efficiency, Effectiveness<br />\n    (b) Redundancy, Duplication<br />\n    (c) Confusion, Mismanagement<br />\n    (d) Conflict, Delay<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8249, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 19, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\"> __________ is the function that ensures the organization has the right number and kind of people at the right places at the right time.<br />\n    (a) Planning<br />\n    (b) Staffing<br />\n    (c) Organizing<br />\n    (d) Controlling<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8250, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 20, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Communication within an organization facilitates __________ and __________.<br />\n     (a) Conflict, Confusion<br />\n    (b) Integration, Coordination<br />\n    (c) Miscommunication, Errors<br />\n    (d) Inefficiency, Delay</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8251, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 21, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The chain of command in an organization is established through __________.<br />\n    (a) Planning<br />\n    (b) Delegation of Authority<br />\n    (c) Scalar chain<br />\n    (d) Controlling<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8252, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 22, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which type of organizational chart is known for its flexibility and team-based approach?<br />\n    (a) Hierarchical<br />\n    (b) Matrix<br />\n    (c) Flat<br />\n    (d) Circular</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8253, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 23, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The process of assigning responsibility and ensuring certainty of work performance is known as __________.<br />\n    (a) Planning<br />\n    (b) Staffing<br />\n    (c) Assignment of Duties<br />\n    (d) Controlling<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8254, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 24, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">In staffing, internal sources of recruitment include __________ and __________.<br />\n    (a) Training, Appraisal<br />\n    (b) Promotion, Transfer<br />\n    (c) Selection, Placement<br />\n    (d) Recruitment, Induction<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8255, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 25, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">__________ is concerned with ensuring the right staff can carry an organization through a period of change.<br />\n    (a) Planning<br />\n    (b) Staffing<br />\n    (c) Organizing<br />\n    (d) Controlling<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8256, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 26, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\"> ___________can be defined as any state of disturbance or malfunctioning in the total human body<br />\n(a) Sign<br />\n (b) Symptom <br />\n(c) Disease<br />\n (d) Epidemiology<br />\n<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8257, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 27, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">_________ is the studies of disease distribution and pattern in a population<br />\n(a) Epidemiology <br />\n(b) Epidaemiology <br />\n(c) Epideamiological<br />\n(d) Epiology<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8258, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 28, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Having clear line of communication is a part of _____________ <br />\n(a) Function of health team <br />\n(b) Advantage of health team  <br />\n(c) Characteristics of health team <br />\n(d) Composition of health team </p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8259, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 29, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Qualities of a good health team leader includes all but one _________  <br />\n(a) Must be honest <br />\n(b) Must be empathic <br />\n(c) Must be approachable<br />\n (d) Must be sympathetic<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8260, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 30, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Goal of primary health care system include all but one <br />\n(a) Essential health services <br />\n(b) Increase stake holders <br />\n(c) Universal coverage <br />\n(d) Service delivery reforms<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8261, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 31, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Primary health care has _________ major component.<br />\n (a) 7<br />\n (b) 12 <br />\n(c) 9 <br />\n(d) 8<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8262, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 32, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">All but one is correct ___________<br />\n (a) Health education <br />\n(b) Provision of essential drug <br />\n(c) Mental health <br />\n(d) Immunization against major infection disease<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8263, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 33, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Requirements to facilitate integrated health services delivery includes all but one <br />\n(a) Advocacy <br />\n(b) Mobilization <br />\n(c) Provision of funds <br />\n(d) A cohesive health team<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8264, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 34, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">All except one are the primary health care approach of Nigeria\'s health system<br />\n (a) Cost recovery <br />\n(B) Emphasis on prevention <br />\n(c)  Down up approach  <br />\n(d) Logistics<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8265, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 35, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the most important thing a manager does according to the document?<br />\n(a) Execution<br />\n (b) Planning<br />\n (c) Coordination<br />\n(d) Monitoring</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8266, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 36, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Planning should be geared towards achieving what?<br />\n   (a) Short-term goals<br />\n    (b) Corporate goals and objectives<br />\n   (c) Employee satisfaction<br />\n   (d) Daily tasks<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8267, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 37, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What happens without planning according to health planning and management?<br />\n   (a) Events of the future are left to chance<br />\n   (b) Goals are automatically achieved<br />\n   (c) Employee morale increases<br />\n   (d) Productivity improves<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8268, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 38, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Who defined planning as \"predetermining a course of action\"?<br />\n   (a) Cummins<br />\n   (b) Goetz<br />\n   (c) American Management Association<br />\n   (d) New Standard Encyclopedia<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8269, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 39, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which theory did Frederick Taylor start?<br />\n   (a) Administrative Theory<br />\n   (b) Scientific Management<br />\n   (c) Bureaucratic Theory<br />\n   (d) Human Relations Theory<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8270, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 40, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the \'science of work\' according to Taylor?<br />\n   (a) A method to improve employee relations<br />\n   (b) A replacement for rule-of-thumb methods<br />\n   (c) A system for employee benefits<br />\n   (d) A strategy for marketing<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8271, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 41, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary principle of all human life according to Freud?<br />\n   (a) Reality principle<br />\n   (b) Pleasure principle<br />\n   (c) Moral principle<br />\n   (d) Efficiency principle<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8272, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 42, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The id operates on which principle?<br />\n   (a) Reality principle<br />\n   (b) Pleasure principle<br />\n   (c) Moral principle<br />\n   (d) Efficiency principle<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8273, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 43, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The ego is described as what?<br />\n   (a) The moral arm of the personality<br />\n   (b) The internalized representation of society\'s values<br />\n   (c) The executive of the personality<br />\n   (d) The unconscious part of the personality<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8274, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 44, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Who proposed type theories based on physique?<br />\n    (a) Freud<br />\n    (b) Sheldon<br />\n    (c) Rogers<br />\n    (d) Skinner<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8275, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 45, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What did Gilbreth\'s motion study focus on?<br />\n    (a) Improving worker relationships<br />\n    (b) Reducing unnecessary motions<br />\n    (c) Enhancing product quality<br />\n    (d) Increasing management efficiency<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8276, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 46, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Max Weber is associated with which theory?<br />\n    (a) Administrative Theory<br />\n    (b) Bureaucratic Theory<br />\n    (c) Human Relations Theory<br />\n    (d) Scientific Management<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8277, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 47, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Henri Fayol\'s administrative theory focuses on what?<br />\n    (a) Worker satisfaction<br />\n    (b) Management roles<br />\n    (c) Product quality<br />\n    (d) Customer relations<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8278, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 48, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the first step in the training process?<br />\n    (a) Conducting the training<br />\n    (b) Developing a training plan<br />\n    (c) Training needs assessment<br />\n    (d) Evaluating the training<br />\n<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8279, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 49, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which principle did Taylor propose for work division?<br />\n    (a) Responsibility should be divided equally between workers and management<br />\n    (b) Work should be done individually<br />\n    (c) Management should handle all tasks<br />\n    (d) Workers should be self-managed<br />\n<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8280, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 50, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What does the evaluation of the training program determine?<br />\n    (a) The number of trainees<br />\n    (b) The effectiveness and profitability of the training<br />\n    (c) The location of the training<br />\n    (d) The trainers\' qualifications<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8281, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 51, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which theory emphasizes learning through reinforcement and observing others?<br />\n    (a) Type Theory<br />\n    (b) Humanistic Theory<br />\n    (c) Social Learning Theory<br />\n    (d) Behavioral Theory<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8282, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 52, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The \'super ego\' represents what?<br />\n    (a) Innate instincts and desires<br />\n    (b) The executive function of personality<br />\n    (c) Internalized moral standards<br />\n    (d) Observable behaviors<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8283, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 53, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">According to Sheldon, a short plump person is described as what?<br />\n    (a) Restrained and self-conscious<br />\n    (b) Sociable and relaxed<br />\n    (c) Noisy and callous<br />\n    (d) Quiet and solitary<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8284, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 54, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which concept did Frederick Taylor not propose?<br />\n    (a) Rule-of-thumb methods<br />\n    (b) Scientific selection of workers<br />\n    (c) Work and responsibility division<br />\n    (d) Systematic training of workers<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8285, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 55, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What did Fayol believe about the principle roles of management?<br />\n    (a) They are irrelevant<br />\n    (b) They include planning, organizing, commanding, coordinating, and controlling<br />\n    (c) They should focus on employee happiness<br />\n    (d) They include marketing and sales strategies<br />\n<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8286, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 56, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Freud\'s id seeks immediate gratification of what?<br />\n    (a) Social norms<br />\n    (b) Reality-based needs<br />\n    (c) Innate instincts and desires<br />\n    (d) Internalized moral standards<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8287, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 57, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\"> What was a key outcome of Gilbreth\'s motion study?<br />\n    (a) Reduced the motions in bricklaying from 18 to 4<br />\n    (b) Improved employee wages<br />\n    (c) Increased the number of workers needed<br />\n    (d) Enhanced customer satisfaction<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8288, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 58, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The \'ego\' mediates between which two elements according to Freud?<br />\n    (a) Id and society<br />\n    (b) Id and super ego<br />\n    (c) Ego and environment<br />\n    (d) Super ego and environment<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8289, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 59, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a main focus of behavioral theories of personality?<br />\n    (a) Innate instincts<br />\n    (b) Internal thoughts<br />\n    (c) Observable and measurable behaviors<br />\n    (d) Moral standards<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8290, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 60, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">According to Weber, an ideal bureaucracy should have what?<br />\n    (a) A loose hierarchical structure<br />\n    (b) Personal interactions among members<br />\n    (c) Stable, knowable rules<br />\n    (d) Minimal written records<br />\n<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8291, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 61, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Fayol\'s principle of \'unity of command\' states what?<br />\n    (a) Each worker should receive orders from multiple managers<br />\n    (b) Each worker should receive orders from only one manager<br />\n    (c) Each worker should command multiple tasks<br />\n    (d) Each manager should oversee multiple workers<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8292, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 62, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Taylor\'s approach to management emphasized what?<br />\n    (a) Personal discretion in tasks<br />\n    (b) Systematic training and scientific methods<br />\n    (c) Emotional management styles<br />\n    (d) Flexible work schedules<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8293, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 63, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Who is associated with the theory of bureaucratic management?<br />\n    (a) Taylor<br />\n    (b) Gilbreth<br />\n    (c) Weber<br />\n    (d) Fayol<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8294, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 64, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Fayol\'s principle of \'order\' refers to what?<br />\n    (a) Discipline among workers<br />\n    (b) Proper organization of resources<br />\n    (c) Unity of direction<br />\n    (d) Scalar chain of authority<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8295, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 65, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">According to social learning theory, what influences an individual\'s actions?<br />\n    (a) Genetic predisposition<br />\n    (b) Observable actions of others<br />\n    (c) Innate desires<br />\n    (d) Internal moral standards<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8296, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 66, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Who believed that behavior depends on how one perceives the world?<br />\n    (a) Freud<br />\n    (b) Sheldon<br />\n    (c) Rogers<br />\n    (d) Skinner<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8297, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 67, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The final step in the training process is what?<br />\n    (a) Conducting the training<br />\n    (b) Designing training materials<br />\n    (c) Developing a training plan<br />\n    (d) Evaluating the training program<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8298, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 68, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is one of the benefits of evaluating a training program?<br />\n    (a) It increases training costs<br />\n    (b) It provides feedback on the trainer\'s performance<br />\n    (c) It reduces the number of training sessions needed<br />\n    (d) It eliminates the need for future training<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8299, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 69, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Fayol\'s principle of \'remuneration of staff\' means what?<br />\n    (a) Providing minimal wages to workers<br />\n    (b) Fair payment for services rendered<br />\n    (c) Maximizing profit margins<br />\n    (d) Offering non-monetary benefits<br />\n<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8300, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 70, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">According to the humanistic theory, what is a basic motivating force?<br />\n    (a) Self-actualization<br />\n    (b) External rewards<br />\n    (c) Observing others<br />\n    (d) Internal instincts<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8301, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 71, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Taylor\'s scientific management aimed to replace what?<br />\n    (a) Emotional management styles<br />\n    (b) Rule-of-thumb methods<br />\n    (c) Bureaucratic structures<br />\n    (d) Traditional management theories<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8302, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 72, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which principle focuses on reducing unnecessary motions in work processes?<br />\n    (a) Taylor\'s scientific management<br />\n    (b) Gilbreth\'s motion study<br />\n    (c) Fayol\'s administrative theory<br />\n    (d) Weber\'s bureaucratic theory<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8303, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 73, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The term \'pleasure principle\' is associated with which component of personality?<br />\n    (a) Id<br />\n    (b) Ego<br />\n    (c) Super ego<br />\n    (d) Consciousness<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8304, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 74, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Fayol\'s principle of \'equity\' emphasizes what?<br />\n    (a) Equal pay for all employees<br />\n    (b) Fairness and justice in treatment<br />\n    (c) Uniformity in tasks<br />\n    (d) Centralization of authority<br />\n<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8305, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 75, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Who emphasized the importance of systematic training for workers?<br />\n<br />\n (a) Weber<br />\n   (b) Taylor<br />\n    (c) Fayol<br />\n    (d) Sheldon<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8306, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 76, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The \'super ego\' develops through what process?<br />\n    (a) Immediate gratification of desires<br />\n    (b) Mediating between id and reality<br />\n    (c) Internalization of societal values<br />\n    (d) Observation of others<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8307, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 77, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Sheldon categorized a person with a slim and fragile body as what?<br />\n    (a) Endomorph<br />\n    (b) Mesomorph<br />\n    (c) Ectomorph<br />\n    (d) None of the above<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8308, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 78, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Fayol\'s principle of \'discipline\' implies what?<br />\n    (a) Flexible work schedules<br />\n    (b) Obedience, application, and respect<br />\n    (c) Minimum supervision<br />\n    (d) Centralized decision-making<br />\n<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8309, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 79, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the aim of conducting a training needs assessment?<br />\n    (a) To determine the training location<br />\n    (b) To identify the gap between current and desired performance<br />\n    (c) To allocate training budgets<br />\n    (d) To schedule training sessions<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8310, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 80, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The concept of \'scalar chain\' in Fayol\'s theory refers to what?<br />\n    (a) Direct communication across all levels<br />\n    (b) Hierarchical structure of authority<br />\n    (c) Decentralization of power<br />\n    (d) Cross-functional teams<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8311, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 81, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Who introduced the concept of \'unity of direction\'?<br />\n    (a) Taylor<br />\n    (b) Weber<br />\n    (c) Fayol<br />\n    (d) Gilbreth<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8312, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 82, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">According to Freud, which component of personality works on the reality principle?<br />\n    (a) Id<br />\n    (b) Ego<br />\n    (c) Super ego<br />\n    (d) Consciousness<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8313, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 83, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a key characteristic of Max Weber\'s ideal bureaucracy?<br />\n    (a) Flexible rules and regulations<br />\n    (b) Impersonal relationships<br />\n    (c) Decentralized authority<br />\n    (d) Informal structures<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8314, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 84, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The principle of \'subordination of individual interests\' by Fayol means what?<br />\n    (a) Individual interests take precedence over organizational goals<br />\n    (b) Organizational interests take precedence over individual goals<br />\n    (c) Personal interests should be ignored<br />\n    (d) Equal importance to personal and organizational goals<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8315, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 85, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the definition of leading in the management process?<br />\nA) Influencing employees to achieve organizational goals<br />\nB) Planning and organizing tasks<br />\nC) Controlling and directing employees<br />\nD) Motivating and inspiring employees<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8316, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 86, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What are the three components of the leading function?<br />\nA) Motivating, influencing, and directing<br />\nB) Motivating, influencing, and forming effective groups<br />\nC) Planning, organizing, and controlling<br />\nD) Leading, managing, and directing<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8317, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 87, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the importance of leadership in an organization?<br />\nA) To maximize efficiency and achieve goals<br />\nB) To minimize errors and reduce costs<br />\nC) To increase productivity and improve quality<br />\nD) To enhance employee satisfaction and morale<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8318, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 88, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the authoritarian leadership style characterized by?<br />\nA) Employee participation and empowerment<br />\nB) Strict control and close supervision<br />\nC) Flexibility and adaptability<br />\nD) Decentralization and delegation<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8319, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 89, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the advantage of authoritarian leadership in emergency situations?<br />\nA) Encourages employee participation<br />\nB) Allows for quick decision-making<br />\nC) Promotes employee empowerment<br />\nD) Enhances employee morale<br />\n<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8320, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 90, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the disadvantage of authoritarian leadership?<br />\nA) Exploitation of employees<br />\nB) Encourages employee participation<br />\nC) Promotes employee empowerment<br />\nD) Enhances employee morale<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8321, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 91, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the participative leadership style characterized by?<br />\nA) Employee participation and empowerment<br />\nB) Strict control and close supervision<br />\nC) Flexibility and adaptability<br />\nD) Decentralization and delegation<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8322, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 92, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the advantage of participative leadership?<br />\nA) Encourages employee participation<br />\nB) Allows for quick decision-making<br />\nC) Promotes employee empowerment<br />\nD) Enhances employee morale<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8323, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 93, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the disadvantage of participative leadership?<br />\nA) Delayed decision-making<br />\nB) Lack of employee participation<br />\nC) Inefficient decision-making<br />\nD) Decreased employee morale<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8324, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 94, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the paternalistic leadership style characterized by?<br />\nA) Treating employees like family members<br />\nB) Strict control and close supervision<br />\nC) Flexibility and adaptability<br />\nD) Decentralization and delegation<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8325, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 95, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the advantage of paternalistic leadership?<br />\nA) Encourages employee loyalty<br />\nB) Allows for quick decision-making<br />\nC) Promotes employee empowerment<br />\nD) Enhances employee morale<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8326, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 96, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the disadvantage of paternalistic leadership?<br />\nA) Favoritism and discrimination<br />\nB) Lack of employee participation<br />\nC) Inefficient decision-making<br />\nD) Decreased employee morale<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8327, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 97, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the laissez-faire leadership style characterized by?<br />\nA) Hands-off approach and employee autonomy<br />\nB) Strict control and close supervision<br />\nC) Flexibility and adaptability<br />\nD) Decentralization and delegation<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8328, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 98, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the advantage of laissez-faire leadership?<br />\nA) Encourages employee autonomy<br />\nB) Allows for quick decision-making<br />\nC) Promotes employee empowerment<br />\nD) Enhances employee morale<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8329, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 99, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the disadvantage of laissez-faire leadership?<br />\nA) Lack of guidance and direction<br />\nB) Delayed decision-making<br />\nC) Inefficient decision-making<br />\nD) Decreased employee morale<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8330, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 100, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">________ is an act of doing things right through the efforts of other people.<br />\nA)  Decision making<br />\nB) Management<br />\nC) Human resources<br />\nD) Training<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8331, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 1, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">All these are refer to as ambulatory care except one <br />\n(a) as medical care provided on a outpatient basis <br />\n(b) as a medical service performed on an outpatient basis without admission to a hospital <br />\n(c)as a service that reduces the use of hospital facilities <br />\n(d) as a service given to patient inside the ambulance before getting tot eh hospital<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8332, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 2, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Long term care services is known as <br />\n(a) deadly diseases <br />\n(b) type off treatment that requires a relative slow course of development and permanent cure is not certain <br />\n(c) treatment that cannot be cure or get solution to the patient problem <br />\n(d) all of the above<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8333, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 3, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The process of admitting patient into the hospital is through <br />\n(a) General Outpatient Department (GOPD) <br />\n(b) accident and emergency <br />\n(c) referral from other hospital <br />\n(d) all of the above <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8334, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 4, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Waiting list is known as _______ <br />\n(a) list of patient waiting for admission to the hospital ward but cannot be admitted immediately for certain reason <br />\n(b) patient that is waiting for doctor during consultation or during visitation in the hospital <br />\n(c) the process of attending to the patient during visitation in the hospital <br />\n(d) the list that comprises all the patient that come to the hospital on daily basis<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8335, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 5, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The process of booking a patient for specific date and time to be seen in the hospital is known as <br />\n(a) patient time book <br />\n(b) schedule of time <br />\n(c) appointment system <br />\n(d) registration of patient <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8336, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 6, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">All these are roles of health information management to the doctor except one <br />\n(a) to educate medical students <br />\n(b) as a tool for medical research and studies <br />\n(c) means of communication <br />\n(d) to determine wages of the doctors <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8337, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 7, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Five major  content of identification of patient are <br />\n(a) patient name, address, age, sex, hospital number <br />\n(b) patient name, doctors identity, next of kin, religion and family background <br />\n(c) patient name, address, marital status , religion, occupation <br />\n(d) all of the above<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8338, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 8, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The major function that patient master index card serve is to <br />\n(a) describe who the patient is <br />\n(b) guarding against duplication of hospital number <br />\n(c) to register patient according to the established criteria <br />\n(d) document patient information <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8339, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 9, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">All this are known as a significant of a referral letter to patient care except one <br />\n(a) means of communication between health institutions for easy continuity of patient care (b) prevent patient from unnecessary medical tests <br />\n(c) it reduce cost of treatment <br />\n(d) all of the above <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00');
INSERT INTO `questions` (`id`, `session1`, `department`, `level`, `semester`, `course`, `exam_type`, `exam_mode`, `exam_category`, `no_of_qst`, `upload_no_of_qst`, `question_type`, `question_no`, `question`, `answer`, `graphic`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(8340, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 10, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The major function of central registration center is to <br />\n(a) receive and welcome patient to the hospital <br />\n(b) to make sure that they help hospital to collect the money from the patient <br />\n(c) control how the patient should be attended to in the hospital <br />\n(d) all of the above <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8341, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 11, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Health record library must be guided in such a way that <br />\n(a) it should be accessible to everybody <br />\n(b) an individual should be able to locate their case file <br />\n(c) unauthorized persons must be prohibited #<br />\n(d) information about the patient must be available to all the users<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8342, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 12, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Function of statistical unit are <br />\n(a) to determine the total number of admission, discahrges and death in the hospital <br />\n(b) control the affairs of all other department in the hospital <br />\n(c) monitor the affairs of the hospital <br />\n(d) oversee the management of the hospital expenses <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8343, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 13, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">All these are advantages of appointment system except one <br />\n(a) preparation of patient is orderly <br />\n(b) the work is spread evenly <br />\n(c) it reduce patient waiting time <br />\n(d) unqualified doctors can attend to the patients <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8344, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 14, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Mislaying is refer to as <br />\n(a) wrong positioning of records <br />\n(b) putting the record inside the cabinet <br />\n(c) arrangement of record on the benches in our hospital instead of putting it inside the cabinet <br />\n(d) none of the above <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8345, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 15, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Filing system is refer to as <br />\n(a) orderly arrangement of folder according to an established method for the purpose of retention and retrieval <br />\n(b) putting the document inside folder for easy accessibility for doctors <br />\n(c) means of showing skill of health record officer in discharging their duty <br />\n(d) method of documentation patient information for future purpose <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8346, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 16, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Two method of appointment system are <br />\n(a) early and lateness system <br />\n(b) block or open and scattered or timed system <br />\n(c) organized and disiorganised system <br />\n(d) booking and unbooked system <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8347, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 17, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">All these are sources of patient for appointment system except one <br />\n(a) patient discharge from hospital ward <br />\n(b) patient from accident and emergency <br />\n(c) patient returning after consultation <br />\n(d) patient that need sick off from their offices <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8348, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 18, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Unit numbering system is known as a means of <br />\n(a) assigned a unique identification number on his first contact with the hospital <br />\n(b) assigned number to patient according to the established criteria <br />\n(c) assigned number in such as way that it can be easily trace <br />\n(d) assigned number to a patient for easy filing in the cabinet <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8349, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 19, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Patient record can be release without their consent on occasion of <br />\n(a) court case <br />\n(b) research and teaching<br />\n(c) outbreak of disease <br />\n(d) all of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8350, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 20, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Electronic health record can be define as <br />\n(a) record that is power by electricity <br />\n(b) record in digital format capable of being shared across different healthcare setting <br />\n(c) record that gives room to be run electronically <br />\n(d) record that allow many people to have access to the means of treating patient <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8351, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 21, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">All these are factors that can hinder implementation of electronic health record except one <br />\n(a) lack of expertise <br />\n(b) epileptic power supply <br />\n(c) insufficient funding <br />\n(d) willingness of the workers <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8352, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 22, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is higher duty in law <br />\n(a) the authority that is high <br />\n(b) serving authority in higher position <br />\n(c) carrying responsibility a higher officer <br />\n(d) legal concept entailing the obligations of one party toward another </p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8353, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 23, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Consent form refer to <br />\n(a) a form signed by a patient prior to a medical procedure to show that patient agree to procedure <br />\n(b) a form that help the patient to receive the treatment when needed <br />\n(c) a form that charge the hospital to comply to the need of the patient <br />\n(d) none of the above <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8354, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 24, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Discharge summary is <br />\n(a) a clinical report prepared by a physician at the end of the treatment <br />\n(b) a report of all investigating in the cause of treatment <br />\n(c) a treatment given to the patient before transfer to another hospital <br />\n(d) a emergency treatment given to the patient by the nurses before the arrival of the doctor </p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8355, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 25, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">All these are functions of health records officers registration board of Nigeria except one <br />\n(a) issuance of certificate and license for practice to members of the profession <br />\n(b) Drafting of training curriculum for health records professionals on training <br />\n(c) conducting examination in health records management <br />\n(d) payment of health record staff at all cadre <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8356, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 26, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The primary objective of keeping health record is for <br />\n(a) evidence of the course of the patients illness and treatment during each hospital admission (b) provides clinical data for use in research and education <br />\n(c) assists in protecting the legal interest of the patient hospital and physician <br />\n(d) all of the above <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8357, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 27, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Functions of hospital management board cover all these except one <br />\n(a) to construct equip maintain and operate clinical procedure <br />\n(b) to provide facilities for diagnostic curative promotional and rehabilitative services in medical treatment<br />\n(c) to make sure that the standard of the treatment and care provided did not fall <br />\n(d) to make sure that patient pay their money as expected in other to receive better treatment in hospital<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8358, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 28, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Medical record committee of hospital comprises of <br />\n(a) chief medical record officer <br />\n(b) nursing services and others that contribute to medical records <br />\n(c) members being appointed by Chief medical director <br />\n(d) all of the above <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8359, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 29, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One of the major disadvantages of waiting list is that <br />\n(a) patient may stay long on list as cases of priority are selected first <br />\n(b) it give patient opportunity to prepare ahead <br />\n(c) it give the picture of patient waiting for the admission <br />\n(d) none of the above <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8360, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 30, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">All these are method of keeping appointment list except one <br />\n(a) visible edge sheet <br />\n(b) use of diaries or register <br />\n(c) loose leaf binding <br />\n(d) given patient their appointment card at the end of clinic sessions <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8361, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 31, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Accident and emergency department operate in hospital <br />\n(a) 8 hourly <br />\n(b) 24 hourly <br />\n(c) morning and night <br />\n(d) as the policy of hospital wish <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8362, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 32, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The primary objective of keeping health record is for <br />\n(a) research purpose <br />\n(b) litigation purpose <br />\n(c) continuity of 0patient care <br />\n(d) for planning and evaluation <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8363, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 33, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Registration in hospital refer to as <br />\n(a) act of maintaining an official list of all patient who have ever come in contact with the hospital <br />\n(b) registration of all patient that come to hospital on daily basis <br />\n(c) act of documenting all patient according to the regulation of the hospital <br />\n(d) all of the above<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8364, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 34, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The major tools that is needed in health record department <br />\n(a) forms <br />\n(b) case not <br />\n(c) register <br />\n(d) continuation sheet <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8365, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 35, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Major thing to be consider when designing health records form is<br />\n(a) the purpose of the form is to serve <br />\n(b) the doctors that are going to make use of the form <br />\n(c) the nurses that will make use of the form in the ward <br />\n(d) none of the above <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8366, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 36, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Clinic based records refer to <br />\n(a) record use during the time of follow-up <br />\n(b) record maintained at the bedside of a patient <br />\n(c) record of the activities carried out on the patient on each visit which can be used for statistical purpose <br />\n(d) none of the above <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8367, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 37, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Mislaying in records department refer to <br />\n(a) wrong arrangement of folder which contradict the adopted method of filing <br />\n(b) wrong positioning of record inside the cabinet the record can the turned to the other side (c) arrangement of all record from all the clinics at a particular place<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8368, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 38, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The method whereby a unique identification number is assigned to a patient on his first contact in the hospital is known as <br />\n(a) unique identifier number <br />\n(b) monitoring of patient number<br />\n(c) unit numbering system <br />\n(d) means of identification <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8369, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 39, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">All these are section within health record department except one <br />\n(a) health record library<br />\n(b) nursing station <br />\n(c) central registration center <br />\n(d) coding section <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8370, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 40, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">One of the major benefit of patient master name index card is <br />\n(a) to give room for expert to handle patient card <br />\n(b) to guide against duplication of hospital number <br />\n(c) to know if patient is coming regularly to the clinic <br />\n(d) for doctor to handle patient case promptly <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8371, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 41, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Five personal means of identification of patient are <br />\n(a) name of attending physician, patient name, phone number, age , sex <br />\n(b) patient name, address, hospital number, age, sex <br />\n(c) patient name, name of next of kin, marital status, age, address <br />\n(d) all of the above <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8372, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 42, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Things to consider in setting health record department in a newly hospital <br />\n(a) site and location <br />\n(b) the activities to be carried out in the hospital <br />\n(c) the equipment needed <br />\n(d) all of the above <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8373, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 43, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">All these are sources of patients for appointment except one <br />\n(a) patient returning after consultation for further appointment <br />\n(b) patient discharge from the hospital ward <br />\n(c) patient from accident and emergency <br />\n(d) patient that is not satisfied by the treatment given <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8374, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 44, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Privacy in health record means <br />\n(a) keeping secret with your doctor in relating to your family history <br />\n(b) right and freedom on individual patient to have their personal information safe from third parties <br />\n(c) maintain privacy with patient during the course of treatment <br />\n(d) all of the above <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8375, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 45, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Advantage of electronic health record <br />\n(a) it facilitate rapid covering of many task <br />\n(b) it enhance accuracy <br />\n(c) it reduce medical error <br />\n(d) all of the above <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8376, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 46, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Hindrance to electronics health record in Nigeria can be traced to <br />\n(a) lack of expertise <br />\n(b) poor power supply <br />\n(c) political instability <br />\n(d) all of the above <br />\n<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8377, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 47, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">MAR refers to  <br />\nA. Medical allergies required<br />\nB. Medication administration record<br />\nC. Medication and allergies record<br />\nD. Medical alert record<br />\n<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8378, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 48, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Identification sheet refers to<br />\nA. The initial patient intake history form<br />\nB. Part of a body diagram, such as when there has been a facial laceration<br />\nC. Information collected by the admitting or triage nurse<br />\nD. Registration columns for patient?s information <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8379, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 49, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following does not belong to the others?<br />\nA. Progress notes<br />\nB. Visit summary<br />\nC. Surgical outpatient note<br />\nD. Interdisciplinary progress notes<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8380, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 50, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">In which of these records would you not find physician documentation?<br />\nA. Triage<br />\nB. Identification Sheet<br />\nC. Laboratory result<br />\nD. All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8381, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 51, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the role of the Health Information Management (HIM) professional in the Medical Record Department.<br />\nA.  Patient diagnosis and treatment <br />\nB. Coding and classifying medical records<br />\nC. Managing hospital finances<br />\nD. Cleaning and maintaining hospital facilities<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8382, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 52, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is NOT a type of patient record commonly found in the Medical Record Department<br />\nA. Electronic Health Record (HER) <br />\nB. Paper-based record<br />\nC. Video recordings of patient consultations<br />\nD. Radiology images<br />\n<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8383, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 53, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">In the context of medical record confidentiality, what does ?HIPAA? stand for<br />\nA. Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act <br />\nB. Hospital Information Privacy and Access Act<br />\nC. Healthcare Information Protection and Administration Act<br />\nD. Hospital Inpatient Privacy and Access Act. <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8384, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 54, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the purpose of medical coding in the Medical Record Department<br />\nA. Assigning alphanumeric codes to medical procedures and diagnoses & storing paper records in alphabetical order <br />\nB. Scheduling patient appointments<br />\nC. Creating patient treatment plans<br />\nD. All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8385, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 55, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the term for the process of reviewing medical records to ensure accuracy and completeness?<br />\nA. Documentation <br />\nB. Coding <br />\nC. Auditing<br />\nD. Billing<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8386, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 56, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is an advantage of using Electronic Health Records (EHRs) in the Medical Record Department?<br />\nA. Lower cost  <br />\nB. Enhanced security<br />\nC. Improved accessibility<br />\nD. Limited data storage capacity<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8387, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 57, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The primary purpose of a medical record is to _______________ information about a patient?s medical history and treatment.<br />\nA. Document  <br />\nB. Supplement<br />\nC. Recognize <br />\nD. Identify <br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8388, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 58, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The process of organizing, storing, and retrieving medical records is known as _______________<br />\nA. Medical record sorting <br />\nB. Medical record microfilming<br />\nC. Medical record management <br />\nD. Records organization <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8389, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 59, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act (HIPAA) ensures the _______________ of patient medical records.<br />\nA. Medical record guideline <br />\nB. Privacy and security <br />\nC. Monitoring and evaluation<br />\nD. None of the above</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8390, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 60, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The release of patient information to individuals or entities not involved in the patient?s care typically requires a signed _______________ from the patient.<br />\nA. Agreement <br />\nB. Conclusion <br />\nC. Authorization <br />\nD. Confidentiality <br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8391, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 61, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">A _______________ is a document that summarizes a patient?s stay in the hospital, including diagnoses, procedures, and outcomes.<br />\nA. Progress note<br />\nB. Discharge summary <br />\nC. Drug chart <br />\nD. All of the above <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8392, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 62, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">A _______________ is a standardized classification system used to code medical diagnoses and procedures for billing and statistical purposes. <br />\nA. coding system <br />\nB. statistical system<br />\nC. Filing system <br />\nD. All of the above <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8393, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 63, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Which of the following is not a driving force for the adoption of the electronic health record?<br />\nA. Lower healthcare costs<br />\nB. Improved Joint Commission scores<br />\nC. Fragmented clinical data across the different healthcare settings<br />\nD. Reduce incorrect diagnosis<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8394, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 64, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary use of clinical documentation?<br />\nA. communication regarding a patient?s condition and decisions about how to treat the patient.<br />\nB. increased reimbursement from insurers.<br />\nC. historical research. <br />\nD. risk management assessment and legal justification of care. <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8395, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 65, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\"> How does clinical documentation support evidence-based medicine?<br />\nA. evidence is required for the discovery period in legal proceedings.<br />\nB. good data regarding patient care is based on a foundation of high-quality clinical documentation.<br />\nC. evidence-based medicine requires seven aspects of documentation.<br />\nD. only care provided in research requires evidence-based care plans. <br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8396, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 66, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is quality documentation?<br />\nA.  The responsibility of the attending physician.<br />\nB.  A product of clinical providers, CDI professionals, and coding staff working together.<br />\nC.  It can only be achieved through an electronic record.<br />\nD.  It requires a structured data format. <br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8397, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 67, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary goal of financial management in healthcare organizations?<br />\n     A. Maximizing revenue<br />\n    B. Providing quality patient care<br />\n    C. Reducing risk management <br />\n    D. Maximizing shareholder value<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8398, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 68, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Healthcare reimbursement rates are the same across all payers, including private insurance and government programs.<br />\nA.True  <br />\nB.False <br />\nC. Non of the above <br />\nD. Not sure <br />\n<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8399, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 69, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">All these are refer to as ambulatory care except one <br />\n(a) as medical care provided on a outpatient basis <br />\n(b) as a medical service performed on an outpatient basis without admission to a hospital <br />\n(c)as a service that reduces the use of hospital facilities <br />\n(d) as a service given to patient inside the ambulance before getting tot eh hospital  </p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8400, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 70, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The process of assigning numeric or alphanumeric codes to medical diagnoses, procedures, and services is known as <br />\nA. Medical imaging <br />\nB. Medical recording  <br />\nC. Medical coding <br />\nE. Medical expression <br />\n<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8401, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 71, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the main goal of storing and retrieving patients\' information in healthcare management?<br />\n(A) To ensure data availability<br />\n(B) To protect patients\' privacy<br />\n(C) To support high-quality care and respect patients\' trust<br />\n(D) To conduct research<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8402, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 72, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What type of records are used to store patients\' information?<br />\n(A) Electronic Health Records (EHRs) only<br />\n(B) Paper-based records only<br />\n(C) Both EHRs and paper-based records<br />\n(D) None of the above<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8403, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 73, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What measure is taken to prevent data breaches or loss?<br />\n(A) Encryption <br />\n(B) Access controls<br />\n(C) Backups<br />\n(D) All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8404, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 74, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Who can access patients\' information for legitimate purposes?<br />\n(A) Authorized healthcare professionals<br />\n(B) Un authorized healthcare professionals<br />\n(C) Patients\' family members<br />\n(D) Researchers<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8405, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 75, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is an example of indirect care?<br />\n(A) Diagnosis<br />\n(B) Treatment<br />\n(C) Research<br />\n(D) Care coordination<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8406, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 76, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What should be established to ensure secure data retrieval?<br />\n(A) Clear access controls<br />\n(B) Strong authentication processes<br />\n(C) Both A and B<br />\n(D) None of the above<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8407, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 77, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Why should patients\' information be regularly reviewed and updated?<br />\n(A) To ensure data accuracy and relevance<br />\n(B) To protect patients\' privacy<br />\n(C) To support research<br />\n(D) To conduct audits<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8408, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 78, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary goal of patient identification in healthcare?<br />\n(A) To ensure patient safety<br />\n(B) To facilitate communication among healthcare providers<br />\n(C) To maintain patient confidentiality<br />\n(D) To track patient outcomes<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8409, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 79, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the significance of complete and accurate documentation in healthcare?<br />\n(A) It ensures effective care and informed decision-making<br />\n(B) It facilitates communication among healthcare providers<br />\n(C) It maintains patient confidentiality<br />\n(D) It tracks patient outcomes<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8410, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 80, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the purpose of clear documentation in healthcare?<br />\n(A) To ensure patient safety<br />\n(B) To facilitate communication among healthcare providers<br />\n(C) To maintain patient confidentiality<br />\n(D) To track patient outcomes<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8411, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 81, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the legal requirement for documentation in healthcare?<br />\n(A) HIPAA<br />\n(B) Medicare<br />\n(C) Medicaid<br />\n(D) OSHA<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8412, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 82, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the benefit of documentation in healthcare quality improvement?<br />\n(A) It tracks patient outcomes<br />\n(B) It identifies trends<br />\n(C) It improves healthcare services<br />\n(D) All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8413, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 83, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the role of documentation in billing and insurance purposes?<br />\n(A) To ensure fair reimbursement<br />\n(B) To track patient outcomes<br />\n(C) To identify trends<br />\n(D) To maintain patient confidentiality<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8414, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 84, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How does documentation contribute to medical research?<br />\n(A) By tracking patient outcomes<br />\n(B) By identifying trends<br />\n(C) By developing new treatments<br />\n(D) By improving healthcare practices<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8415, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 85, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the impact of documentation on patient engagement?<br />\n(A) It empowers patients to take an active role in their care<br />\n(B) It maintains patient confidentiality<br />\n(C) It tracks patient outcomes<br />\n(D) It identifies trends<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8416, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 86, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the ultimate goal of patient identification and documentation in healthcare?<br />\n(A) To ensure patient safety and deliver high-quality care<br />\n(B) To maintain patient confidentiality<br />\n(C) To track patient outcomes<br />\n(D) To identify trends<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8417, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 87, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the consequence of inaccurate documentation in healthcare?<br />\n(A) Patient harm and errors<br />\n(B) Ineffective care<br />\n(C) Poor communication<br />\n(D) All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8418, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 88, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the purpose of patient identification in healthcare?<br />\n(A) To ensure patient safety<br />\n(B) To facilitate communication<br />\n(C) To maintain confidentiality<br />\n(D) To bill insurance<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8419, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 89, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the benefit of accurate documentation in healthcare?<br />\n(A) It ensures patient safety<br />\n(B) It facilitates communication<br />\n(C) It maintains confidentiality<br />\n(D) All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8420, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 90, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the role of healthcare providers in patient identification and documentation?<br />\n(A) To ensure accurate identification and documentation<br />\n(B) To facilitate communication<br />\n(C) To maintain confidentiality<br />\n(D) To bill insurance<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8421, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 91, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What are Electronic Health Records (EHRs)?<br />\n(A) Paper-based medical charts<br />\n(B) Digital versions of patients\' medical charts<br />\n(C) Medical history documents<br />\n(D) Patient identification records<br />\n</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8422, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 92, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is the primary goal of EHRs?<br />\n(A) To reduce medical errors<br />\n(B) To improve patient outcomes<br />\n(C) To enhance coordination and communication among healthcare providers<br />\n(D) To facilitate research and analytics<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8423, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 93, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What information is included in EHRs? (Select all that apply)<br />\n(A) Patient demographics<br />\n(B) Medical history<br />\n(C) Test results<br />\n(D) All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8424, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 94, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a key feature of EHRs?<br />\n(A) Secure messaging<br />\n(B) Data analytics<br />\n(C) Medication management<br />\n(D) All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8425, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 95, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">Where are EHRs used?<br />\n(A) Hospitals only<br />\n(B) Clinics only<br />\n(C) Various healthcare settings<br />\n(D) Physician practices only<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8426, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 96, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">How are EHRs accessed?<br />\n(A) Through computers only<br />\n(B) Through mobile devices only<br />\n(C) Through computers, tablets, or mobile devices<br />\n(D) Through paper-based records<br />\n</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8427, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 97, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a benefit of EHRs?<br />\n(A) Reduced medical errors<br />\n(B) Improved patient outcomes<br />\n(C) Enhanced coordination and communication<br />\n           (D) All of the above<br />\n</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8428, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 98, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a feature of EHRs that facilitates patient engagement?<br />\n(A) Patient education tools<br />\n(B) Secure messaging<br />\n(C) Clinical notes <br />\n(D) Medication management<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8429, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 99, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a security measure used to protect EHRs?<br />\n(A) Robust security measures<br />\n(B) Password protection only<br />\n(C) Encryption only<br />\n(D) Firewalls only<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8430, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'HEALTH RECORD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 100, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">What is a potential use of EHRs beyond patient care?<br />\n(A) Research and analytics<br />\n(B) Patient education<br />\n(C) Medication management<br />\n(D) Secure messaging<br />\n</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8431, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'ICD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 1, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">??????????? is  unsuitable  for  statistical  analysis  and  research because  of  their  presentation  and  it  is  not  arranged  in  a special order. (a) ICD-9 (b) Data classification (c) ICD-10<br />\n(d) Nomenclature.</p>', 'D', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8432, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'ICD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 2, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">?????????????is a method base on one axis of classification. (a) Dual  axial  method  (b)  Uni-axial  method  (c)  Multi-axial method (d) Bio-axial method.</p>', 'B', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
(8433, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'ICD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 3, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The code marked with dagger (+), is positioned in the part of the classification in which the diagnostic description is located according to normal ICD principle, which means the code relating to???????????????(a) Underlying Disease (b)<br />\nManifestation of Disease (c) Complication of Disease (d) Secondary code.</p>', 'A', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00');
