(8434, '2024/2025', 'ND Health Information Management', 'NDII', 'First', 'ICD', 'PREPARATORY', 'OBJECTIVE', 'GENERAL', 100, 100, 'text', 4, '<p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Arial;\">The International Statistical Classification of Disease and Health Related problem is classified into???????????volumes<br />\n(a) 2 (b) 4 (c) 3 (d) 5.</p>', 'C', 'blank.jpg', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
